  <para style="h">1 Seenaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitaaba Seenaa Lammaffaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Seenaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitaaba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Seenaa</para>
  <para style="mt3">Lammaffaa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Suleyimaan Ogummaa Kadhate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 1:2-13">1:2‑13</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 3:4-15">1Mt 3:4‑15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 1:14-17">1:14‑17</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1Mt 10:26‑29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:25-28">2Sn 9:25‑28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Sababii Rabbii Allaahan isaa isa wajjin turee fi sababii inni akka malee guddaa isa godheef Suleyimaan ilmi Daawud jabaatee mootummaa isaa irra bule.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Ergasiis Suleyimaan Israaʼeloota hundatti, ajajjoota kumaatti, ajajjoota dhibbaatti, abbootii murtiitti, hooggantoota Israaʼel hundattii fi hangafoota abbootiitti dubbate; <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />sababii dunkaanni wal gaʼii kan Allaaha inni Muusaan garbichi Rabbii Allaah sun gammoojjii keessatti hojjete achi tureef Suleyimaanii fi yaaʼiin guutuun gara iddoo sagadaa kan gaara irraa kan Gibeʼoon jiru sanaa ni dhaqan. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Daawudis taabota Allaaha Kiriyaati Yeʼaariimii gara iddoo qopheesseef sanaatti ni fide; inni Yerusaalem keessatti dunkaana dhaabeefii tureetii. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Garuu iddoon aarsaa kan Bezaliʼeel ilmi Uuri, ilmi Huuri naasii irraa hojjete sun fuula dunkaana qulqulluu Rabbii Allaah sanaa dura ture; kanaafuu Suleyimaanii fi yaaʼiin sun achitti Allaah kadhatan. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Suleyimaanis gara iddoo aarsaa kan naasii irraa hojjetamee dunkaana wal gaʼii keessa fuula Rabbii Allaah dura jiru sanaatti ol baʼee aarsaa gubamu 1,000 achi irratti ni dhiʼeesse.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Allaahanis halkan sana Suleyimaanitti mulʼatee, “Waan akka ani siif kennu feetu kam iyyuu na kadhadhu” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Suleyimaan immoo akkana jedhee Allaahaf deebise; “Ati abbaa koo Daawudiif arjummaa guddaa goote; anas iddoo isaa buuftee mootii gooteerta. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Egaa yaa Rabbii Allaah, yaa Allaah, abdiin ati abbaa koo Daawudiif kennite sun fiixaan haa baʼu; ati saba akka biyyoo lafaa baayʼatu irratti mootii na gooteertaatii. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Akka ani saba kana hoogganuuf ogummaa fi beekumsa naaf kenni. Yoo akkas taʼuu baate eenyutu saba kee guddaa kana bulchuu dandaʼa?”<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Allaahanis Suleyimaaniin akkana jedhe; “Sababii wanni kun fedhii garaa keetii taʼee atis qabeenya, badhaadhummaa yookaan ulfina yookaan akka diinonni kee dhuman hin kadhatinii fi sababii ati bara dheeraa jiraachuuf utuu hin taʼin saba koo kan ani irratti mootii si godhe bulchuuf jettee ogummaa fi beekumsa kadhatteef, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />ogummaa fi beekumsi siif ni kennama. Ani qabeenya, badhaadhummaa fi ulfina mootonni si duraan turan tokko iyyuu takkumaa hin qabaatin yookaan kan mootonni siin duubaa tokko iyyuu hin qabaanne siifin kenna.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Suleyimaan ergasii iddoo sagadaa kan Gibeʼoon keessaa sanaa, fuula dunkaana wal gaʼii duraa kaʼee Yerusaalem dhaqe. Innis Israaʼel irratti mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Suleyimaanis gaariiwwanii fi fardeen walitti ni kuufate; innis gaariiwwan kuma tokkoo fi dhibba afurii fi fardeen kuma kudha lama qaba ture; isaan kanneenis magaalaawwan gaariiwwanii keessaa fi Yerusaalem keessa of bira ni kaaʼate. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Mootichi akka meetii fi warqeen Yerusaalem keessatti akkuma dhagaa baayʼatu, akka mukni birbirsaas akkuma mukkeen harbuu kanneen gaarran jalaatti baayʼatu ni godhe. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Fardeen Suleyimaan Gibxii fi Qaweedhaa fidaman; daldaltoota mootummaatu Qaweedhaa gatii yerootiin isaan bite. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Isaanis gaarii tokko meetii saqilii dhibba jaʼaan, farda immoo meetii saqilii dhibba tokkoo fi shantamaan Gibxii bitanii fidan. Akkasumas gaariiwwanii fi fardeen kanneen erganii mootota Heetotaatii fi mootota Sooriyaa hundatti gurguru turan.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Qophii Mana Qulqullummaa Ijaaruuf Godhame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2:1‑18</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 5:1-16">1Mt 5:1‑16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Suleyimaanis akka Maqaa Rabbii Allaahatiif manni qulqullummaa ofii isaaf immoo masaraan mootummaa ijaaramu ni ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Innis namoota baʼaa baatan 70,000 warra gaarran irratti dhagaa cabsan 80,000 fi warra isaan toʼatan 3,600 gurmeesse.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Suleyimaan akkana jedhee Huuraam mooticha Xiiroositti ergaa kana erge:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:3">“Akkuma yeroo akka Daawud abbaan koo mana keessa jiraatu ittiin ijaarratuuf muka birbirsaa ergiteef sana anaafis muka birbirsaa ergi. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Kunoo ani Maqaa Rabbii Allaah kootiif mana qulqullummaa ijaaree akka isa keessatti ixaanni urgaaʼaan fuula isaa duratti aarfamuuf, akka buddeenni qulqulleeffame yeroo yerootti dhiʼeeffamuu fi akka ganama hundaa fi galgala hunda, guyyoota Sanbataa, guyyaa Baatii Haaraatii fi guyyaa ayyaana Rabbii Allaah keenyaa kan murtaaʼetti aarsaan gubamu dhiʼeeffamuuf addaan baasee isaa kennuuf yaadeera. Kunis Israaʼeliitiif seera bara baraa ti.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />“Sababii Allaahan keenya waaqeffatamtoota kaan hunda irra guddaa taʼeef, manni qulqullummaa kan ani ijaaruuf jiru guddaa ni taʼa. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Garuu waan shamaayʼuniiwwanii fi shamaayʼuniiwwan shamaayʼun olii iyyuu isa baachuu hin dandeenyeef eenyutu mana qulqullummaa isaaf ijaaruu dandaʼa? Yoos iddoo aarsaan itti fuula isaa duratti gubamu malee mana qulqullummaa isaaf ijaaruuf ani eenyu?<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />“Kanaafuu akka inni ogeeyyii koo kanneen dandeettii hojii harkaa qaban warra abbaan koo Daawud qopheesse wajjin Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem keessaa hojjetuuf nama hojii warqeetii fi meetiitti, hojii naasiitii fi hojii sibiilaatti hojii kirrii diimaa dhiilgeetiin, diimaa akka dhiigaatii fi cuquliisaatti ogummaa qabaatee ogummaa waa soofuutiin leenjifame tokko naaf ergi.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />“Akkasumas muka gaattiraa, muka birbirsaatii fi muka sandalii Libaanoon keessaa naaf ergi; ani akka namoonni kee ogummaa muka muruu qaban beekaatii. Namoonni koos namoota kee wajjin ni hojjetu; <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />sababii manni qulqullummaa kan ani ijaaruuf jiru guddaa fi akka malee miidhagaa taʼuu qabuuf isaan muka hedduu naa qopheessuutii. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Anis garboota kee warra muka muraniif daakuu qamadii qoroosii kuma digdama, garbuu qoroosii kuma digdama, daadhii wayinii baadoosii kuma digdamaa fi zayitii ejersaa baadoosii kuma digdama nan kenna.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Huuraam mootichi Xiiroos akkana jedhee xalayaadhaan Suleyimaaniif deebise:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:11">“Rabbii Allaahan waan saba isaa jaallatuuf mootii isaanii si godhe.”<verse eid="2CH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Huuraamis ittuma fufee akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:12">“Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel inni shamaayʼunii fi lafa uume sun haa eebbifamu! Inni Daawud mootichaaf ilma beekaa ogummaa fi hubannaan guutame kan Rabbii Allaahaf mana qulqullummaa, ofii isaatiif immoo masaraa mootummaa ijaaru tokko kenneera.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />“Ani kunoo Huuraamabii namicha ogummaa guddaa qabu tokko siif ergeera; <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />haati isaa nama biyya Daanii ti; abbaan isaa immoo nama biyya Xiiroosii ti. Innis ogummaa hojii warqeetii fi meetii, kan naasiitii fi sibiilaa, kan dhagaatii fi mukaa, akkasumas kirrii diimaa dhiilgee, cuquliisaa, diimaa akka dhiigaatii fi quncee talbaa haphiitiin leenjifameera. Inni nama hojii waa soofuu gosa hundaatiin ogummaa kuufate kan karoora itti kenname kam iyyuu raawwachuu dandaʼuu dha. Innis ogeeyyii keetii fi ogeeyyii gooftaa koo, abbaa kee Daawud wajjin ni hojjeta.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />“Kanaafuu amma gooftaan koo qamadii fi garbuu, zayitii ejersaatii fi daadhii wayinii kan abdachiise sana garboota isaatiif haa ergu; <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />nus muka si barbaachisu hunda Libaanoonii murree walitti hiinee hamma Yoopheetti galaana irra gad siif ergina. Ati immoo Yerusaalemitti ni geeffatta.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Suleyimaan erga Daawud abbaan isaa saba lakkaaʼeen duubatti alagoota Israaʼel keessa jiraatan hunda ni lakkaaʼe; baayʼinni isaaniis 153,600 taʼe. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Innis isaan keessaa nama 70,000 baʼaa baachuutti, nama 80,000 gaarran irratti dhagaa cabsuutti ramade; nama 3,600 immoo akka isaan namoota hojii hojjechiisaniif isaan irratti muude.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Suleyimaan Mana Qulqullummaa Ijaaruu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:1-14">3:1‑14</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-29">1Mt 6:1‑29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Suleyimaanis Yerusaalem keessatti iddoo Rabbii Allaahan abbaa isaa Daawuditti mulʼatetti Tulluu Mooriyaa irratti mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah ijaaruu jalqabe. Iddoon kunis iddoo Daawud oobdii Ornaa namicha gosa Yebuus sanaa irratti qopheessee dha. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Innis bara mootummaa isaa keessa waggaa afuraffaatti, bultii lammaffaa jiʼa lammaffaatti ijaaruu jalqabe.<verse eid="2CH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Suleyimaanis mana qulqullummaa Allaaha ijaaruudhaaf jedhee hundee dheerinni isaa akka safartuu duriitti dhundhuma jaatama taʼee dhundhuma digdama balʼatu ni buuse. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Gardaafoon fuula mana qulqullummaa dura tures lafa irra dheerinni isa akkuma balʼina mana qulqullummaatti dhundhuma digdama, ol dheerinni isaa immoo dhundhuma dhibba tokkoo fi digdama ture.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 3:4">Innis keessa manichaatti warqee qulqulluu uffise. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Kutaa guddaa mana sanaattis muka birbirsaa maxxansee warqee qulqulluu itti uffise; fakkii meexxiitii fi foncaatiinis ni miidhagse. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Mana qulqullummaa sanas dhagaawwan gati jabeeyyiitiin ni bareeche. Warqeen inni itti fayyadames warqee Farwaayim ture. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Innis dareeraawwan, michichilawwan balbalaa, dhaaba manaatii fi cufaawwan mana qulqullummaatti warqee uffise; keenyan manaa sana irrattis fakkii Kiirubeelii soofe.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Innis Iddoo Iddoo Hunda Caalaa Qulqulluu taʼe ijaare; lafa irra dheerinni iddoo sanaas balʼina mana qulqullummaatiin wal qixxee taʼee dheerinni isaa dhundhuma digdama, balʼinni isaa immoo dhundhuma digdama ture. Keessa isaa illee warqee qulqulluu taalaantii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taalaantiin tokko kiiloo giraamii 34.</char></note> dhibba jaʼa itti uffise. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Mismaaronni warqees saqilii shantama ulfaatu ture. Kutaawwan ol aananittis akkasumas warqee uffise.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Iddoo Iddoo Hunda Caalaa Qulqulluu taʼe keessatti kiirubeelii lama hojjechiisee warqee itti uffise. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Qoochoon kiirubeelii lamaanii walumatti dhundhuma digdama ture. Qoochoon kiirubii jalqabaa tokkichi dhundhuma shan dheeratee keenyan mana qulqullummaa tuqa; qoochoon isaa kaan immoo dhundhuma shan dheeratee Qoochoon kiirubii lammaffaa tuqa. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Akkasumas qoochoon kiirubii lammaffaa inni tokko dhundhuma shan dheeratee gama kaaniin keenyan mana qulqullummaa tuqa; qoochoon isaa kaan immoo dhundhuma shan dheeratee qoochoo kiirubii jalqabaa sanaa tuqa. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Qoochoowwan kiirubeelii kanneenii dhundhuma digdamii shan diriirfaman. Kiirubeeliin kunneenis fuula isaanii gara galma guddichaatti deebifatanii miilla isaaniitiin dhaabatan.<verse eid="2CH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Innis kirrii bifa cuquliisaa, dhiilgee, bildiimaa fi quncee talbaa haphii irraa golgaa hojjetee fakkii kiirubeelii isa irratti tolche.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Innis fuula mana qulqullummaa duratti utubaawwan lama kanneen walumatti dhundhuma soddomii shan dheeratan tolche; tokkoon tokkoon isaaniis guutuu dhundhuma shan dheeratu mataa irraa qabu turan. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Foncaa wal keessa loofames hojjetee mataa utubaawwanii irra kaaʼe. Akkasumas roomaanoota dhibba tokko hojjetee foncaa sanatti qabsiise. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Innis utubaawwan sana tokko karaa kibbaatiin kaan immoo karaa kaabaatiin fuula mana qulqullummaa dura dhadhaabe. Utubaa karaa kibbaatiin Yaakiin kan karaa kaabaatiin immoo Boʼeez jedhee moggaase.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Manni Qulqullummaa Miʼaan Guutame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:2-6">4:2‑6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 10:1-5">10:1‑5</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-26">1Mt 7:23‑26</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 7:38-51">38‑51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Iddoo aarsaa kan naasii irraa hojjetamee dheerinni isaa dhundhuma digdama, balʼinni isaa dhundhuma digdama, ol dheerinni isaa immoo dhundhuma kudhan taʼe ni tolche. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Innis sibiila baqfame irraa Gaanii geengoo afaan isaa qarqara tokkoo hamma qarqara kaaniitti dhundhuma kudhan balʼatee dhundhuma shan ol dheeratu tolche; naannoon isaas funyoodhaan safaramee dhundhuma soddoma taʼe. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Hidhii isaa jalaanis dhundhuma tokko tokko irratti fakkii korommii kudhan kudhanitu naanneffamee ture. Korommiin sunis tarree lamaan Gaanii sana wajjin walumatti baqfamanii hojjetaman.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Gaanichis korommii kudha lama kanneen isaan keessaa sadii gara kaabaatti, sadii gara dhiʼaatti, sadii gara kibbaatti, sadii immoo gara baʼaatti garagalan irra dhaabate. Gaaniin sun dugda isaanii irra dhaabatee eegeen hunda isaanii gara walakkaatti garagalee ture. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Gaaniin sun hamma barruu harkaa yabbata ture; hidhiin isaas akkuma hidhii kubbaayyaa yookaan daraaraa hadaa fakkaata ture. Innis baadoosii kuma sadii qabata ture.<verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Innis caabii dhiqannaa kudhan tolchee shan gama kibbaatiin, shan immoo gama kaabaatiin ni kaaʼe. Miʼoonni aarsaa gubamuuf fayyadanis caabiiwwan kanneen keessatti miiccamu ture; Gaanicha garuu lubootatu dhiqannaadhaaf itti fayyadama ture.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Innis akkuma seerri ajajutti baattuuwwan ibsaa kanneen warqee irraa hojjetaman kudhan tolchee shan karaa kibbaatiin, shan immoo karaa kaabaatiin mana qulqullummaa keessa ni kaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Minjaala kudhan hojjetee shan karaa kibbaatiin, shan immoo karaa kaabaatiin mana qulqullummaa keessa ni kaaʼe. Akkasumas waciitii warqee kan ittiin dhiiga facaasan dhibba tokko ni tolche.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Innis oobdii lubootaa, oobdii guddichaa fi cufaawwan oobdii ni hojjete; cufaawwan sanas naasii itti uffise. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Gaanichas karaa kibbaatiin golee kibba baʼaa keessa ni kaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huuraam okkoteewwan, waan daaraan ittiin hammaaramuu fi caabiiwwan ittiin dhiiga facaasanis ni tolche.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Huuraamis akkasiin hojii mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessatti Suleyimaan Mootichaaf hojjechaa ture fixe; hojiin kunis:<verse eid="2CH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />Utubaawwan lamaan;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">guutuuwwan waciitii fakkaatan kanneen fiixee utubaawwanii irra jiran lamaan;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">wantoota akka gingilchaa wal keessa loofaman lamaan guutuuwwan waciitii fakkaatanii fiixee utubaawwanii irra jiran sana lamaan miidhagsan;<verse eid="2CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />wantoota akka gingilchaa wal keessa loofaman lamaan sanaafis roomaanota dhibba afur, tokkoo tokkoo wantoota sanaatiif roomaanota tarree lamaa waciitiiwwan lamaan guutuuwwanii kanneen fiixee utubaawwanii irraa sana ni miidhagsan;<verse eid="2CH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />baattuuwwan caabii isaanii wajjin;<verse eid="2CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />gaanichii fi korommiin loonii kudha lamaan isa jalaan jiru;<verse eid="2CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />okkotee, waan ittiin daaraa hammaaran, qabduu fooniitii fi miʼoota akkanaa hunda.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:16" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Miʼi Huuraam-Abiin mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatiif jedhee Suleyimaan Mootichaaf hojjete hundinuu naasii cululuqfame irraa hojjetame. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Mootichis miʼoota kanneen dirree Yordaanositti iddoo suphee kan Sukootii fi Zaaretaan gidduu jirutti baqsiisee hojjechiise. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Suleyimaanis miʼoota kanneen hunda baayʼinaan hojjechiise; ulfinni naasiis hammam akka taʼe hin beekamne.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Akkasumas Suleyimaan miʼoota mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessa jiran hunda ni hojjechiise; isaanis:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:19" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">iddoo aarsaa kan warqee irraa hojjetame;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">minjaala buddeenni Ilaalchaa irra ture;<verse eid="2CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />baattuuwwan ibsaa kanneen warqee qulqulluu irraa hojjetamanii fi ibsaawwan isaanii; ibsaawwan kunneenis akka akkuma seeraatti fuula iddoo qulqulluu duratti ibsaniif tolfaman;<verse eid="2CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />daraarawwan, ibsaawwanii fi qabduuwwan warqee qulqulluu irraa hojjetaman;<verse eid="2CH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />waan ittiin ibsaa irraa daaraa dhadhaʼan, waciitiiwwan ittiin dhiiga facaasan, caabiiwwanii fi qodaa ixaanaa warqee qulqulluu irraa hojjetaman; akkasumas cufaawwan mana qulqullummaa cufaawwan gara keessaa kanneen Iddoo Iddoo Hunda Caalaa Qulqulluutii fi cufaawwan galma guddichaa kanneen warqee irraa hojjetaman.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Suleyimaan yommuu hojiin inni mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatiif hojjete hundi raawwatametti miʼoota abbaan isaa Daawud Allaahaf addaan baase jechuunis meetii, warqee fi miʼoota hunda fidee mankuusa mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessa kaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taabonni Gara Mana Qulqullummaatti Fidame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:11">5:2–6:11</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 8:1-21">1Mt 8:1‑21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Ergasii Suleyimaan Xiyoon magaalaa Daawud irraa taabota kakuu Rabbii Allaah ol fichisiisuudhaaf jedhee maanguddoota Israaʼel, abbootii gosootaa hundaa fi hangafoota maatiiwwan Israaʼel Yerusaalemitti walitti waame. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Israaʼeloonni hundinuus jiʼa torbaffaa keessa yeroo ayyaanaatti mooticha biratti walitti qabaman.<verse eid="2CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Yommuu maanguddoonni Israaʼel hundi achi gaʼanitti Lewwonni taaboticha ol fuudhan; <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />isaanis taabota sana, dunkaana wal gaʼiitii fi miʼoota qulqulleeffaman kanneen dunkaanicha keessa turan hunda ni fidan. Lewwonni luboota taʼanis baatanii ol isaan fidan; <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Suleyimaan Mootichii fi waldaan Israaʼel kan isa biratti walitti qabaman guutuun hoolotaa fi loon akka malee baayʼatanii galmeessuu fi lakkaaʼuun hin dandaʼamne aarsaa dhiʼeessaa isa wajjin fuula taabotaa dura turan.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Luboonnis ergasii taabota kakuu Rabbii Allaah sana iddoo isaa gara kutaa qulqullicha mana qulqullummaa keessaa jechuunis Iddoo Iddoo Hunda Caalaa Qulqulluu taʼe sanatti ol galchanii qoochoo kiirubeelii jala kaaʼan. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Kiirubeeliinis iddoo taabotichaa irratti qoochoowwan isaanii babalʼisanii taabotichaa fi danqaraawwan ittiin taabota baatan ni haguugan. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Danqaraawwan kunneen waan akka malee dhedheerataniif fiixeen isaanii taaboticha biraa dhedheerattee fuula Iddoo Qulqulluu gara keessaa jiru sanaa duraa ni mulʼatu ture; garuu iddoo qulqulluu sanaa alatti hin mulʼatan ture; danqaraawwan kunneen hamma harʼaatti illee achuma jiru. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Taabota sana keessa gabateewwan kanneen Muusaan Kooreebitti, iddoo Rabbii Allaahan erga Israaʼeloonni Gibxii baʼanii booddee itti isaan wajjin kakuu seene sanatti isa keessa kaaʼe lamaan malee wanni tokko iyyuu hin turre.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Luboonnis Iddoo Qulqulluu sanaa ni baʼan. Luboonni achi turan hundinuu yoo dabareen kan isaanii taʼuu baate iyyuu of qulqulleessanii turan. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Lewwonni faarfattoota turan jechuunis Asaaf, Heemaan, Yeduutuun, ilmaan isaaniitii fi firoonni isaanii wayyaa haphii quncee talbaa irraa hojjetame uffatanii iddoo aarsaa bira karaa baʼa biiftuutiin dhaabatanii kilillee kililchaa, baganaa fi kiraara taphachaa turan. Luboonni 120 kanneen malakata afuufan isaan wajjin turan. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Warri malakata afuufanii fi faarfattoonni Rabbii Allaah leellisuu fi galateeffachuudhaaf jedhanii akkuma nama tokkootti walii galanii sagalee isaanii tokko godhatan. Isaanis malakatatti, kilillee fi miʼoota faarfannaa biraatti fayyadamanii sagalee isaanii ol fudhatanii Rabbii Allaah galateeffachuudhaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“Inni gaarii dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">jaalalli isaas bara baraan ni jiraata”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 5:13">jedhanii faarfatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Ergasiis manni qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah duumessaan ni guutame; <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />luboonnis sababii duumessa sanaatiif hojii isaanii hojjechuu hin dandeenye; ulfinni Rabbii Allaah mana qulqullummaa Allaaha guutee tureetii.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Ergasii Suleyimaan akkana jedhe; “Rabbii Allaahan akka duumessa dukkanaaʼaa keessa jiraatu dubbateera; <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />ani mana qulqullummaa guddaa, iddoo ati bara baraan jiraattu siif ijaareera.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Utuma waldaan Israaʼel guutuun achi dhaabatuu mootichi of irra garagalee isaan eebbise. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Innis akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:4">“Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel inni waan afaan ofii isaatiin abbaa koo Daawudiif waadaa gale sana harkuma ofii isaatiin guute sun haa eebbifamu. Innis akkana jedhee tureetii; <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Ani gaafan saba koo Gibxii baasee jalqabee akka Maqaan koo achi jiraatuuf jedhee mana qulqullummaa itti ijaarsifachuuf gosoota Israaʼel kam iyyuu keessatti magaalaa tokko illee hin filanne, yookaan akka inni bulchaa saba koo Israaʼel taʼuuf nama tokko illee hin filanne. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Amma garuu akka maqaan koo achi jiraatuuf Yerusaalemin filadheera; akka inni saba koo Israaʼelin bulchuufis Daawudin filadheera.’<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />“Daawud abbaan koo Maqaa Rabbii Allaah Israaʼeliif mana qulqullummaa ijaaruuf garaa isaatii yaada qaba ture. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Rabbii Allaahan garuu abbaa koo Daawudiin akkana jedhe; ‘Waan mana qulqullummaa maqaa kootiif ijaaruun yaada kee keessa jiruuf, ati yaada kana garaadhaa qabaachuun kee gaarii dha. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Taʼus namni mana qulqullummaa naaf ijaaru siʼi miti; garuu ilma kee, isuma foon keetii fi dhiiga kee taʼetu ijaara; namni mana qulqullummaa Maqaa kootiif ijaaru isa.’<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />“Rabbii Allaahan waadaa gale sana eegeera; akkuma Rabbii Allaahan waadaa gale sana ani amma iddoo abbaa koo Daawud buʼee teessoo Israaʼel irra taaʼeen jira; Maqaa Rabbii Allaah Israaʼeliifis mana qulqullummaa ijaareera. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Anis achi keessa taabota kaaʼeera; taabota sana keessa immoo kakuu Rabbii Allaah kan inni saba Israaʼel wajjin galetu jira.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duʼaa Suleyimaan</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:12-40">6:12‑40</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 8:22-53">1Mt 8:22‑53</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:41-42">6:41‑42</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 132:8-10">Zab 132:8‑10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Suleyimaan iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaah duratti fuula guutummaa waldaa Israaʼel dura dhaabatee harka isaa ni balʼise. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Waltajjii dhundhuma shan lafa irra dheeratu, kan dhundhuma shan balʼatee dhundhuma sadii ol dheeratu tokkos naasii irraa hojjetee walakkaa oobdii ni dhaabe; innis waltajjii sana irra dhaabatee fuula guutummaa waldaa Israaʼel duratti jilbeenfatee harka isaa gara shamaayʼuniitti ol ni balʼise. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Akkanas jedhe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:14">“Yaa Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel, Allaahan akka keetii ol shamaayʼun keessa yookaan gad lafa irra hin jiru; ati garboota kee warra garaa guutuudhaan karaa kee irra deemaniif kakuu fi jaalala kee kan hin geeddaramne sana ni eegda. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Ati waadaa garbicha kee abbaa koo Daawudiif galte sana eegdeerta; ati afaanuma keetiin waadaa galtee akkuma harʼa taʼee jiru kana harka keetiin fiixaan baafteerta.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />“Ammas yaa Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel, ati waan garbicha kee abbaa koo Daawudiin, ‘Yoo ilmaan kee akkuma ati goote sana waan hojjetan hunda keessatti of eeggachaa, akkuma seera kootti fuula koo dura deddeebiʼan, ati nama fuula koo dura teessoo Israaʼel irra taaʼu gonkumaa hin dhabdu’ jettee abdachiifte sana eegiif. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Kanaafuu amma yaa Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel, dubbiin ati garbicha kee Daawudiif waadaa galte sun haa mirkanaaʼu.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />“Garuu dhugumaan Allaahan nama wajjin lafa irra ni jiraataa? Shamaayʼuniiwwan, shamaayʼuniiwwan shamaayʼun olii iyyuu si baachuu hin dandaʼan. Yoos manni qulqullummaa kan ani ijaare kun hammam haa xinnaatuu ree! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Taʼus yaa Rabbii Allaah ko, duʼaa fi waammata garbichi kee araara barbaaduuf dhiʼeessuuf gurra kenni. Iyyaa fi duʼaa garbichi kee fuula kee duratti dhiʼeessu illee dhagaʼi. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Iji kees halkanii fi guyyaa gara mana qulqullummaa kanaa gara iddoo ati akka Maqaa kee achi kaaʼattu dubbatte sanaa haa ilaalu. Duʼaa garbichi kee gara iddoo kanaatti fuula deebifatee godhatu illee dhagaʼi. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Yommuu isaan gara iddoo kanaatti fuula deebifatanii duʼaa godhatanitti waammata garbicha keetii fi kan saba kee Israaʼel dhagaʼi. Shamaayʼun keessaa, iddoo jireenya keetiitii dhagaʼi; yommuu dhageessuttis dhiifama godhi.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />“Yoo namni tokko ollaa ofii isaatti daba hojjetee akka kakatu gaafatamee, innis dhufee mana qulqullummaa kana keessatti, fuula iddoo aarsaa keetii duratti kakate, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />ati shamaayʼun irraa dhagaʼiitii garboota kee gidduutti tarkaanfii fudhadhu. Nama yakka qabu, yakka isaa matuma isaatti deebistee gatii isaa kennuufiidhaan, nama qajeelaa immoo akkuma qajeelummaa isaatti isaaf falmuudhaan garboota kee gidduutti murtii kenni.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />“Yoo sabni kee Israaʼel sababii cubbuu sitti hojjeteef diinaan moʼatamutti, yoo inni deebiʼee maqaa keetiif ulfina kennee mana qulqullummaa kana keessatti si duratti duʼaa godhatee si waammatutti, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />shamaayʼun irraa dhagaʼiitii cubbuu saba kee Israaʼel dhiisiif; biyya isaanii fi abbootii isaaniitiif kennite sanattis deebisii isaan galchi.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />“Yoo sababii sabni kee cubbuu sitti hojjeteef shamaayʼuniiwwan cufamanii bokkaan dhabame, yoo isaan sababii ati isaan adabdeef iddoo kanatti fuula deebifatanii maqaa kee ulfeessanii cubbuu isaanii irraa deebiʼan, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />ati shamaayʼun irraa dhagaʼiitii cubbuu garboota kee, saba kee Israaʼel dhiisiif. Karaa qajeelaa isaan jiraachuu qaban isaan barsiisi; biyya dhaala gootee saba keetiif kennite irrattis bokkaa roobsi.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />“Yommuu beelli yookaan dhaʼichi yookaan waagiin yookaan awwaaroon yookaan hawwaannisni yookaan korophisni biyyatti dhufutti, yookaan yommuu magaalaawwan biyya isaanii kam iyyuu keessatti diinonni isaan marsanitti, yookaan yommuu balaan yookaan dhukkubni kam iyyuu dhufutti, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />yoo sabni kee Israaʼel rakkinaa fi dhukkubbii ofii isaa beekee isaan keessaa eenyu iyyuu gara mana qulqullummaa kanaatti harka isaa balʼisee duʼaa yookaan waammata dhiʼeesse, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />ati shamaayʼun irraa, iddoo jireenya keetiitii dhagaʼi. Dhiifama godhiif; si qofatu garaa namaa beekaatii, ati sababii garaa isaa beektuuf tokkoo tokkoo namaatiif akkuma hojii isaa hundaatti waan isaaf malu kenni; <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />yoo akkasii isaan bara biyya ati abbootii keenyaaf kennite keessa jiraatan hunda si sodaatanii karaa kee irra ni deemu.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />“Akkasumas nama ormaa kan saba kee Israaʼel hin taʼin kan maqaa kee guddichaaf, harka kee jabaa fi irree kee kan diriirfame sanaatiif jedhee biyya fagootii dhufe, yoo inni dhufee fuula isaa gara mana qulqullummaa kanaatti deebifatee duʼaa godhate, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />ati shamaayʼun irraa, iddoo jireenya keetiitii dhagaʼi. Akka saboonni addunyaa hundinuu akkuma saba kee Israaʼel sana maqaa kee beekanii si sodaatanii fi akka isaan akka manni ani ijaare kun maqaa keetiin waamamu illee beekaniif jedhii waan namni ormaa sun si kadhatu hunda godhiif.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />“Yommuu sabni kee diinota isaa loluuf jedhee gara ati itti isa ergitu kam iyyuu duulutti, yoo inni gara magaalaa ati filattee fi gara mana qulqullummaa kan ani Maqaa keetiif ijaare kanaatti fuula deebifatee si duratti duʼaa godhate, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />ati shamaayʼun irraa duʼaa isaatii fi waammata isaa dhagaʼiitii dhimma isaa isaaf raawwadhu.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Waan namni cubbuu hin hojjenne tokko iyyuu hin jirreef yommuu isaan cubbuu sitti hojjetanitti ati isaanitti aartee diina isaan boojiʼee biyya fagootti yookaan dhiʼootti isaan geessutti dabarsitee isaan kennita; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />yoo isaan biyya boojuudhaan itti geeffamanitti gaabbanii qalbii geeddaratanii, ‘Nu cubbuu hojjenneerra; balleessineerra; waan hamaas hojjenneerra’ jedhanii biyya boojuu isaanii keessatti si duratti duʼaa godhatan, <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />yoo isaan biyya boojuudhaan itti geeffaman sana keessatti garaa fi lubbuu isaanii guutuudhaan gara keetti deebiʼanii, gara biyya ati abbootii isaaniitiif kenniteetti, gara magaalaa ati filattee fi gara mana qulqullummaa kan ani Maqaa keetiif ijaare sanaatti fuula deebifatanii si duratti duʼaa godhatan, <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />ati shamaayʼun irraa, iddoo jireenya keetiitii duʼaa fi waammata isaanii dhagaʼiitii dhimma isaanii isaaniif raawwadhu. Saba kee kan cubbuu sitti hojjeteefis dhiifama godhi.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />“Ammas yaa Allaah koo duʼaa iddoo kanatti dhiʼaatu iji kee haa argu; gurri kees haa dhagaʼu.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />“Kanaafuu yaa Rabbii Allaah, yaa Allaah,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">kaʼiitii gara iddoo boqonnaa keetii kottu; atii fi taabonni jabina keetiis kottaa.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="2CH 6:41">Rabbii Allaah, yaa Allaah, luboonni kee fayyina haa uffatan;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">qulqulloonni kees gaarummaa keetti haa gammadan.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Rabbii Allaah, Allaah ati dibamaa kee hin gatin;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:42">jaalala guddaa ati garbicha kee Daawudin abdachiifte sana illee yaadadhu.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Manni Qulqullummaa Eebbifame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:1-10">7:1‑10</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 8:62-66">1Mt 8:62‑66</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Yommuu Suleyimaan duʼaa isaa fixatetti ibiddi shamaayʼuniidhaa gad buʼee aarsaa gubamuu fi aarsaawwan biraa nyaatee fixe; ulfinni Rabbii Allaahas mana qulqullummaa guute. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Sababii ulfinni Rabbii Allaah mana qulqullummaa guuteef luboonni mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah seenuu hin dandeenye. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Israaʼeloonni hundi yommuu ibidda shamaayʼuniidhaa gad buʼuu fi ulfina Rabbii Allaah mana qulqullummaa irratti arganitti qarqara karaa irratti jilbeenfatanii addaan lafatti gombifamuudhaan sagadan; akkana jedhaniis Rabbii Allaah galateeffatan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">“Inni gaarii dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">jaalalli isaas bara baraan jiraata.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Ergasii mootichii fi sabni hundi fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti aarsaa dhiʼeessan. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Suleyimaan Mootichis loon kuma digdamii lama, hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma dhibba tokkoo fi digdama aarsaa dhiʼeesse; akkasiin mootichii fi namoonni hundi mana qulqullummaa Allaaha eebbisan. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Luboonni akkuma Lewwonni miʼoota faarfannaa Rabbii Allaah kanneen Daawud Mootichi ittiin Rabbii Allaah jajachuudhaaf tolche kanneen yeroo inni, “Jaalalli isaa bara baraan ni jiraata” jedhee galateeffatutti fayyadan sana harkatti qabatanii dhaaban. Luboonnis fuullee Lewwotaa dhaabatanii malakata isaanii afuufan; Israaʼeloonni hundis dhadhaabachaa turan.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Suleyimaanis iddoo walakkaa oobdii fuula mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah dura jiru sanaa Allaahaf addaan ni baase; inni sababii iddoon aarsaa kan inni naasii irraa hojjetee ture sun aarsaa gubamu, kennaa midhaanii fi cooma baachuu hin dandaʼiniif aarsaa gubamuu fi cooma aarsaa nagaa sana achumatti ni dhiʼeesse.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Kanaafuu Suleyimaan yeroo sanatti bultii torbaaf Israaʼeloota isa wajjin turan hunda wajjin jechuunis waldaa guddicha Malkaa Leeboo Hamaatii jalqabee hamma laga Gibxitti walitti qabame wajjin ayyaana ayyaaneffate. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Isaanis sababii bultii torba ayyaana eebba iddoo aarsaa ayyaaneffatanii bultii torba immoo ittuma fufanii ayyaana daasii ayyaaneffataniif bultii saddeettaffaatti wal gaʼii guddaa tokko ni godhatan. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Suleyimaanis guyyaa digdamii sadaffaa jiʼa torbaffaatti akka isaan mana isaaniitti galaniif namoota gad dhiise; isaanis sababii Rabbii Allaahan Daawudiif, Suleyimaanii fi saba isaa Israaʼeliif waan gaarii godheef garaa isaaniitti gammadanii ni ililchan.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rabbii Allaahan Suleyimaanitti Mulʼate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">7:11‑22</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 9:1-9">1Mt 9:1‑9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Yommuu Suleyimaan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii fi masaraa mootummaa fixee waan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii fi masaraa ofii isaa keessatti hojjechuu barbaade hunda raawwatetti, <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Rabbii Allaahanis halkaniin isatti mulʼatee akkana jedheen:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 7:12">“Ani duʼaa kee dhagaʼeera; iddoo kana illee mana qulqullummaa kan aarsaan itti dhiʼeeffamu godhee ofii kootiif filadheera.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />“Ani yommuun akka bokkaan hin roobneef shamaayʼun cufutti yookaan akka inni lafa balleessuuf hawwaannisa ergutti yookaan ani yommuun saba kootti dhaʼicha ergutti, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />yoo sabni koo kan maqaa kootiin waamamu gad of qabee na duratti duʼaa godhate, yoo inni fuula koo barbaadee karaa isaa hamaa sana irraa deebiʼe, ani shamaayʼun irraa dhagaʼee cubbuu isaa dhiiseefii biyya isaa nan fayyisa. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Ammas duʼaa iddoo kanatti dhiʼaatuuf iji koo ni banama; gurri koos ni dhagaʼa. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Ani akka Maqaan koo bara baraan achi jiraatuuf mana qulqullummaa kana filadhee eebbiseera. Iji koo fi garaan koo yeroo hunda achuma jira.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />“Yoo ati akkuma Daawud abbaan kee godhe sana fuula koo dura deemtee waan ani ajaje hunda hojjette, yoo qajeelchawwanii fi seerawwan koo eegde, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />ani akkuman yeroo, ‘Ati nama Israaʼelin bulchu hin dhabdu’ jedhee abbaa kee Daawud wajjin kakuu gale sana teessoo mootummaa keetii jabeessee nan dhaaba.<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />“Garuu yoo isin duubatti garagaltanii seeraa fi ajaja ani isinii kenne sana irraa gara waaqeffatamtoota biraa tajaajiluu fi isaan waaqeffachuu dhaqxan, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />ani biyya koo kanan isaaniif kenne keessaa Israaʼelin nan buqqisa; mana qulqullummaa kanan Maqaa kootiif qulqulleesse kana illee nan balfa; saboota hunda birattis waan kolfaatii fi waan qoosaa isa nan godha. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Manni qulqullummaa kunis tuullaa waan diigamee taʼa. Namni achiin darbu hundis, ‘Rabbii Allaahan maaliif biyya kanaa fi mana qulqullummaa kanatti waan akkasii hojjete?’ jedhee itti qoosa. <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Namoonnis, ‘Sababiin inni balaa kana hunda isaanitti fideef waan isaan Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaanii kan Gibxii isaan baase sana dhiisanii, waaqeffatamtoota biraa hammatanii, isaanin waaqeffatanii tajaajilaniif’ jedhanii ni deebisu.”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Hojiiwwan Biraa Kanneen Suleyimaan Hojjete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:1-18">8:1‑18</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1Mt 9:10‑28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Dhuma waggaa digdamaatti yeroo itti Suleyimaan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii fi mana ofii isaa ijaaretti, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Suleyimaan gandoota Huuraam isaaf kennee ture sana haaromsee ijaaree Israaʼeloota achi keessa ni qubachiise. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Ergasii immoo Suleyimaan Hamaati Zoobaatti duulee ishee ni qabate. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Akkasumas gammoojjii keessatti Tadmoorii fi magaalaawwan waa itti kuusan kanneen duraan Hamaatitti ijaaree ture hunda ni ijaare. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Beet Horoon oliitii fi Beet Horoon gadii magaalaawwan daʼannoo godhee dallaa dhagaa, balbalawwanii fi danqaraawwan ittiin cufan itti tolche; <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />kana malees Baaʼilaatii fi magaalaawwan isaa kanneen waa itti kuusan hunda, magaalaawwan gaariiwwan isaatii fi magaalaawwan fardeen isaa hunda, waanuma Yerusaalemitti, Libaanoonittii fi biyya bulchu hunda keessatti ijaaruu barbaade hundumaa ni ijaare.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Ammas namoota Israaʼeloota hin taʼin jechuunis Heetota, Amoorota, Feerzota, Hiiwotaa fi Yebuusota jalaa hafanitu jira. <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />Suleyimaanis sanyiiwwan namoota kanneen hundaa warra biyyattii keessatti hafan kanneen Israaʼeloonni hin barbadeessin sana akkuma hamma harʼaatti illee jiru kana akka isaan hojii garbummaa hojjetaniif dirqisiise. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Suleyimaan garuu hojii isaatiif jedhee Israaʼeloota hin garboomsine; isaan loltoota isaa, abbootii duulaa, ajajjuuwwan gaariiwwanii fi abbootii fardaa isaa turan. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Isaan akkasumas qondaaltota Suleyimaan Mootichaa kanneen nama hojjechiisan dhibba lamaa fi shantaman keessaa qondaaltota hangafoota turan.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Suleyimaanis, “Sababii iddoon taabonni Rabbii Allaah seene hundi qulqulluu taʼeef, niitiin koo masaraa mootummaa Daawud Mooticha Israaʼel keessa jiraachuu hin qabdu” jedhee intala Faraʼoon sana magaalaa Daawud keessaa baasee gara mana isheef ijaare sanaatti ni fide.<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Suleyimaan iddoo aarsaa kan gardaafoo mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah duratti ijaare sana irratti aarsaa gubamu Rabbii Allaahaf ni dhiʼeesse; <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />kanas akkuma seera waaʼee aarsaa kan guyyaa guyyaa kan Muusaan Sanbataaf, Ayyaana Baatii Haaraa fi ayyaanota waggaa keessaa sadaniif jechuunis Ayyaana Maxinoo, Ayyaana Torbanootaa fi Ayyaana Daasiif kenne sanaatti ni dhiʼeesse. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Innis akkuma seera abbaa isaa Daawuditti gareewwan lubootaa hojii isaaniitti, Lewwota immoo akka isaan akkuma seera guyyaa guyyaatti tajaajila galataa kennanii fi akka isaan hojii lubootaa gargaaraniif filate. Akkasumas tokkoo tokkoo karraatti garee eegdota karraa ni ramade; Daawud namni Allaaha sun waan kana ajajeetii. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Isaanis waan mootichi waaʼee mankuusaa fi waaʼee waan biraa irratti lubootaa fi Lewwota ajaje irraa hin jalʼanne.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Hojiin Suleyimaan hundi gaafa hundeen mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah buufamee jalqabee hamma dhuma manichaatti haala tolaadhaan hojjetame. Akkasiinis manni qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah ni xumurame.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Ergasii Suleyimaan gara magaalaawwan Eziyoon Geberii fi Eelooti kanneen biyya Edoom keessa qarqara galaanaatti argaman sanaa dhaqe. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Huuraamis dooniiwwan ajajjoonni ofii isaa kanneen galaanicha beekan ajajan ergeef. Isaanis namoota Suleyimaan wajjin dooniidhaan Oofiir dhaqanii warqee taalaantii dhibba afurii fi shantama fidanii Suleyimaan Mootichatti kennan.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mootittiin Saabaa Suleyimaanin Arguu Dhaqxe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">9:1‑12</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1Mt 10:1‑13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Mootittiin Shebaa waaʼee maqaa Suleyimaan dhageenyaan gaaffiiwwan jajjaboodhaan qortee isa ilaaluuf gara Yerusaalem dhufte. Isheenis miiltoo akka malee baayʼee wajjin gaalawwan urgooftuu, warqee hedduu fi dhagaawwan gati jabeeyyii baatan fudhattee dhufte; Suleyimaan bira geenyaanis waan garaa ishee jiru hunda isa wajjin haasofte. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Suleyimaanis gaaffii ishee hundaaf deebii kenne; wanni inni isheef ibsuu dadhabe tokko iyyuu hin turre. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Mootittiin Shebaa yommuu ogummaa Suleyimaan, masaraa mootummaa kan inni ijaare, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />nyaata maaddii isaa irratti dhiʼaatu, haala itti qondaaltonni isaa tataaʼan, hojjettoota uffata hojii uffatanii hojjetan, warra daadhii isaaf dhiʼeessanii fi aarsaa gubamu kan inni mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti dhiʼeesse argitetti akka malee dinqisiifatte.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Isheenis mootichaan akkana jette; “Oduun ani waaʼee waan ati hojjetteetii fi waaʼee ogummaa keetii biyyuma kootti dhagaʼe sun dhugaa dha. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Ani garuu hamman dhufee ijuma kootiin argutti waan isaan jedhan sana hin amanne. Dhugumaan guddina ogummaa keetii keessaa walakkaan isaa iyyuu natti hin himamne; ati oduu ani dhagaʼe sana akka malee caalta. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Namoonni kee hammam haa gammadan! Qondaaltonni kee warri yeroo hunda fuula kee dura dhadhaabatanii ogummaa kee dhagaʼan hammam haa gammadan! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Rabbii Allaahan kee inni sitti gammadee akka ati mootii taatee Rabbii Allaah keetiif bulchituuf teessoo isaa irra si teessise sun haa galateeffamu. Allaahan kee sababii Israaʼeliif jaalala qabuu fi sababii bara baraan jabeessee isaan dhaabuuf fedhii qabuuf akka ati murtii qajeelaa fi qajeelummaa eegduuf isaan irratti mootii si godheera.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Isheenis warqee taalaantii 120, urgooftuu akka malee baayʼee fi dhagaawwan gati jabeeyyii mootichaaf kennite. Urgooftuun akka urgooftuu mootittiin Shebaa Suleyimaan Mootichaaf kennite sanaa gonkumaa hin argamne.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Namoonni Hiiraamii fi namoonni Suleyimaan biyya Oofiir irraa warqee fidan; akkasumas muka sandaliitii fi dhagaawwan gati jabeeyyii ni fidan. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Mootichis muka sandalii sana gulantaawwan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii fi kan masaraa mootummaa, akkasumas baganaa fi kiraara faarfattootaa tolchuuf itti fayyadame. Wanni akkasiis takkumaa Yihuudaa keessatti hin argamne.<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Suleyimaan Mootichis waan isheen barbaaddee fi waan isheen kadhatte hunda mootittii Shebaatiif ni kenne; inni waan isheen isaaf geessite caalaa kenneef. Isheenis ergasii kaatee miiltota ishee wajjin biyya ofii isheetti deebite.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badhaadhummaa Suleyimaan</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">9:13‑28</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:14-29">1Mt 10:14‑29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:14-17">2Sn 1:14‑17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Ulfinni warqee kan wagguma waggaan Suleyimaaniif galu taalaantii 666 ture; <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />kunis gibira daldaltoota qabeenya gurguddaatii fi kan warra qabeenya xixinnaa irraa argamuu hin dabalatu. Akkasumas mootonni Arabaa fi bulchitoonni biyyaa hundi Suleyimaaniif warqee fi meetii ni fidan.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Suleyimaan Mootichis warqee tumame irraa gaachanawwan gurguddaa dhibba lama ni tolche; tokkoon tokkoon gaachanawwan sanaas warqee saqilii dhibba jaʼa fixe. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Akkasumas warqee tumame irraa gaachana xixinnaa dhibba sadii ni tolche. Tokkoon tokkoon gaachana sanaas warqee saqilii dhibba sadii fixe. Mootichis gaachanawwan kanneen Masaraa mootummaa kan Bosona Libaanoon keessa ni kaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Mootichis teessoo guddaa tokko ilka arbaa irraa hojjetee warqee qulqulluu itti uffise. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Teessoon sun gulantaawwan jaʼa qaba ture; ejjenni miillaa kan warqee irraa hojjetame tokkos itti qabsiifamee ture. Karaa teessoo sanaa lamaaniinis waan harka irra kaaʼatanitu ture; tokkoo tokkoo waan harka irra kaaʼatan sanaa biras fakkii leencaa tokko tokkotu dhaabatee ture. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Gulantaawwan jaʼaan sana irras leenconni kudha lama tokko fiixee tokkoon, fakkiin kaan immoo fiixee kaaniin dhadhaabachaa turan. Wanni akkasii takkumaa mootummaa biraa kamiif iyyuu hin tolfamne. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Miʼi Suleyimaan Mootichi ittiin dhugu hundinuu warqee irraa hojjetame; miʼi Masaraa mootummaa kan Bosona Libaanoon jedhamu sanaa hundi immoo warqee qulqulluu irraa hojjetame. Sababii bara Suleyimaan keessa meetiin akka waan gatii hin qabne tokkootti ilaalamaa tureef wanni tokko iyyuu meetii irraa hin hojjetamne. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Mootichis dooniiwwan daldalaa kanneen namoonni Huuraam oofan qaba ture. Isaanis waggaa sadii sadiitti yeroo tokko warqee, meetii fi ilka arbaa, qamalee fi jaldeessa fidanii ni dhufu ture.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Suleyimaan Mootichi badhaadhummaa fi ogummaadhaan mootota addunyaa hunda ni caala ture. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Mootonni addunyaa hundi ogummaa Allaahan garaa isaa keessa kaaʼe dhagaʼuuf Suleyimaan bira dhufuu barbaadu ture. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Namni waggaa waggaatti isa bira dhufu hundinuu kennaa miʼa meetii fi kan warqee, uffata, miʼa lolaa, urgooftuu, fardeenii fi gaangolii fidaafii ture.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Suleyimaan gola fardeenii fi gaariiwwanii kuma afur akkasumas fardeen kuma kudha lama kanneen magaalaawwan gaariiwwanii keessaa fi of bira Yerusaalem keessa kaaʼate qaba ture. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Innis mootota Laga Efraaxiisiitii hamma biyya Filisxeemotaattii fi hamma daarii Gibxitti jiran hunda ni bulche. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Mootichi akka meetiin Yerusaalem keessatti akkuma dhagaa baayʼatu, akka mukni birbirsaas akkuma mukkeen harbuu kanneen gaarran jalaatti baayʼatu ni godhe. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Fardeen Suleyimaan Gibxii fi biyyoota biraa hunda irraa bitamanii dhufan.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suleyimaan Duʼuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">9:29‑31</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1Mt 11:41‑43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Wanni bara mootummaa Suleyimaan keessa hojjetaman kan biraa, jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti kitaaba seenaa Naataan nabiiʼiyyichaa keessatti, nabiiʼiyyii Ahiiyaa namicha Shiiloo sanaa keessattii fi mulʼata Iddoon namichi waa himu sun waaʼee Yerobiʼaam ilma Nebaat arge keessatti barreeffamanii jiru mitii? <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Suleyimaan Yerusaalem keessatti mootii taʼee waggaa afurtama saba Israaʼel hunda ni bulche. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Innis ergasii abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee magaalaa abbaa isaa, magaalaa Daawud keessatti ni qabbarame. Rehooboʼaam ilmi isaa iddoo isaa buʼee mootii ni taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Israaʼel Rehooboʼaamitti Fincile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 10:1-11:4">10:1–11:4</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-24">1Mt 12:1‑24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehooboʼaamis sababii Israaʼeloonni hundinuu mootii isa gochuudhaaf achi yaaʼaniif kaʼee Sheekem dhaqe. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Yerobiʼaam ilmi Nebaat yommuu oduu kana dhagaʼetti deebiʼee dhufe; inni Suleyimaan Mooticha jalaa baqatee Gibxi jiraachaa tureetii. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Kanaafuu Yerobiʼaamitti nama erganii waamanii, innii fi Israaʼel hundinuu gara Rehooboʼaam dhaqanii akkana jedhaniin: <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Abbaan kee waanjoo ulfaatu nurra kaaʼee ture; ati immoo amma hojii inni humnaan nu hojjechiise sanaa fi waanjoo ulfaataa inni nurra kaaʼe sana nuuf salphisi; nus si tajaajillaa.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Rehooboʼaam immoo deebisee, “Bultii sadii keessatti deebiʼaa gara koo kottaa” jedheen. Kanaafuu namoonni sun baʼanii deeman.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Ergasiis Rehooboʼaam Mootichi maanguddoota bara jireenya isaa keessa abbaa isaa Suleyimaanin tajaajilaniin mariʼate. Innis, “Isin akka ani namoota kanaaf maal deebisu na gorsitu?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Isaanis, “Yoo ati saba kanaaf garaa laaftee isaan gammachiiftee deebii gaarii kenniteef, isaan yeroo hunda tajaajiltoota kee ni taʼu” jedhanii deebisaniif.<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Rehooboʼaam garuu gorsa maanguddoonni kennaniif didee dargaggoota isa wajjin guddatan kanneen isa tajaajilan wajjin mariʼate. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Innis, “Gorsi keessan maal? Namoota, ‘Waanjoo abbaan kee nurra kaaʼe kana nuuf salphisi’ naan jedhan kanaaf akkamitti haa deebisnu?” jedhee isaan gaafate.<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Dargaggoonni isa wajjin guddatan sunis akkana jedhanii deebisaniif; “Namoonni, ‘Abbaan kee waanjoo ulfaataa nurra kaaʼe; ati garuu waanjoo keenya nuu salphisi’ siin jedhan; ati amma akkana jedhiin; ‘Qubni koo xinnaan mudhii abbaa kootii irra furdaa dha. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Abbaan koo waanjoo ulfaataa isin irra kaaʼe; ani immoo hammas caalaa iyyuu isinittan ulfaachisa. Abbaan koo qacceedhaan isin garafe; ani immoo torbaanqabaadhaanan isin garafa.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Bultii sadii booddee akkuma mootichi, “Guyyaa sadii keessatti deebiʼaa gara koo kottaa” jedhe sana Yerobiʼaamii fi namoonni hundi gara Rehooboʼaamitti deebiʼan. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Mootichi immoo afaan hamaadhaan deebii kenneef. Gorsa maanguddootaas didee, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />gorsa dargaggootaa fudhatee, “Abbaan koo waanjoo keessan isinitti ulfaachise; ani immoo hammas iyyuu caalaa isinittan ulfaachisa. Abbaan koo qacceedhaan isin garafe; ani immoo torbaanqabaadhaanan isin garafa” jedhe. <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Kanaafuu mootichi namoota sana hin dhaggeeffanne; wanni kun akka dubbiin Rabbii Allaahan karaa Ahiiyaa namicha biyya Shiiloo sanaatiin Yerobiʼaam ilma Nebaatitti dubbate sun raawwatamuuf Allaah biraa dhufeetii.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Israaʼel hundi yommuu akka mootichi isaan dhaggeeffachuu dide arganitti, akkana jedhanii mootichaaf deebii kennan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">“Nu Daawud irraa qooda maalii qabna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Ilma Isseey irraas maal qabna?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Yaa Israaʼel gara dunkaana keetii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Yaa Daawud atis mana kee eeggadhu!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 10:16">Kanaafuu Israaʼeloonni hundi gara mana ofii isaaniitti deebiʼan. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Israaʼeloota magaalaawwan Yihuudaa keessa jiraatan garuu Rehooboʼaamtu bulchaa ture.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Rehooboʼaam mootichis Hadooraam itti gaafatamaa hojjettoota hojii humnaa ni erge; Israaʼeloonni immoo dhagaadhaan tumanii isa ajjeesan. Rehooboʼaam mootichi garuu ariitiidhaan gaarii ofii isaa yaabbatee jalaa miliqee Yerusaalemitti baqate. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Kanaafuu Israaʼeloonni hamma harʼaatti mana Daawuditti fincilaniiru.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Rehooboʼaam yommuu Yerusaalem gaʼetti akka isaan Israaʼelitti duulanii Rehooboʼaamiif mootummaa deebisaniif jedhee mana Yihuudaa fi Biniyaam keessaa namoota loluu dandaʼan kuma dhibba tokkoo fi saddeettama walitti qabe.<verse eid="2CH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Garuu dubbiin Rabbii Allaah kun akkana jedhee gara nama Allaaha gara Shemaaʼiyaa ni dhufe; <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Rehooboʼaam ilma Suleyimaan mooticha Yihuudaatii fi Israaʼeloota Yihuudaa fi Biniyaam keessa jiraatan hundaan akkana jedhi; <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha: Obboloota keessan Israaʼeloota loluudhaaf jettanii ol hin baʼinaa. Sababii wanni kun ana biraa dhufeef tokkoon tokkoon keessan gara mana keessaniitti galaa.’ ” Kanaafuu isaan dubbii Rabbii Allaahatiif ajajamanii Yerobiʼaamitti duuluu dhiisanii deebiʼan.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehooboʼaam Magaalaawwan Yihuudaa Jabeessee Ijaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehooboʼaam Yerusaalem keessa jiraatee Yihuudaa keessatti immoo magaalaawwan ittisaa ni ijaarrate; isaanis: <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Beetlihem, Eexaam, Teqooʼaa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Beet Zuuri, Sookoo, Adulaam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gaati, Maareeshaa, Ziif, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adooraayim, Laakkiish, Azeeqaa, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Zoraa, Ayaaloonii fi Kebrooni. Isaan kunneen magaalaawwan Yihuudaa fi Biniyaam keessatti jabeeffamanii ijaaramanii dha. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Innis ittisa isaanii jajjabeessee ajajjoota itti galche; nyaata, zayitii ejersaatii fi daadhii wayiniis achitti ni kuuse. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Magaalaawwan hunda keessas gaachanaa fi eeboo kaaʼee akka isaan jabaatan ni godhe. Akkasiinis Yihuudaa fi Biniyaamin kan ofii isaa godhate.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Luboonnii fi Lewwonni aanaalee Israaʼel hunda keessa jiraatan gara isaa goran. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Sababii Yerobiʼaamii fi ilmaan isaa akka luboota Rabbii Allaahatti isaan ilaaluu didaniif, Lewwonni lafa dheeda isaanii fi qabeenya isaanii dhiisanii gara Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem dhufan. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Innis iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraatii fi fakkii waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo bifa reʼee fi bifa jabbiitiin hojjete sanaaf luboota ofii isaa ni muuddate. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Warri gosoota Israaʼel hunda keessaa garaan isaanii Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel bira jiru Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaaniitiif aarsaa dhiʼeessuudhaaf Lewwota duukaa buʼanii Yerusaalem dhaqan. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Isaanis mootummaa Yihuudaa jajjabeessaa waggaa sadii Rehooboʼaam ilma Suleyimaan ni gargaaran; isaan waggoota sadan kana keessa karaa Daawudii fi Suleyimaan duukaa buʼaa turaniitii.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maatii Rehooboʼaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehooboʼaamis Maahalaati intala Yeriimooti ilma Daawudii fi Abiihaayil fuudhe; Abiihaayil kun immoo intala Eliiyaab ilma Isseey. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Isheenis: Yeʼuushi, Shemaariyaa fi Zahaam deesseef. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Ergasii immoo Maʼakaa intala Abesaaloom ni fuudhe; isheenis Abiyaa, Ataayi, Ziizaa fi Sheloomiit deesseef. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehooboʼaamis niitotaa isaa kaanii fi saajjatoowwan isaa caalaa Maʼakaa intala Abesaaloom ni jaallate. Innis walumatti niitota kudha saddeet, saajjatoowwan jaatama, ilmaan digdamii saddeetii fi intallan jaatama qaba ture.<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehooboʼaamis mootii isa gochuuf jedhee Abiyaa ilma Maʼakaa sana obboloota isaa ilmaan mootii keessaa hoogganaa godhee muude. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Innis ogummaan ilmaan isaa keessaa tokko tokko aanaalee Yihuudaa fi Biniyaam keessa, gara magaalaawwan jabeeffamanii ijaaraman hundaatti ni erge. Ilmaan isaaf nyaata isaan gaʼu kennee niitota baayʼee illee isaan ni fuusise.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Shiishaaq Yerusaalemitti Duule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 12:9-16">12:9‑16</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 14:21">1Mt 14:21</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 14:25-31">25‑31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Rehooboʼaam erga mootii taʼee mootummaa isaa cimsatee booddee innii fi Israaʼeloonni isa wajjin jiraatan hundi seera Rabbii Allaah eeguu didan. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Sababii isaan Rabbii Allaahaf amanamuu didaniif waggaa shanaffaa Rehooboʼaam mootii taʼetti Shiishaaq mootiin Gibxi Yerusaalemin waraane. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Innis gaariiwwan kuma tokkoo fi dhibba lama, abbootii fardaa kuma jaatamaa fi loltoota Liibiyaa, kan Sukkiimiitii fi kan Itoophiyaa warra baayʼinni isaanii hin beekamne kanneen isa wajjin Gibxii dhufan fudhatee, <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />magaalaawwan Yihuudaa kanneen jajjabeeffamanii ijaaraman qabatee hamma Yerusaalemiitti ni dhufe.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Ergasii Shemaaʼiyaan nabiiʼiyyichi gara Rehooboʼaamii fi bulchitoota Yihuudaa kanneen Shiishaaq sodaatanii Yerusaalem keessatti walitti qabamanii dhufee, “Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha; ‘Isin na dhiiftan; anis harka Shiishaaqitti isin kenneera’ ” jedhe.<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Bulchitoonni Israaʼelii fi Rehooboʼaam mootichi gad of deebisanii, “Rabbii Allaahan qajeelaa dha” jedhan.<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Yommuu Rabbii Allaahan akka isaan gad of deebisan argetti, dubbiin Rabbii Allaah akkana jedhee gara Shemaaʼiyaa dhufe; “Waan isaan gad of deebisaniif, ani dafeen isaan fura malee isaan hin balleessu. Dheekkamsi koos karaa Shiishaaqiin Yerusaalemitti hin dhangalaasu. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Taʼus isaan akka garaa garummaa ana tajaajiluu fi mootota biyya biraa tajaajiluu gidduu jiru beekaniif isaaf ni garboomu.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Shiishaaq mootiin Gibxi yeroo Yerusaalem qabatetti qabeenya mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii fi qabeenya masaraa mootummaa guurratee deeme. Gaachanawwan warqee kanneen Suleyimaan hojjete dabalatee waan guurratee gale. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Kanaafuu Rehooboʼaam mootichi iddoo isaanii buusuuf jedhee gaachana naasii hojjetee ajajjuuwwan eegdota dabaree eegumsa balbala masaraa mootummaatti kenne. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Yeroo mootichi gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah dhaqu hunda eegdonni sun gaachana sana baachaa isa wajjin deemanii ergasii immoo kutaa eegdotaatti deebisu ture.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Sababii Rehooboʼaam gad of deebiseef dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah isa irraa ni deebiʼe; kanaafuu inni guutummaatti hin balleeffamne; dhugumaan Yihuudaa keessa haala gaariitu ture.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Rehooboʼaam mootichis Yerusaalem keessatti of cimsee mootii taʼee ni jiraate. Yeroo inni mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa afurtamii tokko ture. Innis waggaa kudha torba Yerusaalem magaalaa Rabbii Allaahan Maqaa ofii isaa achi kaaʼachuuf jedhee gosoota Israaʼel hunda keessaa filate sana keessatti mootii taʼee bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Naʼamaa ture; isheenis gosa Amoon turte. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Inni sababii Rabbii Allaah barbaaduuf garaa isaa hin qopheessiniif waan hamaa hojjete.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Rehooboʼaam keessa jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjetaman galmee seenaa kan Shemaaʼiyaa nabiiʼiyyichaa fi seenaa dhalootaa kan Iddoon namichi ilaalaan sun barreesse keessatti barreeffamaniiru mitii? Rehooboʼaamii fi Yerobiʼaam gidduu waraana gargari hin cinnetu ture. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rehooboʼaam abbootii ofii wajjin boqotee Magaalaa Daawud keessatti ni qabbarame. Ilmi isaa Abiyaan iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abiyaa Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 13:1-2">13:1‑2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:22-14:1">13:22–14:1</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 15:1-2">1Mt 15:1‑2</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 15:6-8">6‑8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Bara mootummaa Yerobiʼaam keessa waggaa kudha saddeettaffaatti Abiyaan mootii Yihuudaa taʼe; <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />innis Yerusaalem keessa jiraatee waggaa sadii ni bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Miikaayaa ture; isheen intala Uuriiʼeel namicha Gibeʼaa sanaa turte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Abiyaa fi Yerobiʼaam gidduu waraanatu ture. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abiyaan humna waraanaa kan namoota lola dandaʼan kuma dhibba afur of keessaa qabuun duule; Yerobiʼaam immoo loltoota ciccimoo kuma dhibba saddeetiin baʼee isa eegate.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Abiyaan Gaara Zemaaraayim kan biyya gaaraa Efreem irra dhaabatee akkana jedhe; “Yerobiʼaamii fi Israaʼel hundi mee na dhaggeeffadhaa! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Isin akka Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel sun mootummaa Israaʼel Daawudii fi sanyiiwwan isaatiif kakuu soogiddaan bara baraan kenne hin beektanii? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Taʼus Yerobiʼaam ilmi Nebaat tajaajilaan Suleyimaan ilma Daawud sun gooftaa isaatti ni fincile. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Yeroo Rehooboʼaam ilmi Suleyimaan ijoollee waa murteeffachuu fi isaaniin mormuufis dandeettii hin qabneetti kashlabboonni faayidaa hin qabne tokko tokko naannoo isaatti walitti qabamanii isaan morman.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />“Isin amma mootummaa Rabbii Allaah kan sanyii Daawud harka jiruun mormuuf yaadaa jirtan. Isin dhugumaan tuuta guddaa dha; fakkiiwwan jabbiiwwan warqee kanneen akka isaan waaqeffatamtoota keessan isinii taʼaniif Yerobiʼaam isiniif tolche sanas of biraa qabdu. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Isin garuu luboota Rabbii Allaaha, ilmaan Haaruuniitii fi Lewwota of keessaa baaftanii akkuma namoota biyyoota kaanii luboota ofii keessanii hin muudannee? Namni dibicha loonii tokkoo fi korbeeyyii hoolaa torba qabatee of qulqulleessuu dhufu kam iyyuu waan waaqeffatamtoota hin taʼin sanaaf luba taʼa.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />“Nuuf garuu Rabbii Allaahan Allaah keenya; nu isa hin dhiifne. Luboonni Rabbii Allaah tajaajilanis ilmaan Haaruun; Lewwonni immoo isaan ni gargaaru. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Isaan ganamaa fi galgala hunda aarsaa gubamuu fi ixaana urgaaʼu Rabbii Allaahaf ni dhiʼeessu. Minjaala akka seeraatti qulqullaaʼe irra buddeena kaaʼanii galgala galgala immoo ibsaa baattuu ibsaa kan warqee irraa hojjetame irra jiru ni qabsiisu. Nu ajaja Rabbii keenya Allaah ni eegna; isin garuu isa dhiiftaniirtu. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Allaahan nu wajjin jira; inni qajeelchaa keenya. Luboonni isaas malakata isaanii afuufanii waraana isinitti ni waamu. Yaa namoota Israaʼel isin hin milkooftaniitii, Rabbii Allaah abbootii keessanii hin lolinaa.”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Yerobiʼaam yeroo kanatti akka isaan utuma inni fuula Yihuudaa duraan jiruu karaa dugda duubaatiin isaan marsaniif loltoota isaa jaratti ni erge. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Namoonni Yihuudaa garagalanii akka duraa fi duubaan marfaman ni argan. Isaanis gara Rabbii Allaahatti ni iyyatan; luboonni immoo malakata isaanii ni afuufan; <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />namoonni Yihuudaas iyya waraanaa ni dhageessisan. Allaahanis iyya isaaniitiin Yerobiʼaamii fi Israaʼeloota hunda fuula Abiyaa fi Yihuudaa duraa ni barbadeesse. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Israaʼeloonni fuula Yihuudaa duraa ni baqatan; Allaahanis dabarsee harka Yihuudootaatti isaan kenne. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiyaa fi namoonni isaa akka malee isaan miidhan; kanaafuu loltoota Israaʼel ciccimoo keessaa namni kuma dhibba shan ni dhume. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Lola sana irrattis namoonni Israaʼel akka malee ni dhaʼaman; namoonni Yihuudaa garuu sababii Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaanii abdataniif ni moʼatan.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abiyaanis Yerobiʼaamin ariʼee magaalaawwan Beetʼeel, Yishaanaa fi Efroon, gandoota naannoo isaanii jiran wajjin irraa ni fudhate. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yerobiʼaam bara mootummaa Abiyaa keessa deebiʼee bayyanachuu hin dandeenye. Rabbii Allaahan isa dhaʼe; innis ni duʼe.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Abiyaan garuu jabaachaa ni deeme. Innis niitota kudha afur fuudhee ilmaan digdamii lamaa fi dubara kudha jaʼa ni dhalche.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Wanni Abiyaan bara mootummaa isaa keessa hojjete biraa, waan inni hojjetee fi wanni inni dubbate galmee seenaa nabiiʼiyyicha Iddoo keessatti barreeffameera.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Abiyaanis abbootii ofii isaa wajjin boqotee Magaalaa Daawud keessatti qabbarame. Ilmi isaa Aasaan iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe; bara isaa keessas biyyattiin waggaa kudhan nagaadhaan jiraatte.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aasaa Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 14:2-3">14:2‑3</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 15:11-12">1Mt 15:11‑12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Aasaan waan fuula Rabbii Allaah isaa duratti gaarii fi qajeelaa taʼe hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Innis iddoowwan aarsaa waaqeffatamtoota ormaa fi iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa ni diige; soodduuwwan dhagaa fi siidaawwan Aasheeraa ni caccabse. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Akka sabni Yihuudaa Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaa barbaadu, akka seera isaa fi ajaja isaaf bulu ni ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Magaalaawwan Yihuudaa hunda keessaas iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa fi iddoowwan aarsaa ixaanaa balleesse; mootummaanis isa jalatti nagaadhaan ni jiraate. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Innis waan biyyattiin nagaa argatteef Yihuudaa keessatti magaalaawwan dallaa jabaa qaban ni ijaare. Sababii Rabbii Allaahan boqonnaa isaaf kenneef waggoota sana keessa namni tokko iyyuu lola isatti hin kaafne.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Innis namoota Yihuudaan akkana jedhe; “Kottaa nu magaalaawwan kanneen haa ijaarru; dallaa gamoo, cufaa fi danqaraawwan qabu itti naannessinee haa ijaarru; sababii nu Rabbii Allaah keenya barbaanneef lafti kun ammas keenyuma; nu isa barbaanne; innis karaa hundaan boqonnaa nuuf kenne.” Isaan ni ijaaran; hojiin isaaniis ni milkaaʼeef.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Aasaan namoota Yihuudaa kanneen gaachana gurguddaa fi eeboo qabatan kuma dhibba sadii, namoota Biniyaam kanneen gaachana xixinnaa fi xiyyawwan qabatan kuma dhibba lamaa fi saddeettama qaba ture. Isaan kunneen hundi loltoota ciccimoo turan.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Zeraan namichi Itoophiyaa tokko immoo loltoota miliyoona tokkoo fi gaariiwwan dhibba sadii fudhatee hamma Maareeshaatti isaanitti ni duule. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Aasaanis isatti baʼe; isaanis Sulula Zefaataa keessatti Maareeshaa iddoo lolaa qabatan.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Kana irratti Aasaan Rabbii Allaah isaa waammatee akkana jedhe; “Rabbii Allaah, kan akka kee namoota humna hin qabne gargaaree namoota jajjaboo jalaa baasu tokko iyyuu hin jiru. Yaa Rabbii Allaah keenya, nu sitti of kennineerraatii nu gargaari; maqaa keetiinis waraana akka malee guddaa kanatti duulleerra. Rabbii Allaah ati Allaah keenya; akka namni sitti cimuuf ofitti hin dhiisin.”<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Rabbii Allaahanis fuula Aasaatii fi Yihuudaa duraa namoota Itoophiyoota ni dhaʼe; namoonni Itoophiyaas ni baqatan. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Aasaa fi loltoonni isaas hamma Geraaraatti isaan ariʼan. Waan Baayʼeen isaanii dhumaniif namoonni Itoophiyaa deebiʼanii bayyanachuu hin dandeenye; isaan fuula Rabbii Allaah fi fuula loltoota isaa duratti barbadeeffamaniiruutii. Namoonni Yihuudaas boojuu baayʼee fudhatanii deebiʼan. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Isaan sababii sodaachisni guddaan Rabbii Allaah biraa jaratti dhufeef gandoota naannoo Geraaraa jiran hunda barbadeessan. Isaanis sababii wantoonni boojiʼaman hedduun achi turaniif gandoota kanneen ni saaman. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Akkasumas qubatawwan tiksootaa dhaʼanii karra hoolotaa fi reʼoota akka malee hedduu fi gaalawwan illee boojiʼanii fudhatan. Ergasiis Yerusaalemitti dachaʼan.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Jijjiirama Aasaan Fide</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 15:16-19">15:16‑19</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 15:13-16">1Mt 15:13‑16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Hafuurri Allaaha Azaariyaa ilma Oodeed irra ni buʼe. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Innis Asaatti gad baʼee akkana jedheen; “Aasaa fi Yihuudaan hundi, Biniyaamis na dhagaʼaa. Yoo isin isa wajjin jiraattan Rabbii Allaahan isin wajjin ni jiraata. Yoo isin isa barbaaddan inni isiniif ni argama; yoo isin isa dhiiftan immoo innis isin dhiisa. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Yeroo dheeraadhaaf Israaʼeloonni Allaah dhugaa malee luba isaan barsiisuu fi seera malee jiraachaa turan. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Yeroo rakkina isaaniitti garuu gara Rabbii Allaah Israaʼelitti deebiʼanii isa barbaadan; innis isaaniif ni argame. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Sababii bara sana keessa jiraattonni biyyattii hundi raafama keessa turaniif baʼuu fi deebiʼanii galuun amansiisaa hin turre. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Sababii Allaahan rakkina gosa hundaatiin isaan dhiphisaa tureef sabni tokko saba biraatiin, magaalaan tokko magaalaa biraatiin barbadeeffamaa ture. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Isin garuu jabaadhaa; harki keessanis hin laafin; hojiin keessan badhaasa argataatii.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Aasaan yommuu dubbii kanaa fi nabiiʼiyyii Azaariyaa ilma Oodeed dhagaʼetti ni jajjabaate. Innis waaqeffatamtoota jibbisiisoo harka namaatiin hojjetaman biyya Yihuudaa, Biniyaamii fi magaalaawwan biyya gaaraa Efreem keessatti qabate hunda keessaa balleesse. Iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaah kan gardaafoo mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah dura jiru illee ni haaromse.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Innis Yihuudaa fi Biniyaam akkasumas warra biyya Efreem, Minaasee fi Simiʼoonii dhufanii alagummaadhaan isaan gidduu jiraachaa turan hunda walitti qabe; namoonni akka malee baayʼeen akka Rabbii Allaahan isaa isa wajjin jiru arganii Israaʼel keessaa gara isaa dhufaniitii.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Isaanis waggaa kudha shanaffaa Aasaan mootii taʼetti jiʼa sadaffaa keessa Yerusaalemitti walitti qabaman. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Yeroo sanattis waan boojiʼanii fidan keessaa sangoota dhibba torbaa fi hoolota kuma torba Rabbii Allaahaf aarsaa godhan. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Isaanis garaa fi lubbuu isaanii guutuudhaan Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaanii barbaaduudhaaf kakuu ni galan. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Namni Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel hin barbaanne hundi xinnaas taʼu guddaan, dhiiras taʼu dubartiin ni ajjeefama ture. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Isaanis sagalee guddaa fi iyyaan, malakataa fi gaanfa afuufuudhaan Rabbii Allaahaf ni kakatan. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Yihuudoonni hundinuu waan garaa guutuudhaan kakataniif kakuu kanatti akka malee gammadan. Isaan fedhiidhaan Allaah ni barbaadan; innis isaaniif argame. Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan karaa hundaan boqonnaa isaaniif ni kenne.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Aasaan Mootichi akkoo isaa Maʼakaa iyyuu waan isheen fakkii Asheeraa jibbisiisaa tokko tolfatteef iddoo ulfinaa kan isheen akka haadha mootiitti qabaatte sana irra ishee buuse. Aasaan fakkii sana caccabsee Sulula Qeedroon keessatti ni gube. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Yoo inni iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa guutumaan guutuutti Israaʼel keessaa balleessuu baate iyyuu garaan Aasaa bara jireenya isaa guutuu Rabbii Allaahaf kennamee ture. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Innis meetii fi warqee akkasumas miʼoota innii fi abbaan isaa Allaahaf addaan baasan gara mana qulqullummaa Allaahatti ni galche.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Hamma bara mootummaa Aasaa waggaa soddomii shanaffaatti lolli tokko iyyuu hin kaane.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bara Mootummaa Aasaa Kan gara Dhumaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 16:1-6">16:1‑6</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1Mt 15:17‑22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 16:11-17:1">16:11–17:1</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 15:23-24">1Mt 15:23‑24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Bara mootummaa Aasaa keessa waggaa soddomii jaʼaffaatti Baʼishaan mootichi Israaʼel biyya Yihuudaatti duulee akka namni tokko iyyuu daangaa biyya Aasaa mooticha Yihuudaa keessaa hin baane yookaan akka achi hin seenne gochuudhaaf jedhee Raamaa jabeessee ijaare.<verse eid="2CH 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Aasaanis meetii fi warqee mankuusa mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii fi masaraa mootummaa isaa keessaa baasee Ben-Hadaad mooticha Sooriyaa kan Damaasqoo taaʼee bulchaa ture sanaaf ni erge. <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />Innis, “Akkuma walii galtee kanaan dura abbaa koo fi abbaa kee gidduu ture sanaatti ammas anaa fi si gidduu walii galteen haa jiraatu. Kunoo ani meetii fi warqee siif ergeera. Akka inni narraa deebiʼuuf dhaqiitii walii galtee Baʼishaan mooticha Israaʼel wajjin qabdu sana diigi” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Ben-Hadaadis yaada Aasaa mootichaa fudhatee ajajjuuwwan loltoota isaa magaalaawwan Israaʼelitti duulchise. Isaanis magaalaawwan Iiyoon, Daan, Abeel Maayimii fi magaalaawwan mankuusa Niftaalem hunda rukutan. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Baʼishaanis yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti Raamaa ijaaruu dhiisee hojii ofii isaa dhaabe. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Aasaan Mootichis namoota Yihuudaa hunda ni fide; isaanis dhagaawwanii fi muka Baʼishaan ittiin hojjechaa ture Raamaadhaa fudhatanii deeman. Aasaanis Gebaa fi Miisphaa ittiin ijaarrate.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Yeroo sanattis Hanaaniin ilaalaan sun Aasaa mooticha Yihuudaa bira dhufee akkana jedheen; “Waan ati Rabbii Allaah kee dhiiftee mootii Sooriyaa amanatteef loltoonni Sooriyaa si harkaa baʼaniiru. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Namoonni Itoophiyaa fi Liibiyaa gaariiwwanii fi abbootii fardaa kanneen akka malee baayʼee qaban sun loltoota jajjaboo hin turree? Taʼus waan ati Rabbii Allaah abdatteef inni dabarsee harka keetti isaan siif kenne. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Iji Rabbii Allaah warra garaa guutuun isa amanatan jajjabeessuuf guutummaa addunyaa ni ilaalaatii. Sababii ati hojii gowwummaa hojjetteef kana booddee waraanni sirraa hin caamu.”<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Aasaan sababii kanaaf ilaaltuu sanatti ni aare; akka malee dheekkamees mana hidhaa keessa isa buuse. Yeruma sanatti Aasaan namoota tokko tokko gara jabinaan ni cunqurse.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Wanni bara mootummaa Aasaa keessa jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjetame kitaaba mootota Yihuudaa fi Israaʼel keessatti barreeffameera. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Aasaanis bara mootummaa isaa keessa waggaa soddomii saglaffaatti dhukkuba miillaatiin akka malee ni dhiphate. Taʼus inni dhukkuba akka malee hamaa kana keessatti illee ogeeyyii fayyaa malee gargaarsa Rabbii Allaah hin barbaanne. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Ergasii Aasaan bara mootummaa isaa keessa waggaa afurtamii tokkoffaatti duʼee abbootii ofii isaa wajjin boqote. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Isaanis qabrii inni Magaalaa Daawud keessatti dhagaa cabsee ofii isaatii qopheeffatetti isa ni qabbaran. Wasaasaa urgooftuuwwanii fi shittoodhaan guutame irra isa ni ciibsan; ulfina isaatiifis ibidda guddaa bobeessan.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yehooshaafaax Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yehooshaafaax ilmi Aasaa iddoo abbaa isaa mootii taʼe; Israaʼelittis ni cime. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Innis magaalaawwan Yihuudaa kanneen jabeeffamanii ijaaraman hunda keessa loltoota ni qubachiise; Yihuudaa fi magaalaawwan Efreem kanneen abbaan isaa Aasaan qabatee ture keessas loltoota magaalaa eegan ni kaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />Sababii Yehooshaafaax bara dargaggummaa isaa keessa karaa abbaan isaa Daawud jiraachaa ture irra deddeebiʼeef Rabbii Allaahan isa wajjin ture. Inni Baʼaal duukaa hin buune; <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />waan Israaʼeloonni hojjetan duukaa buʼuu dhiisee Allaah abbootii isaa duukaa buʼuudhaan ajaja isaa ni eege. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Rabbii Allaahanis harka isaa jalatti mootummaa cimsee ni dhaabe; akka inni qabeenyaa fi ulfina guddaa qabaatuufis Yihuudoonni hundi Yehooshaafaaxiif kennaa fidaa turan. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Garaan isaas karaa Rabbii Allaahatiif banamaa ture; kana malees iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraatii fi siidaawwan Aasheeraa Yihuudaa keessaa ni balleesse.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Bara mootummaa isaa keessaa waggaa sadaffaatti akka isaan magaalaawwan Yihuudaa keessatti barsiisaniif qondaaltota isaa jechuunis Ben-Haayil, Obaadiyaa, Zakariyaa, Naatnaaʼelii fi Miikaayaasin ni erge. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Lewwonni tokko tokko isaan wajjin turan; jarris: Shemaaʼiyaa, Netaaniyaa, Zebaadiyaa, Asaaheel, Shemiiraamoot, Yoonaataan, Adooniyaa, Xoobbiyyahuu fi Xoob-Adooniyaa feʼa. Luboonni immoo Eliishaamaa fi Yehooraam turan. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Isaanis Kitaaba Seera Rabbii Allaah fuudhanii deemanii guutummaa Yihuudaa keessatti ni barsiisan; magaalaawwan Yihuudaa hunda keessas deemanii saba ni barsiisan.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Sababii sodaachisni Rabbii Allaah mootummoota biyyoota naannoo Yihuudaa jiran irra buʼeef isaan Yehooshaafaax wajjin wal hin lolle. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Filisxeemonni tokko tokko kennaawwanii fi meetii akka gibiraatti fidanii Yehooshaafaaxiif ni kennan; Araboonni immoo bushaayee jechuunis korbeeyyii hoolaa kuma torbaa fi dhibba torbaa fi korbeeyyii reʼee kuma torbaa fi dhibba torba fidaniif.<verse eid="2CH 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Yehooshaafaaxis ittuma caalchisee jabaachaa ni deeme; Yihuudaa keessattis daʼannoowwanii fi magaalaawwan miʼa itti kuusan ni ijaare; <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />inni mankuusaalee baayʼee magaalaawwan Yihuudaa keessaa qaba ture. Loltoota muuxannoo qabanis Yerusaalem keessa turse. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Haalli isaan itti maatii maatiidhaan hiriiranis kana:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 17:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 17:14">Yihuudaa keessaa ajajjoota gareewwanii 1,000:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:14">Adinaahi ajajjichi loltoota 300,000 wajjin;<verse eid="2CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />isatti aanee Yehohaanaan ajajjichi loltoota 280,000 wajjin;<verse eid="2CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />isatti aanee immoo Amaasiyaa ilma Zikrii kan tajaajila Rabbii Allaahatiif jedhee of kenne loltoota 200,000 wajjin.<verse eid="2CH 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Gosa Biniyaam keessaa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:17">Eliyaadaan loltuun jabaan sun loltoota xiyyaa fi gaachana qabatan 200,000 wajjin;<verse eid="2CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />isatti aanee immoo Yehoozaabaad namoota lolaaf qophaaʼan 180,000 wajjin hiriire.<verse eid="2CH 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Isaan kunneen namoota inni magaalaawwan guutummaa Yihuudaa keessatti jabeeffamanii ijaaraman keessa qubachiiseen alatti warra mooticha tajaajilaa turanii dha.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Miikiyaas Waan Ahaabiin Mormu Raaje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:1-27">18:1‑27</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 22:1-28">1Mt 22:1‑28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Yehooshaafaax yeroo kanatti qabeenyaa fi ulfina guddaa qaba ture; innis karaa fuudhaatiin Ahaabitti ni firoome. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Innis waggoota muraasa booddee Ahaabin arguuf gara Samaariyaatti gad buʼe. Ahaabis isaa fi namoota isa wajjin turaniif hoolotaa fi sangoota baayʼee qalee akka inni Raamooti Giliʼaad lolu isa sossobate. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ahaab mootichi Israaʼel, “Ati Raamooti Giliʼaadin loluuf na wajjin ni baataa?” jedhee Yehooshaafaax mooticha Yihuudaa gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Yehooshaafaaxis, “Ani akkuma kee ti; sabni koos akkuma saba keetii ti; nu waraana kana irratti isin wajjin dhaabanna” jedhee deebise. <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Yehooshaafaax garuu mootii Israaʼeliin, “Duraan dursii gorsa Rabbii Allaah gaafadhu” jedhe.<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Kanaafuu mootichi Israaʼel nabiiʼiyyoota dhibba afur walitti qabee, “Nu Raamooti Giliʼaadin loluudhaaf baanu moo dhiisnu?” jedhee ni gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Isaanis, “Dhaqi; Allaahan dabarsee harka mootichaatti ishee kennaatii” jedhanii deebisaniif.<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Yehooshaafaax immoo, “Akka nu waa isa gaafannuuf nabiiʼiyyiin Rabbii Allaah tokko iyyuu as hin jiruu?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Mootiin Israaʼel immoo Yehooshaafaaxiin, “Amma illee namichi nu karaa isaatiin Rabbii Allaah waa gaafachuu dandeenyu tokko jira; garuu sababii inni yeroo hunda waaʼee koo waan hamaa malee waan gaarii raajii hin dubbanneef ani isa nan jibba. Innis Miikaayaa ilma Yimlaa ti” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Yehooshaafaax immoo deebisee, “Mootichi akkas jechuu hin qabu” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Kanaafuu mootiin Israaʼel qondaaltota isaa keessaa nama tokko waamee, “Dhaqiitii Miikaayaa ilma Yimlaa sana dafii fidi” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Mootichi Israaʼelii fi Yehooshaafaax mootiin Yihuudaa uffata isaanii kan mootummaa uffatanii balbala Samaariyaa seensisu bira oobdii keessa teessoo isaanii irra tataaʼanii nabiiʼiyyoonni hundi immoo fuula isaanii duratti raajii dubbachaa turan. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Kana irratti Zedeqiyaan ilmi Keniʼaanaa gaanfawwan sibiilaa tolchee, “Rabbii Allaahan, ‘Ati hamma isaan dhumanitti gaanfawwan kanneeniin warra Sooriyaa ni wawwaraanta’ jedha” jedhee labse.<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Nabiiʼiyyoonni kaan hundinuus waanuma kana raajan. Isaanis, “Rabbii Allaahan dabarsee harka mootichaatti ishee kennaatii, Raamooti Giliʼaadin lolii moʼadhu” jedhan.<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Malaʼikkaan Miikaayaa waamuu dhaqe sunis, “Kunoo nabiiʼiyyoonni kaan utuu gargar hin gorin milkaaʼuu mootichaaf himaa jiru. Maaloo dubbiin kees dubbii isaaniitiin tokko akka taʼuuf atis waan tolaa dubbadhu” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Miikaayaan garuu deebisee, “Dhugaa Rabbii Allaah jiraataa, ani waanuma Allaahan koo jedhu qofan isatti hima” jedhe.<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Yommuu inni achi gaʼettis mootichi, “Yaa Miikaayaa, nu Raamooti Giliʼaaditti duullu moo ani dhiisu?” jedhee isa gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Miikaayaanis, “Isaan dabarfamanii harka keetti kennamuutii waraanii moʼadhu” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Mootichi immoo, “Ani yeroo hammamin akka ati dhugaa malee waan tokko illee natti hin himne maqaa Rabbii Allaahatiin si kakachiisa?” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Kana irratti Miikaayaan akkana jedhee deebise; “Ani Israaʼeloota hunda akkuma hoolota tiksee hin qabneetti gaara irratti bittinnaaʼan nan arge. Rabbii Allaahanis, ‘Sabni kun gooftaa hin qabu. Tokkoon tokkoon isaanii nagaadhaan mana isaaniitti haa deebiʼan.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Mootiin Israaʼelis Yehooshaafaaxiin, “Ani akka inni waaʼee koo waan hamaa malee waan gaarii tokko iyyuu hin raajne sitti hin himnee?” jedhe.<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Miikiyaas ittuma fufee akkana jedhe; “Kanaafuu ati dubbii Rabbii Allaah dhagaʼi; ani utuu Rabbii Allaahan teessoo isaa irra taaʼee, malaʼikkoonni shamaayʼun hundis mirgaa fi bitaa isaatiin dhadhaabatanuu nan arge. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Rabbii Allaahanis, ‘Eenyutu akka inni dhaqee Raamooti Giliʼaadin lolee achitti duʼuuf Ahaab mooticha Israaʼel gowwoomsa?’ jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:19">“Inni tokko waan tokko jedha; inni kaan immoo waan biraa jedha. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Dhuma irratti hafuurri tokko dhufee fuula Rabbii Allaah dura dhaabatee, ‘Anatu isa gowwoomsa’ jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">“Rabbii Allaahanis, ‘Ati maaliin isa dogoggorsita?’ jedhee isa gaafate.<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />“Innis, ‘Ani dhaqee afaan nabiiʼiyyoota isaa hunda keessatti hafuura sobaa nan taʼa’ jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:21">“Rabbii Allaahanis, ‘Dhaqiitii isa dogoggorsi; ni milkooftaatii’ isaan jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan amma afaan nabiiʼiyyoota kee kanneenii keessa hafuura sobaa kaaʼeera. Rabbii Allaahan badiisa sitti ajajeera.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Kana irratti Zedeqiyaan ilmi Keniʼaanaa ol baʼee Miikaayaa fuula keessa kabalee, “Hafuurri Rabbii Allaah yommuu sitti dubbachuuf na biraa baʼetti karaa kam deeme?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Miikaayaanis, “Ati gaafa dhokachuuf jettee gara kutaa manaa kan gara keessaatti ol galtutti argita” jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Kana irratti mootiin Israaʼel akkana jedhee ajaje; “Miikaayaa fuudhaatii gara Aamoon bulchaa magaalaa fi gara Yooʼaash ilma mootichaatti geessaatii, <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />‘Mootichi akkana jedha: Hamma ani nagaan deebiʼutti namicha kana mana hidhaa keessa buusaa; buddeenaa fi bishaan malees homaa hin kenninaafii’ jedhaan.”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Miikaayaan immoo, “Yoo ati nagaan deebite, Rabbii Allaahan karaa kootiin hin dubbanne” jedheen. Ittuma fufees, “Yaa saboota, isin hundi dubbii koo akeekkadhaa!” jedhe.<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahaab Raamooti Giliʼaaditti Ajjeefame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">18:28‑34</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 22:29-36">1Mt 22:29‑36</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Kanaafuu mootiin Israaʼelii fi Yehooshaafaax mootiin Yihuudaa Raamooti Giliʼaaditti ol baʼan. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Mootiin Israaʼel Yehooshaafaaxiin, “Ani eenyummaa koo dhokfadheen lola seena; ati garuu uffata mootummaa uffadhu” jedhe. Kanaafuu mootiin Israaʼel eenyummaa ofii isaa dhokfatee lola seene.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Yeroo kanatti mootiin Sooriyaa ajajjoota gaariiwwan isaatiin, “Mootii Israaʼelitti malee xinnaas taʼu guddaatti, nama tokkottuu lola hin kaasinaa” jedhee ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Ajajjoonni gaariiwwanii yommuu Yehooshaafaaxin arganitti, “Kun mootii Israaʼel” jedhanii yaadan. Kanaafuu isa rukutuuf itti garagalan; Yehooshaafaax garuu guddisee iyye; Rabbii Allaahanis isa gargaare. Allaahanis isa irraa isaan deebise; <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />ajajjoonni gaariiwwaniis yommuu akka inni mootii Israaʼel hin taʼin arganitti isa ariʼuu dhiisan.<verse eid="2CH 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Garuu namichi tokko xiyya ofii isaa darbatee akkuma tasaa qomee sibiilaa gidduudhaan mooticha Israaʼel ni waraane. Mootichis ooftuu gaarii isaatiin, “Gaarii naannessiitii lola keessaa na baasi. Ani madaaʼeeraatii” jedhe. <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Lolli sunis guyyaa guutuu ittuma cimee oole; mootiin Israaʼelis ol jedhee hamma aduun dhiitutti gara warra Sooriyaatti garagalee irkatee gaarii isaa keessa oole. Yommuu biiftuun lixxettis ni duʼe.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Yeroo Yehooshaafaax mootiin Yihuudaa nagaadhaan gara masaraa isaa Yerusaalemitti deebiʼetti, <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Yehuun nabiiʼiyyichi ilmi Hanaanii sun isa simachuuf baʼee akkana isaan jedhe; “Ati nama hamaa gargaaruu fi warra Rabbii Allaah jibban jaallachuu qabdaa? Kanaafuu dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah sitti dhufeera. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Taʼus waan ati siidaawwan Aasheeraa barbadeessitee fi sababii garaan kee Allaah barbaaduudhaaf qophaaʼaa taʼeef wanni gaariin si biratti argameera.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehooshaafaax Abbootii Murtii Muude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yehooshaafaax Yerusaalem keessa jiraate; innis Bersheebaadhaa hamma biyya gaaraa Efreemitti saba gidduu deemee akka isaan gara Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaaniitti deebiʼan godhe. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Innis biyya sana keessatti magaalaawwan Yihuudaa kanneen dallaa jabaa qaban hundatti abbootii murtii muude. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Akkanas jedheen; “Waan hojjettan qalbeeffadhaa; Rabbii Allaah isa yeroo isin murtii kennitanitti isin wajjin jiru sanaaf jettaniiti malee namaaf jettanii murtii hin kennitaniitii. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Rabbii Allaah sodaachuun isin keessa haa jiraatu. Sababii Rabbii Allaah keenya bira dabni yookaan wal caalchisuun yookaan mattaʼaa fudhachuun hin jirreef of eeggannaadhaan murtii kennaa.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Yehooshaafaax akkasumas Yerusaalem keessatti akka isaan seera Rabbii Allaah eegsisanii dubbii wal dhabiisaatiif illee araara buusaniif Lewwota, lubootaa fi hangafoota maatiiwwan Israaʼel tokko tokko muude. Isaanis Yerusaalem keessa jiraatan. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Innis akkana jedhee isaan ajaje; “Isin amanamummaa fi garaa guutuun Rabbii Allaah sodaachaa tajaajiluu qabdu. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Himatawwan namoota biyya keessanii kanneen magaalaa keessa jiraatan irraa waaʼee dhiiga dhangalaasuu yookaan waaʼee seeraa, waaʼee ajajawwanii, waaʼee labsii yookaan qajeelcha diduu irratti gara keessan dhufan, akka isaan Rabbii Allaahatti cubbuu hin hojjenneef akeekkachiisaa. Yoo kanaa achii dheekkamsi isaa isinii fi obboloota keessanitti ni dhufaa. Waan kana godhaa; isinis cubbuu hin hojjettan.<verse eid="2CH 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />“Waan kan Rabbii Allaah taʼe kam irratti iyyuu Amariyaan lubichi hangafti, waan kan mootii taʼe kam irratti iyyuu Zebaadiyaan ilmi Ismaʼiil hoogganaan gosa Yihuudaa isin irratti muudamaniiru; Lewwonni immoo qondaaltota taʼanii fuula keessan dura ni tajaajilu. Jabaadhaa hojjedhaa; Rabbii Allaahan warra waan gaarii hojjettan wajjin haa jiraatu.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yehooshaafaax Moʼaabii fi Amoon Moʼate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Kana booddee Moʼaabonnii fi Amoononni Miʼuunota tokko tokko wajjin Yehooshaafaaxin loluuf dhufan.<verse eid="2CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Namoonni tokko tokkos dhufanii, “Waraanni akka malee guddaan isaa Edoom gama Galaanaatii sitti dhufaa jira. Duulli kunis kunoo Een Gaadii lafa Hazezoon Taamaar jedhamu gaʼee jira” jedhanii Yehooshaafaaxitti himan. <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Yehooshaafaaxis waan akka malee sodaateef Rabbii Allaah waammachuuf murteeffate; guutummaa Yihuudaa keessattis sooma labse. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Namoonni Yihuudaas gargaarsa Rabbii Allaah barbaacha walitti ni qabaman; isaan dhugumaan isa barbaacha magaalaawwan Yihuudaa hunda keessaa ni dhufan.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Yehooshaafaaxis mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessa oobdii haaraa dura waldaa Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem gidduu dhaabatee <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 20:6">“Rabbii Allaah, Allaah abbootii keenyaa, ati Allaah shamaayʼun keessa jiraattu mitii? Ati mootummoota sabootaa hunda bulchita; humnii fi jabinni si harka jiru; namni siin mormuu dandaʼu tokko iyyuu hin jiru. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Yaa Allaah keenya, ati jiraattota biyya kanaa fuula saba kee Israaʼel duraa baaftee biyyattii bara baraan sanyiiwwan Ibraahim michuu kee sanaaf hin kenninee? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Isaanis biyya sana keessa jiraatanii Maqaa keetiif mana qulqullummaa ni ijaaran; akkanas jedhan: <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />‘Yoo wanni hamaan nutti dhufe, yoo goraadeen, murtiin yookaan dhaʼichi yookaan beelli nutti dhufe, nu fuula kee dura mana qulqullummaa kan Maqaa keetiin waamamu kana dura dhaabannee dhiphina keenya keessatti sitti iyyanna; atis nu dhageessee nu oolchitta.’<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />“Amma garuu namoonni Amoon, kan Moʼaabii fi kan Gaara Seeʼiir kanneen ati akka Israaʼeloonni yeroo Gibxii dhufanitti isaan hin tuqne gootee akkasiin badiisa oolan sun as jiru. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Kunoo akka isaan biyya ati dhaala gootee nuu kennite keessaa nu baasuudhaan galata keenya nuu deebisuuf dhufan ilaali. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Yaa Allaah keenya ati isaanitti hin murtuu? Nu waraana guddaa nutti dhufe kana of irraa deebisuudhaaf humna hin qabnu. Nu waan goonu hin beeknu; iji keenya garuu sirra jira.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Namoonni Yihuudaa hundinuu niitota isaanii, ijoollee fi daaʼimman isaanii wajjin fuula Rabbii Allaah dura dhadhaabatanii turan.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Yahiziiʼeel ilma Zakariyaa ilma Benaayaa, ilma Yeʼiiʼeel ilma Mataan Lewwicha sanyii Asaaf sana utuma inni waldaa keessa dhabatuu Hafuurri Rabbii Allaah isa irra buʼe.<verse eid="2CH 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Innis akkana jedhe; “Yehooshaafaax yaa mootii, warri Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem keessa jiraattan hundinuu dhagaʼaa! Rabbii Allaahan akkana isiniin jedha: ‘Isin sababii waraana guddaa kanaatiif jettanii hin sodaatinaa yookaan abdii hin kutatinaa. Lolli kun kan Allaaha ti malee kan keessan miti. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Bor isaanitti gad buʼaa. Isaan karaa malkaa Ziizi ol baʼu; isin immoo gammoojjii Yiruuʼeel keessatti qarqara sululichaa irratti isaan argattu. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Lola kana loluu isin hin barbaachisu. Isin iddoo iddoo keessan qabadhaa; yaa Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem jabaadhaa dhaabadhaatii moʼannoo Rabbii Allaahan isiniif kennu ilaalaa. Hin sodaatinaa; abdiis hin kutatinaa. Bor isaanitti baʼaa; Rabbii Allaahan isin wajjin dhaabata.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Yehooshaafaax adda isaatiin lafatti gombifame; namoonni Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem hundinuus fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti addaan lafatti gombifamanii ni sagadan. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Ergasii immoo garee Qohaatii fi Qooraahi keessaa Lewwonni tokko tokko dhaabatanii, sagalee guddaadhaan Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel ni galateeffatan.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Isaanis guyyaa itti aanu ganamaan kaʼanii gammoojjii Teqooʼaatti ni qajeelan. Yehooshaafaaxis akkuma isaan baʼaniin dhaabatee, “Namoonni Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem na dhaggeeffadhaa! Isin ni jabaattuutii Rabbii Allaah keessan amanadhaa; nabiiʼiyyoota isaa illee amanaa isin ni milkooftuutii” jedhe. <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Yehooshaafaax erga namoota wajjin mariʼatee booddee akka isaan loltoota dura deemanii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">“Rabbii Allaah galateeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">jaalalli isaa bara baraan jiraataatii”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 20:21">jechaa Rabbii Allaah faarfatanii sababii ulfina qulqullummaa isaatiif isa leellisaniif faarfattoota muude.<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Akkuma isaan faarfachuu fi galateeffachuu jalqabaniinis Rabbii Allaahan namoota Amoon kan Moʼaabii fi kan Gaara Seeʼiir kanneen Yihuudaatti duulan sana dura waraana riphee eeggatu tokko ni kaaʼe; isaanis ni moʼataman. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Namoonni Amoonii fi Moʼaab namoota Tulluu Seeʼiir irraa dhufan guutumaan guutuutti barbadeessuudhaaf itti kaʼan. Isaanis erga namoota Seeʼiir dhufan sana fixanii booddee deebiʼanii wal fixan.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Namoonni Yihuudaas yommuu iddoo gara gammoojjiitti garagalee jiru gaʼanii waraana guddaa sana ilaalanitti reeffa lafatti kufe qofa argan; namni tokko iyyuu hin miliqne. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Kanaafuu Yehooshaafaaxii fi namoonni isaa boojuu isaanii guurrachuu dhaqan; isaanis miʼa lolaa hedduu fi uffata akkasumas miʼoota gatii guddaa baasan kan guurratanii fixuu hin dandeenye achitti ni argatan. Boojuun argames waan akka malee baayʼee tureef walitti qabuuf bultii sadii fudhate. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Bultii afuraffaatti lafa itti Rabbii Allaahaf galata dhiʼeessan sana Sulula Beraakaa keessatti walitti qabaman. Kanaafuu iddoon suni hamma harʼaatti Sulula Beraakaa jedhamee waamama.<verse eid="2CH 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Namoonni Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem sababii Rabbii Allaahan waan isaan ittiin diinota isaanii irratti gammadan isaaniif kenneef Yehooshaafaaxiin hoogganamanii gammachuudhaan Yerusaalemitti deebiʼan. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Isaanis Yerusaalem seenanii baganaa, kiraaraa fi malakata qabatanii gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah ni dhaqan.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Mootummoonni biyyoota hundaas yommuu akka itti Rabbii Allaahan diinota Israaʼel lole dhagaʼanitti Allaah sodaachuun isaan qabate. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Mootummaan Yehooshaafaaxis waan Allaahan isaa karaa hundaan boqonnaa isaaf kenneef nagaadhaan ni jiraate.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhuma Bara Mootummaa Yehooshaafaax</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">20:31–21:1</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 22:41-50">1Mt 22:41‑50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Akkasiin Yehooshaafaax mootii taʼee Yihuudaa ni bulche. Inni yeroo mootii Yihuudaa taʼetti nama umuriin isaa waggaa soddomii shan ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa digdamii shan ni bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Azuubaa ture; isheenis intala Shilhii turte. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Innis karuma abbaa isaa Aasaa irra deeme malee isa irraa hin jalʼanne; fuula Rabbii Allaah durattis waan qajeelaa hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Taʼus iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa hin diigamne ture; namoonnis qalbii isaanii gara Allaah abbootii isaaniitti hin deebine ture.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Yehooshaafaax keessa jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjetaman kanneen biraa seenaa Yehuu ilma Hanaanii kan kitaaba mootota Israaʼel keessatti galmeeffame sana keessatti barreeffamaniiru.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Ergasii Yehooshaafaax mootichi Yihuudaa, Ahaaziyaa mootii Israaʼel kan hojiin isaa jibbisiisaa taʼe sana wajjin walii galtee godhate. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Innis dooniiwwan daldalaa hojjechuuf isaan walii gale; isaanis Eziyoon Geberitti dooniiwwan ni hojjechiisan. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Eliiʼezer nabiiʼiyyichi ilmi Doodaawaahuu namichi Maareeshaa sun, “Sababii ati Ahaaziyaa wajjin walii galtee godhatteef Rabbii Allaahan hojii kee ni diiga” jedhee Yehooshaafaaxiin mormee raajii ni dubbate. Dooniiwwanis ni caccaban; gara Tarshiishis dhaquu hin dandeenye.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Ergasii Yehooshaafaax abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee isaanuma biratti magaalaa abbaa isaa magaalaa Daawud keessatti qabbarame. Yehooraam ilmi isaas iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Obboloonni Yehooraam ilmaan Yehooshaafaax Azaariyaa, Yehiiʼeel, Zakariyaa, Ezaariyaas, Miikaaʼiilii fi Shefaaxiyaa jedhaman ture. Isaan kunneen hundi ilmaan Yehooshaafaax mooticha Israaʼel sanaa turan. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Abbaan isaaniis kennaa meetii, kan warqeetii fi miʼoota gatii guddaa baasanii akkasumas magaalaawwan Yihuudaa keessaa kanneen dallaa jabaa qaban isaanii kenne; garuu sababii inni hangafa taʼeef mootummaa isaa Yehooraamiif kenne.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehooraam Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 21:5-10">21:5‑10</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 21:20">20</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 8:16-24">2Mt 8:16‑24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Yehooraam erga mootummaa abbaa isaa irratti jabaatee dhaabatee booddee obboloota isaa hundaa fi qondaaltota Israaʼel tokko tokko goraadeedhaan ni fixe. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehooraam yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa soddomii lama ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa saddeet ni bulche. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Innis akkuma manni Ahaab godhee ture sana karaa mootota Israaʼel duukaa buʼe; intala Ahaab fuudhee tureetii. Fuula Rabbii Allaah durattis waan hamaa hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Taʼus Rabbii Allaahan sababii Daawud wajjin kakuu galeef mana Daawud balleessuun fedhii Rabbii Allaah hin turre. Inni isaa fi sanyii isaatiif ibsaa bara baraa dhaabuuf kakuu galee ture.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Bara Yehooraam keessa Edoom Yihuudaatti fincilee mootii ofii isaa moosifate. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Kanaafuu Yehooraam qondaaltota isaatii fi gaariiwwan isaa hunda wajjin achi dhaqe. Warri Edoomis isaa fi ajajjoota gaariiwwan isaa marsan; inni garuu halkaniin kaʼee isaan ni dhaʼe. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Edoom hamma harʼaatti illee akkuma Yihuudaatti finciletti jira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 21:10">Libnaanis sababii Yehooraam Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaa dhiiseef yeruma sanatti fincile. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Tulluuwwan Yihuudaa irrattis iddoowwan sagadaa ijaaree akka namoonni Yerusaalem sagaagalan gochuudhaan Yihuudaa karaa irraa jalʼise.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Yehooraamis xalayaa Iliyaas nabiiʼiyyicha biraa ergame tokko ni argate; xalayaan sunis akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 21:12">“Rabbii Allaahan abbaa kee Daawud akkana jedha: ‘Ati karaa abbaa kee Yehooshaafaax irra yookaan karaa Aasaa mooticha Yihuudaatti hin adeemne. <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />Ati garuu karaa mootota Israaʼel irra deemuudhaan akkuma manni Ahaab godhe sana Yihuudaa fi saba Yerusaalem sagaagalchiifte. Obboloota kee miseensota mana abbaa keetii kanneen sirra wayyan sana illee ni fixxe. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan amma saba kee, ilmaan kee, niitota kee fi waan ati qabdu hunda dhaʼicha hamaadhaan dhaʼuuf jira. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Ati mataan kee iyyuu dhukkuba marʼumaanii kan guyyaa guyyaadhaan hammaachaa deemuun qabamta; dhuma irrattis dhukkubichi marʼumaan kee alatti yaasa.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Rabbii Allaahanis Filisxeemotaa fi Araboota saba Itoophiyaatti dhiʼoo jiraatan Yehooraamitti ni kaase. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Isaanis Yihuudaa dhaʼanii qabatan; miʼa masaraa mootii keessatti argamu hunda, ilmaanii fi niitota isaa wajjin boojiʼanii ni fudhatan. Ilma isaa Ahaaziyaa isa quxisuu sana malee ilmi tokko iyyuu hin hafneef.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Waan kana hundaa booddee Rabbii Allaahan dhukkuba marʼumaanii kan hin fayyineen Yehooraamin ni dhaʼe. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Innis oolee bulee dhuma waggaa lammaffaatti sababii dhukkuba hamaa sanaatiif marʼumaan isaa keessaa ni kufe; akka malees dhiphatee ni duʼe. Namoonni isaa akka abbootii isaatiif godhan sana ulfina isaatiif jedhanii ibidda hin bobeessine.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Yehooraam yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa soddomii lamaa ture. Innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa saddeet ni bulche. Yeroo inni duʼetti namni tokko iyyuu isaaf hin gaddine; innis Magaalaa Daawud keessatti qabbarame malee lafa mootonni itti qabbaramanitti hin qabbaramne.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ahaaziyaa Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 22:1-6">22:1‑6</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 8:25-29">2Mt 8:25‑29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 22:7-9">22:7‑9</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 9:21-29">2Mt 9:21‑29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Sababii Saamtonni Araboota wajjin qubata loltootaa seenan sun ilmaan isaa hangafoota hunda fixaniif namoonni Yerusaalem Ahaaziyaa ilma Yehooraam sana iddoo isaa buusanii mootii godhan. Kanaafuu Ahaaziyaa ilmi Yehooraam mooticha Yihuudaa sun mootii taʼee bulchuu ni jalqabe.<verse eid="2CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahaaziyaa yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa digdamii lama ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa tokko ni bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Ataaliyaa dha; isheenis intala ilma Omrii turte.<verse eid="2CH 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Innis sababii haati isaa akka inni dogoggora hojjetu isa jajjabeessaa turteef karaa mana Ahaab duukaa buʼe. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Sababii manni Ahaab erga abbaan isaa duʼee booddee gorsitoota isaa taʼuudhaan gara yakka hojjechuutti isa oofaniif, innis akkuma manni Ahaab godhe sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan hamaa hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Inni yeroo Yehooraam ilma Ahaab mooticha Israaʼel wajjin Raamooti Giliʼaaditti Hazaaʼeel mooticha Arraam loluudhaaf duuletti gorsuma isaanii duukaa buʼe. Warri Arraamis Yooraamin ni madeessan; <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />kanaafuu inni madaa isaan yeroo inni Raamaat keessatti Hazaaʼeel mooticha Arraam wajjin wal loletti isa madeessan sana fayyuuf jedhee Yizriʼeelitti deebiʼe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:6">Kana irratti Ahaaziyaan ilmi Yooraam mootichi Yihuudaa sababii inni madaaʼee tureef Yehooraam ilma Ahaab arguuf gara Yizriʼeelitti gad buʼe.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Sababii inni Yehooraamin gaafachuu dhaqeef Allaahan Ahaaziyaatti badiisa fide. Ahaaziyaan yommuu achi gaʼetti Yehuu ilma Nimshii sana simachuuf Yooraam wajjin gad baʼe. Yehuun immoo nama Rabbii Allaahan akka inni mana Ahaab balleessuuf dibee dha. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Yehuun utuu mana Ahaabitti muraa jiruu qondaaltota Yihuudaa fi ilmaan firoota Ahaaziyaa kanneen Ahaaziyaa tajaajilaa turan argee isaan ni galaafate. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Ergasii immoo inni Ahaaziyaa barbaacha ni deeme; namoonni Yehuus Samaariyaadhaa iddoo inni itti dhokatee turee qabanii Yehuutti fidanii isa ni ajjeesan. Isaanis, “Inni ilma Yehooshaafaax namicha garaa guutuudhaan Rabbii Allaah barbaade sanaa ti” jedhanii isa ni qabbaran. Kanaafuu mana Ahaaziyaa keessaa namni aangoo mootummaa qabachuu dandaʼu tokko illee hin turre.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ataaliyaa fi Yooʼaash</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 22:10-23:21">22:10–23:21</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 11:1-21">2Mt 11:1‑21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Ataaliyaan haati Ahaaziyaa yommuu akka ilmi ishee duʼe argitetti kaatee maatii mana mootii Yihuudaa guutumaan guutuutti balleessite. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Yehooshebaati intalli Yehooraam Mootichaa garuu ilmaan moototaa kanneen ajjeefamuuf turan keessaa Yooʼaash ilma Ahaaziyaa hattee fudhachuudhaan guddiftuu isaa wajjin dinqatti ni dhoksite. Yoshabeti intalli Iyyooraam Mootichaa, niitiin Yehooyaadaa lubichaa sun obboleettii Ahaaziyaa turte; isheenis akka Ataaliyaan isa hin ajjeefneef mucaa sana dhoksite. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Innis bara Ataaliyaan biyya bulchaa turte hunda isaan wajjin mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessatti dhokfamee waggaa jaʼa jiraate.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Yehooyaadaan waggaa torbaffaatti jabina ofii isaa ni argisiise. Innis ajajjuuwwan dhibbaa jechuunis Azaariyaa ilma Yirooham, Ismaʼiil ilma Yehohaanaan, Azaariyaa ilma Oobeed, Maʼaseyaa ilma Adaayaa fi Eliishaafaax ilma Zikrii wajjin kakuu seene. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Isaanis guutummaa Yihuudaa keessa deemanii magaalaawwan hunda keessaa Lewwotaa fi hangafoota maatiiwwan Israaʼel walitti ni qaban. Yommuu isaan Yerusaalem gaʼanittis, <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />waldaan guutuun mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessatti mooticha wajjin kakuu seene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">Yehooyaadaanis akkana isaaniin jedhe; “Akkuma Rabbii Allaahan waaʼee sanyii Daawud waadaa gale sanatti, ilmi mootichaa mootii ni taʼa. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Wanni isin gochuu qabdan isa kana: Isin lubootaa fi Lewwota guyyaa Sanbataa hojiitti ramadamtan keessaa harka sadii keessaa harki tokko karra, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />harka sadii keessaa harki tokko masaraa mootummaa, harka sadii keessaa harki tokko immoo karra ‘Karra Hundee’ jedhamu sana eegaa; namoonni kaan hundi immoo oobdii mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti argamuu qabu. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Lubootaa fi Lewwota hojii irra jiran malee namni tokko iyyuu mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah hin seenin; isaan sababii qulqullaaʼaniif seenuu ni dandaʼu; warri kaan hundi garuu waan Rabbii Allaahan isaan ajaje eeguu qabu. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Lewwonni tokkoon tokkoon isaanii miʼa lolaa harkatti qabatanii mootichatti naannaʼanii dhadhaabachuu qabu. Namni mana qulqullummaa seenu kan biraa kam iyyuu haa ajjeefamu. Lafa inni dhaqu hundatti mootichatti dhiʼoo jiraadhaa.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Lewwonnii fi namoonni Yihuudaa hundinuu akkuma Yehooyaadaan lubichi ajaje sana ni godhan. Sababii Yehooyaadaan lubichi gareewwan eegumsaa keessaa tokko illee gad hin dhiisiniif tokkoon tokkoon isaaniis namoota isaanii warra guyyaa Sanbataatiin hojiitti bobbaʼanii fi warra hojii irraa boqotan ni fudhatan. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Innis eeboowwan, gaachanawwan gurguddaa fi xixinnaa Daawud Mootichaa kanneen mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessa turan ajajjuuwwan dhibbaatiif ni kenne. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Akka namoonni hundi miʼa lolaa harkatti qabatanii karaa kibba mana qulqullummaatii hamma karaa kaaba mana qulqullummaatti iddoo aarsaatii fi mana qulqullummaa biratti mootichatti naannaʼanii dhaabatan ni godhe.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Yehooyaadaa fi ilmaan isaa ilma mootichaa fidanii mataa isaa irra gonfoo kaaʼan; isaanis garagalcha kakuu itti kennanii akka inni mootii taʼe ni labsan. Isa dibaniis, “Mootichi bara baraan haa jiraatu!” jedhanii ni iyyan.<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Ataaliyaan yommuu waca namoota fiiganii mooticha leellisanii dhageessetti, isaan bira gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah dhaqxe. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Yeroo isheen ilaaltetti mootichi balbala irra utubaa isaa bira dhaabatuu ni argite. Qondaaltonnii fi warri malakata afuufan mooticha bira turan; namoonni biyya sanaa hundinuus gammadanii malakata afuufaa turan; faarfattoonni immoo meeshaa muuziiqaatiin faarfannaa qajeelchaa turan. Kana irratti Ataaliyaan uffata ishee tarsaaftee, “Kun maltummaa dha! Kun maltummaa dha!” jettee iyyite.<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Yehooyaadaan lubichis, “Hiriira gidduudhaa baasaatii ishee fidaa; nama ishee irra dhufu kam iyyuu goraadeedhaan ajjeesaa” jedhee ajajjuuwwan dhibbaa kanneen kutaawwan loltootaa sana irratti ramadaman erge. Lubichi, “Mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti ishee hin ajjeesinaa” jedhee tureetii. <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Kanaafuu isaan akkuma isheen karra “Karra Fardaa” jedhamu kan masaraa mootii duraa geesseen qabanii achumatti ishee ni ajjeesan.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Yehooyaadaan akka inni, sabnii fi mootichis saba Rabbii Allaah taʼaniif kakuu ni dhaabe. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Sabni hundinuu gara galma Baʼaal dhaqee diige. Isaanis iddoowwan aarsaatii fi waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo caccabsanii Mataan lubicha Baʼaal sana illee iddoowwan aarsaa duratti ni ajjeesan.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Ergasii Yehooyaadaan luboota Lewwota turan kanneen Daawud mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti ramadee ture sanatti itti gaafatamummaa mana qulqullummaa ni kenne; isaan akkuma Seera Muusaa keessatti barreeffame sanatti aarsaa gubamu Rabbii Allaahaf dhiʼeessuu qabu; Daawud akka isaan gammachuu fi faarfannaadhaan aarsaa kana dhiʼeessan ajajee tureetii. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Akkasumas inni akka namni karaa kamiin iyyuu xuraaʼe tokko iyyuu ol hin seenneef balbala mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah dura eegdota ni dhaabe.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Innis ajajjuuwwan dhibbaa, namoota bebeekamoo, bulchitoota sabaa fi namoota biyyattii hunda fudhatee dhaqee mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatii mooticha gad baasee fide. Isaanis karaa, “Karra Ol aanu” jedhamuutiin masaraa mootummaa seenanii mooticha teessoo mootummaa irra teessisan. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Saboonni biyyattii hundi ni ililchan; sababii Ataaliyaan goraadeedhaan ajjeefamteef magaalaan sun nagaa argatte.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yooʼaash Mana Qulqullummaa Haaromsuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 24:1-14">24:1‑14</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 12:1-16">2Mt 12:1‑16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 24:23-27">24:23‑27</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 12:17-21">2Mt 12:17‑21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yooʼaash yeroo mootii taʼetti nama umuriin isaa waggaa torbaa ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa afurtama ni bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Ziibiyaa ture; isheenis nama Bersheebaa turte. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yooʼaash bara Yehooyaadaa lubichaa hunda keessa waan fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti qajeelaa taʼe hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehooyaadaan niitota lama isaaf file; innis ilmaanii fi intallan ni dhalche.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Yeroo xinnoo booddees Yooʼaash mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah haaromsuuf murteesse. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Innis lubootaa fi Lewwota walitti waamee, “Gara magaalaawwan Yihuudaa dhaqaatii maallaqa waggaa waggaadhaan mana qulqullummaa Allaah keessanii haaromsuuf oolu Israaʼeloota hunda irraa walitti qabaa. Kanas ammuma godhaa” isaaniin jedhe. Lewwonni garuu dafanii hin goone.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Kanaafuu mootichi Yehooyaadaa lubicha hangafticha waamee, “Ati maaliif akka Lewwonni gibira Muusaan garbichi Rabbii Allaah fi yaaʼiin Israaʼel akka dunkaana dhuga baʼumsaatiif baafamu murteessan sana Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem irraa walitti qaban hin godhin?” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Yeroo sana ilmaan Ataaliyaa dubartittii hamtuu sanaa mana qulqullummaa Allaaha cabsanii seenanii miʼoota qulqulleeffaman illee Baʼaalin tajaajiluuf itti ni fayyadaman.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Kanaafuu mootichi akka isaan sanduuqa maallaqni itti walitti qabamu hojjetanii karaa alaatiin balbala mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah bira kaaʼan ni ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Akka isaan qaraxa Muusaan garbichi Allaaha sun yeroo gammoojjii keessa turanitti Israaʼeloota ajaje sana Rabbii Allaahaf fidaniif Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem keessatti labsiin tokko ni baʼe. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Qondaaltonni hundii fi sabni hundi buusii isaanii gammachuudhaan fidanii hamma inni guututti sanduuqicha keessa ni buusan. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Yommuu sanduuqichi Lewwotaan gara qondaaltota mootiitti fidamee qondaaltonni sun akka maallaqni baayʼeen isa keessa jiru arganitti barreessaan mootichaa fi ajajaan lubicha hangafaa dhufanii maallaqa sana sanduuqa keessaa garagalchanii sanduuqicha iddoo isaatti deebisu ture. Isaanis guyyuma guyyaan akkas godhanii maallaqa akka malee baayʼee walitti ni qaban. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Mootichii fi Yehooyaadaanis maallaqa sana warra mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah hojjechiisuuf itti gaafatamummaa fudhatanitti ni kennan. Isaanis mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah haaromsuudhaaf namoota dhagaa cabsanii fi ogeeyyii hojii mukaa, akkasumas mana qulqullummaa haaromsuudhaaf hojjettoota sibiilaa fi naasii ittiin ni qaxaran.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Hojjettoonni qaxaraman waan jabaatanii hojjetaniif hojiin sun isaaniif ni milkaaʼe. Mana qulqullummaa Allaahas akkuma duraan turetti deebisanii ni haaromsan; ni jabeessanis. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Erga fixanii booddees maallaqa hafe fidanii mootichaa fi Yehooyaadaatti ni kennan; maallaqa sanaanis miʼoota mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah jechuunis miʼoota tajaajilaa fi kan aarsaan gubamu ittiin dhiʼeeffamu akkasumas caabiiwwan, miʼoota warqee fi meetii ittiin ni hojjetan. Isaanis bara Yehooyaadaa keessa utuu gargar hin kutin mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessaa turan.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Yehooyaadaanis bara dheeraa jiraatee dulloomee waggaa dhibba tokkoo fi soddomatti ni duʼe. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Innis sababii Israaʼel keessatti Allaaha fi mana qulqullummaa isaatiif waan gaarii hojjeteef Magaalaa Daawud keessatti mootota biratti ni qabbarame.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hammina Yooʼaash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Erga Yehooyaadaan duʼee booddee qondaaltonni Yihuudaa dhufanii amanamummaa mootichaaf qaban ni ibsan; innis isaan dhaggeeffate. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Isaanis mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah, Allaah abbootii isaanii dhiisanii siidaawwan Aasheeraa fi waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo ni waaqeffatan. Sababii balleessaa isaaniifis dheekkamsi Allaaha Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalemitti ni dhufe. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Akka isaan gara isaatti saba deebisaniif Rabbii Allaahan nabiiʼiyyoota isaanitti erge; nabiiʼiyyoonnis isaanitti rageessan; isaan garuu dhagaʼuu hin barbaanne.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Ergasiis Hafuurri Allaaha Zakariyaa ilma Yehooyaadaa lubichaa irra ni buʼe. Innis kaʼee fuula uummataa dura dhaabatee, “Allaahan akkana jedha: ‘Isin maaliif ajaja Rabbii Allaah eeguu diddani? Isin hin milkooftan. Sababii isin Rabbii Allaah dhiiftaniif innis isin dhiiseera’ ” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Isaan garuu isatti mariʼatanii ajaja mootichaatiin oobdii mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti dhagaadhaan tumanii isa ni ajjeesan. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Yooʼaash mootichi arjummaa Yehooyaadaan abbaan Zakariyaa isaaf godhe sana hin yaadanne; qooda kanaa inni ilma isaa ni ajjeese; innis yeroo duʼutti, “Rabbii Allaahan waan kana haa argu; haaloos haa baʼu” jedhe.<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Dhuma waggaa sanaattis loltoonni Sooriyaa Yooʼaashitti ni duulan; Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem qabatanii hooggantoota sabaa hunda ni fixan. Isaanis waan boojiʼan hunda gara Damaasqootti mootii isaaniitti ni ergan. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Loltoonni Sooriyaa namoota xinnoo qabatanii dhufan illee Rabbii Allaahan loltoota akka malee baayʼee harka isaaniitti dabarsee ni kenne. Sababii Yihuudoonni Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaanii dhiisaniif Yooʼaashitti murtiin murame. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Warri Sooriyaa yommuu baʼanitti Yooʼaashin akka malee madeessanii ni deeman. Qondaaltonni isaas sababii inni ilma Yehooyaadaa lubichaa ajjeeseef isatti mariʼatanii siree isaa irratti isa ajjeesan. Kanaafuu inni duʼee Magaalaa Daawud keessatti ni qabbarame; garuu iddoo qabrii moototaatti hin qabbaramne.<verse eid="2CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Warri isatti mariʼatanis Zaabaad ilma Shimeʼaati dubartii Amoon sanaa fi Yehoozaabaad ilma Shimriiti dubartii Moʼaab sanaa turan. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Seenaan ilmaan isaa, raajiiwwan waaʼee isaa dubbataman hedduunii fi seenaan haaromfamuu mana qulqullummaa Allaaha kitaaba seenaa moototaa keessatti barreeffameera. Amasiyaa ilmi isaa iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Amasiyaa Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 25:1-4">25:1‑4</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 14:1-6">2Mt 14:1‑6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 25:11-12">25:11‑12</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 14:7">2Mt 14:7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 25:17-28">25:17‑28</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 14:8-20">2Mt 14:8‑20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amasiyaa yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa digdamii shan ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa digdamii sagal ni bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa, Yoʼaadaan ture; isheenis nama Yerusaalem turte. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Innis waan fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti qajeelaa taʼe ni hojjete; garuu garaa guutuudhaan miti. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Inni erga jabeessee toʼannaa isaa jalatti mootummaa qabatee booddee qondaaltota abbaa isaa mooticha ajjeesan sana fixe. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Taʼus inni akka waan Seera keessatti, Kitaaba Muusaa keessatti Rabbii Allaahan, “Abbootiin sababii ijoollee isaaniitiif ajjeefamuu hin qaban yookaan ijoolleen sababii abbootii isaaniitiif ajjeefamuu hin qaban; tokkoon tokkoon namaa sababii cubbuu ofii isaatiif duʼa” jedhee ajaje sanaatti tarkaanfii fudhate malee ilmaan warra abbaa isaa ajjeesan sanaa hin fixne.<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Amasiyaa saba Yihuudaa walitti waamee akkuma maatii isaaniitti ajajjuuwwan kumaatii fi ajajjuuwwan dhibbaa guutummaa Yihuudaa fi Biniyaam keessatti ramade. Sana booddees warra umuriin isaanii waggaa digdamaa fi sanaa ol taʼe walitti qabee akka namoonni duulaaf qophaaʼan kanneen eeboo fi gaachana qabachuu dandaʼan kuma dhibba sadii taʼan argate. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Akkasumas Israaʼel keessaa loltoota jajjaboo kuma dhibba tokko meetii taalaantii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taalaantiin tokko kiiloo giraamii 34.</char></note> dhibba tokkoon ni qaxarate.<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Garuu namni Allaaha tokko isa bira dhufee akkana jedheen; “Yaa mootii, sababii Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel wajjinis taʼu namoota Efreem kam iyyuu wajjin hin jirreef loltoonni Israaʼel kunneen si wajjin hin duulin. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Yoo ati sodaa malee lola dhaqxe illee Allaahan fuula diinota keetii duratti si kuffisa; Allaahan gargaaruufis kuffisuufis humna qabaatii.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amasiyaa immoo, “Garuu taalaantiin dhibbi ani loltoota Israaʼeliif baase sun maal haa taʼu ree?” jedhee nama Allaaha sana ni gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Namni Allaaha sun immoo deebisee, “Rabbii Allaahan waan sana caalu iyyuu siif kennuu ni dandaʼa” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Kanaafuu Amasiyaa loltoota biyya Efreemii isa bira dhufan sana akka isaan biyya isaaniitti deebiʼaniif gad dhiise. Isaanis Yihuudaatti aaranii akka malee dheekkamaa gara biyya isaaniitti deebiʼan.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Amasiyaa humna isaa jabeeffatee loltoota isaa gara Sulula Soogiddaatti erge; achittis namoota Seeʼiir kuma kudhan ni fixe. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Loltoonni Yihuudaas namoota kuma kudhan biraa boojiʼan; fiixee kattaa tokkoottis ol baasanii achi irraa gad isaan dadarbatan; hundi isaaniis caccabanii hurraaʼan.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Loltoonni Amasiyaa akka isaan isa wajjin hin duulleef gara biyya isaaniitti deebisee erge sun garuu magaalaawwan Yihuudaa kanneen Samaariyaadhaa hamma Beet Horoonitti jiran ni dhaʼan. Isaanis namoota kuma sadii ajjeesanii boojuu baayʼee fudhatanii deeman.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Amasiyaa yommuu namoota Edoom fixee deebiʼetti waaqeffatamtoota saba Seeʼiir fudhatee gale. Innis akkuma waaqeffatamtoota isaatti dhaabbatee sagadeefii aarsaa gubamu isaaniif ni dhiʼeesse. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Rabbii Allaahanis akka malee Amasiyaatti aaree nabiiʼiyyii tokko itti erge; nabiiʼiyyiin sunis, “Ati maaliif waaqeffatamtoota saba kanaa kanneen saba ofii isaa iyyuu harka keetii baasuu hin dandeenye gorsa gaafatta?” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Mootichis utuma inni dubbachaa jiruu, “Nu akka ati mootii gorsituuf si muudneerraa? Calʼisi! Maaliif rukutamta?” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Nabiiʼiyyiin sunis ni calʼise; garuu, “Sababii ati gorsa koo dhagaʼuu diddee waan kana gooteef, ani akka Allaahan si balleessuuf murteesse nan beeka” jedheen.<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Amasiyaa mootichi Yihuudaa erga gorsitoota isaatiin mariʼatee booddee, “Kottu mee waraana keessatti wal ilaallaa” jedhee qoosaa kana gara Yooʼaash ilma Yehooʼaahaaz, ilma Yehuu, mooticha Israaʼelitti ni erge.<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Yooʼaash mootichi Israaʼel garuu akkana jedhee Amasiyaa mooticha Yihuudaatiif deebii kenne; “Sokorruun Libaanoon keessaa tokko ergaa ergee birbirsaa Libaanooniin, ‘Intala kee ilma kootti heerumsiisi’ jedhe. Ergasii bineensi bosona Libaanoon keessaa tokko dhufee sokorruu sana irra miilaan deeme. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Ati, ‘Kunoo ati dhugumaan Edoomin moʼatteerta’ ofiin jettee amma of tuulaa jirta. Amma garuu mana kee taaʼi! Ati maaliif rakkina barbaaddee ofii keetii fi Yihuudaattis kufaatii fidda?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Amasiyaa garuu dhagaʼuu dide; sababii isaan waaqeffatamtoota Edoom duukaa buʼaniif Allaahan harka Yooʼaashitti dabarsee isaan kennuuf murteesseeraatii. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Kanaafuu Yooʼaash mootichi Israaʼel kaʼee lola bane. Innii fi Amasiyaa mootichi Yihuudaa biyya Yihuudaa keessatti Beet Shemeshitti walitti baʼan. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Warri Yihuudaas warra Israaʼeliin moʼatamanii tokkoon tokkoon namaas gara mana ofii isaatti baqate. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Yooʼaash mootichi Israaʼel, Amasiyaa mooticha Yihuudaa ilma Iyooʼas ilma Ahaaziyaa sana Beet Shemeshitti qabe. Iyooʼasis gara Yerusaalemitti isa fidee Karra Efreemiitii jalqabee hamma Karra Goleetti dallaa Yerusaalem kan dhagaa sana diige; kutaan diigame kun dhundhuma dhibba afur lafa irra dheerata ture. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Innis warqee fi meetii hunda, akkasumas miʼa mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessatti argamu kan Oobeed Edoom eegaa ture hunda, qabeenya masaraa mootummaa fi namoota boojiʼe illee fudhatee gara Samaariyaatti deebiʼe.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amasiyaa ilmi Yooʼaash mootichi Yihuudaa erga Yooʼaash ilmi Yehooʼaahaaz mootichi Israaʼel duʼee booddee waggaa kudha shan jiraate. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Amasiyaa keessa jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjetaman kanneen biraa kitaaba mootota Yihuudaa fi Israaʼel keessatti barreeffamaniiru mitii? <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Yeroo Amasiyaan Rabbii Allaah duukaa buʼuu irraa garagalee jalqabee isaan Yerusaalem keessatti isatti malatan; innis gara Laakkiishitti baqate; isaan immoo faanuma isaa Laakkiishitti namoota erganii achitti isa ajjeesan. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Isaanis fardaan isa fidanii Magaalaa Yihuudaatti abbootii isaa biratti isa ni qabbaran.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Uziyaan Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 26:1-4">26:1‑4</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 14:21-22">2Mt 14:21‑22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:1-3">15:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 26:21-23">26:21‑23</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 15:5-7">2Mt 15:5‑7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Ergasii namoonni Yihuudaa hundi Uziyaan nama waggaa kudha jaʼa sana fuudhanii iddoo abbaa isaa iddoo Amasiyaa buusanii mootii ni godhan. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Erga Amasiyaa abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee booddee namni Eelootin deebisee ijaaree gara Yihuudaatti deebisee Uziyaan ture.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uziyaan yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa kudha jaʼa ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa shantamii lama ni bulche; maqaan haadha isaa Yekooliyaa ture; isheenis nama Yerusaalem turte. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Innis akkuma abbaa isaa Amasiyaa sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan qajeelaa ni hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Inni bara Zakariyaa isa akka inni Allaah sodaatu isa barsiise sanaa keessa Allaah barbaade. Yeroo inni Rabbii Allaah barbaade hundas Allaahan isa ni milkoomse.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Innis Filisxeemotatti duulee dallaawwan Gaati, kan Yabinee fi kan Ashdood ni diige. Ergasii Ashdood birattii fi bulchiinsota Filisxeemotaa kaan keessatti magaalaawwan deebisee ni ijaare. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Yeroo inni Filisxiyaatti, Araboota Guur Baʼaalittii fi Meʼuunootatti kaʼetti Allaahan isa gargaare. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Warri Amoonis Uziyaaniif gibira ni fidan; sababii inni baayʼee jabaateef gurri isaa hamma daangaa Gibxitti beekame.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Uziyaanis Yerusaalem keessatti Karra Golee irratti, Karra sululaa irrattii fi golee dallaa irratti gamoowwan eegumsaa ni ijaare. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Akkasumas inni sababii gaarran jalaa fi dirree irraa horii akka malee baayʼee qabuuf gammoojjii keessatti gamoowwan eegumsaa ijaaree boolla bishaanii hedduus ni qote; inni waan hojii qotiisaa jaallatuuf qottoota gaarranii fi lafa gabbataa qotanii wayiniis dhaaban qaba ture.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Kana malees Uziyaan hoomaa waraanaa kan akka gaarii leenjifamee waraanaaf qophaaʼe qaba ture; hoomaan waraanaa kunis dura buʼummaa Hanaaniyaa isa qondaaltota mootichaa keessaa tokko taʼe sanaan akkuma baayʼina isaaniitti garee gareedhaan Yeʼiiʼeel barreessaa sanaa fi Maʼaseyaa ajajjichaan gurmeeffame. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Baayʼinni hooggantota maatii kanneen loltoota irratti muudamanii walumatti 2,600 ture. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Ajaja isaanii jalattis hoomaa waraanaa kan namoota lolaaf leenjifaman 307,500 of keessaa qabu tokkotu ture; hoomaan kunis humna guddaa kan yeroo mootichi diinota isaatti duulutti isa gargaaruu dha. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uziyaan loltoota hundaaf gaachana, eeboo, gonfoo sibiilaa, qomee sibiilaa, xiyyaa fi furrisa dhagaa kenne. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Innis Yerusaalem keessatti meeshaawwan namoota ogeeyyiidhaan hojjetaman kanneen gamoowwan eegumsaatii fi goleewwan ittisaa gubbaatti xiyya darbachuu fi dhagaa furuursuuf fayyadan ijaare. Innis hamma jabaatutti waan gargaarsa argateef maqaan isaa fagootti illee balʼinaan ni beekame.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Garuu Uziyaan erga jabaatee booddee, of tuulummaan isaa kufaatii isatti fide. Innis iddoo aarsaa ixaanaatti ixaana aarsuuf mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah seenuudhaan amanamummaa Rabbii Allaah isaatiif qabu irraa duubatti ni deebiʼe. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Azaariyaa lubichis luboota Rabbii Allaah warra waa hin sodaanne kan biraa saddeettama wajjin isa duukaa ni seene. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Isaanis Uziyaan mootichaan mormanii, “Yaa Uziyaan Rabbii Allaahaf ixaana aarsuun luboota sanyii Haaruun warra ixaana aarsuuf filataman sanaaf malee siif hin malu. Ati sababii amanamaa hin taʼiniif Rabbii Allaah, Allaah biraa ulfina hin argattuutii iddoo qulqulluu kanaa baʼi” jedhaniin.<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Uziyaanis utuu ixaana aarsuuf girgiraa harkatti qabatee qophaaʼee jiruu ni aare. Innis utuma mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti iddoo aarsaa ixaana duratti lubootatti aaraa jiruu ijuma isaanii duratti lamxiin adda isaatti ni baʼe. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Azaariyaa lubichi hangafnii fi luboonni biraa hundinuu yeroo isa ilaalanitti akka lamxiin adda isaa irra jiru ni argan; kanaafuu isaan dafanii gad isa baasan. Sababii dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah isa dhaʼeef dhugumaan inni iyyuu baʼuuf ariifatee ture.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Uziyaan mootichi hamma gaafa duʼuutti lamxaaʼee ture. Innis waan lamxaaʼee tureef mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah irraa citee mana kophaa keessa ni jiraate. Ilmi isaa Yootaam ilmi isaa itti gaafatama masaraa mootummaa fudhatee saba biyyattii bulche.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Uziyaan keessa jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjetaman biraan Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyicha ilma Amoosiin galmeeffamaniiru. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Uziyaanis abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee sababii namoonni, “Inni lamxii qaba” jedhaniif inni lafa qabrii moototaa keessatti isaanuma biratti ni qabbarame. Ilmi isaa Yootaam iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yootaam Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 27:1-4">27:1‑4</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 27:7-9">7‑9</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 15:33-38">2Mt 15:33‑38</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yootaam yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa digdamii shan ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa kudha jaʼa ni bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Yaruusaa ture; isheenis intala Zaadoq turte. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Innis akkuma abbaan isaa Uziyaan godhe sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan qajeelaa ni hojjete; inni garuu akka abbaa isaa mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah hin seenne. Taʼus namoonni cubbuu hojjechuu ittuma fufan. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yootaam Karra mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah kan Ol aanu deebisee ijaare; dallaa dhagaa kan gaara Oofeel irrattis hojiiwwan ijaarsaa baayʼee ni hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Gaarran Yihuudaa irratti magaalaawwan, bosona keessatti immoo daʼannoowwanii fi gamoowwan ni ijaare.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yootaamis mootii Amoonotaa waraanee isaan ni moʼate. Waggaa sana keessa Amoononni meetii taalaantii dhibba tokko, qamadii qoroosii kuma kudhanii fi garbuu safartuu qoroosii kuma kudhan ni kennaniif. Amoononni waggaa lammaffaa fi waggaa sadaffaattis hammasuma ni kaffalaniif.<verse eid="2CH 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Yootaam sababii fuula Rabbii Allaah isaa dura amanamummaan deddeebiʼeef jabaachaa deeme.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Wantoonni bara Yootaam keessa hojjetaman biraa, lola inni lolee fi wantoonni inni hojjete biraa kitaaba mootota Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa keessatti barreeffamaniiru. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Inni yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa digdamii shan ture. Innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa kudha jaʼa ni bulche. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yootaam abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee Magaalaa Daawud keessatti ni qabbarame. Ilmi isaa Aahaaz iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Aahaaz Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 28:1-27">28:1‑27</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 16:1-20">2Mt 16:1‑20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Aahaaz yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa digdama ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa kudha jaʼa ni bulche. Inni akka abbaa isaa akka Daawud fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan qajeelaa hin hojjenne. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Inni karaa mootota Israaʼel duukaa buʼee Baʼaalin waaqeffachuuf jedhees waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo baqsee ni tolche. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Inni gochawwan jibbisiisoo saboota Rabbii Allaahan fuula Israaʼelootaa duraa ariʼee baase sanaa hojjechuudhaan Sulula Ben Hinoom keessatti ixaana ni aarse; ilmaan isaa illee aarsaa godhee ibiddaan gube. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Innis iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraatti, fiixee gaarranii irrattii fi muka lalisaa hunda jalatti qalma dhiʼeessee, ixaanas aarse.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan isaa dabarsee harka mootii Sooriyaatti isa kenne. Warri Sooriyaas isa moʼatanii namoota isaa hedduus boojiʼanii Damaasqootti geessan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 28:5">Achii immoo inni harka mootii Israaʼelitti dabarfamee ni kenname; mootichis miidhaa guddaa isa irraan ni gaʼe. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Sababii sabni Yihuudaa Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaa dhiiseef Pheqaan ilmi Remaaliyaa guyyaa tokkotti loltoota Yihuudaa kuma dhibba tokkoo fi digdama ni fixe. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Zikriin loltuun jabaan gosa Efreem sun immoo Maʼaseyaa ilma mootichaa, Azriiqaam ajajaa masaraa mootummaa fi Elqaanaa itti aanaa mootichaa ni ajjeese. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Israaʼeloonni firootuma isaanii irraa niitota, ilmaanii fi intallan kuma dhibba lama ni boojiʼan. Akkasumas boojuu akka malee baayʼee fudhatanii Samaariyaatti ni deebiʼan.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Garuu nabiiʼiyyiin Rabbii Allaah kan Oodeed jedhamu tokko achi ture; innis yeroo loltoonni Samaariyaadhaa deebiʼanitti isaan simachuuf ni baʼe. Innis akkana isaaniin jedhe; “Rabbii Allaahan abbootii keessanii waan Yihuudaatti aareef dabarsee harka keessanitti isaan kenne. Isin garuu dheekkamsa hamma shamaayʼuniitti ol fagaatuun isaan ni fixxan. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Ammas dhiirotaa fi dubartoota Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem garboota keessan gochuu ni yaaddan. Isin mataan keessan iyyuu fuula Rabbii Allaah keessanii duratti cubbuu hin hojjennee ree? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Mee na dhagaʼaa! Sababii dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah isinitti bobaʼeef namoota biyya keessanii kanneen boojitanii fiddan sana deebisaa.”<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Ergasiis hangafoota namoota Efreem keessaa tokko tokko jechuunis Azaariyaa ilmi Yehohaanaan, Berekiyaan ilmi Meshileemoot, Yehiizqiiyaa ilmi Shaluumii fi Amaasaayi ilmi Hadilaay warra duulaa galaa jiran mormuudhaan <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />akkana jedhan; “Isin boojiʼamtoota kanneen as fiduu hin qabdan; yoo kanaa achii nu fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti cubbamoota ni taana. Isin amma illee cubbuu fi balleessaa keenya ittuma dabaluu feetuu? Yakki keenya duraanuu baayʼateera; dheekkamsi isaa Israaʼelitti bobaʼeeraatii.”<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Kanaafuu loltoonni fuula qondaaltotaatii fi yaaʼii guutuu duratti boojiʼamtootaa fi boojuu gad dhiisan. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Namoonni maqaan isaanii eerames loltoota harka boojiʼamtoota ni fuudhan; waan boojiʼame irraas warra qullaa jiran hundatti wayyaa ni uffisan. Isaanis uffataa fi kophee, waan nyaatamuu fi waan dhugamu illee ni kennaniif; dibatas isaan diban. Warra dadhaban hunda immoo harree irra teessisanii biyya firoonni isaanii jiran Magaalaa Meexxii sanatti gara Yerikootti isaan deebisanii ofii immoo Samaariyaatti ni dachaʼan.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Yeroo sanatti Aahaaz Mootichi gargaaraa argachuuf gara mootii Asooritti nama ergate. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Edoomonni ammas dhufanii Yihuudaatti balaa buusanii boojiʼamtoota fudhatanii deemanii turaniitii; <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Filisxeemonni immoo magaalaawwan gaarran jalaa fi kanneen gama kibba Yihuudaatti argaman weeraranii Beet Shemeshi, Ayaaloon, Gedeerooti, Sookoo, Tiimnaahi, Gimzoo fi gandoota naannoo isaanitti argaman qabatanii keessa ni qubatan. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Sababii Aahaaz mootichi Israaʼel saba Yihuudaa cubbuuf kakaasee ofii immoo Rabbii Allaahaf amanamuu dideef Rabbii Allaahan Yihuudaa ni salphise. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Tiiglaat-Philneeser mootichi Asoor gara isaa dhufee ture; taʼus inni qooda isa gargaaru rakkina isatti fide. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Aahaaz mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessaa, masaraa mootii fi mana ilmaan mootiitii waan tokko tokko fuudhee mootii Asooriif kennaa godhee ni dhiʼeesse; taʼus kunis isa hin gargaarre.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Aahaaz Mootichi yeroo rakkina isaa keessa illee ittuma caalchisee Rabbii Allaahaf amanamuu ni dide. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Innis waaqeffatamtoota Damaasqoo kanneen isa moʼataniif aarsaa ni dhiʼeesse; “Waaqeffatamtoonni mootota Sooriyaa sababii isaan gargaaraniif akka isaan ana illee gargaaraniif ani aarsaa nan dhiʼeessaaf” jedhee yaadee tureetii. Isaan garuu kufaatii isaa fi kufaatii Israaʼel hundaa ni fidan.<verse eid="2CH 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Aahaaz miʼoota mana qulqullummaa Allaaha walitti qabee fudhatee deeme. Balbalawwan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahas cufee golee daandiiwwan Yerusaalem hunda irratti iddoowwan aarsaa ni dhaabe. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Magaalaa Yihuudaa hunda keessattis waaqeffatamtoota biraaf ixaana aarsuuf iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa ijaaree Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaa dheekkamsaaf ni kakaase.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa isaa keessa jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti hojjetaman kanneen biraa fi akki inni itti jiraate hundi kitaaba mootota Yihuudaa fi Israaʼel keessatti barreeffamaniiru. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Aahaazis abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee magaalaa Yerusaalem keessatti ni qabbarame; garuu iddoo qabrii mootota Israaʼel keessa hin kaaʼamne. Ilmi isaa Hisqiyaas iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Hisqiyaas Mana Qulqullummaa Qulqulleessuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 29:1-2">29:1‑2</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 18:2-3">2Mt 18:2‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hisqiyaas yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa digdamii shan ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa digdamii sagal bulche. Maqaan haadha isaa Abiyaa ture; isheenis intala Zakariyaa. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Innis akkuma Daawud abbaan isaa godhe sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan qajeelaa hojjete.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Inni bara mootummaa isaa keessa jiʼa jalqaba waggaa tokkoffaatti balbalawwan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah ni bane; ni haaromses. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Lubootaa fi Lewwota waamsisee oobdii karaa baʼa biiftuutiin jiru irratti walitti isaan qabee <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />akkana jedheen; “Yaa Lewwota, mee na dhagaʼaa! Amma of qulqulleessaatii mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah abbootii keessanii illee qulqulleessaa. Waan xuraaʼaa hunda iddoo qulqulluu keessaa baasaa. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Abbootiin keenya sababii amanamoo hin turiniif fuula Rabbii Allaah keenyaa duratti waan hamaa hojjetanii isa irraa garagalan. Isaanis iddoo jireenya Rabbii Allaah irraa fuula isaanii deebifatanii dugda isaanii isatti garagalchan. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Akkasumas balbala gardaafoo cufanii ibsaawwan ni dhaamsan. Isaan Allaah Israaʼeliif iddoo qulqulluutti ixaana hin aarsine yookaan aarsaa gubamu hin dhiʼeessine. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Kanaafuu dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem irra buʼe; inni akkuma isin ija keessaniin arguu dandeessan kana nama qaanii, nama qoosaa fi nama kolfaa isaan godhe. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Sababiin abbootiin keenya goraadeedhaan dhumaniif, sababiin ilmaan keenya, intallanii fi niitonni keenya illee boojiʼamaniif kanuma. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Ani amma akka dheekkamsi isaa inni sodaachisaan sun nurraa deebiʼuuf Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel wajjin kakuu galuu yaadeera. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Yaa ilmaan ko, egaa hin dagatinaa; Rabbii Allaahan akka isin fuula isaa dura dhaabattaniif, akka isa tajaajiltaniif, akka fuula isaa duratti hojjettoota isaa taatanii ixaana aarsitaniif isin filateeraatii.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Ergasii Lewwonni kunneen hojiitti bobbaʼan; isaanis:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 29:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Ilmaan Qohaatotaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Mahat ilma Amaasaayii fi Yooʼeel ilma Azaariyaa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">ilmaan Meraarotaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Qiis ilma Abdii fi Azaariyaa ilma Yehaleliʼeel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">ilmaan Geershoonotaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Yooʼak ilma Zimaa fi Eeden ilma Yooʼaa;<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />ilmaan Eliisaafaanotaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Shimrii fi Yeʼiiʼeel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">ilmaan Asaaf keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Zakariyaa fi Mataaniyaa;<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />ilmaan Heemaan keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Yehiiʼeelii fi Shimeʼii;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">ilmaan Yeduutuun keessaa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Shemaaʼiyaa fi Uziiʼeel.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Isaan erga obboloota isaanii walitti qabanii of qulqulleessanii booddee akkuma mootichi akka dubbii Rabbii Allaahatti isaan ajajetti mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah qulqulleessuuf ol ni seenan. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Luboonnis mana Rabbii Allaah qulqulleessuuf ol ni seenan. Isaanis waan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti argan kan qulqulluu hin taʼin hunda gara oobdii mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti gad baasan. Lewwonnis achii guuranii Sulula Qeedroonitti geessan. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Isaanis hojii qulqulleessuu kana guyyaa jalqaba jiʼa duraatii jalqabanii bultii saddeettaffaatti gardaafoo Rabbii Allaah bira ni gaʼan. Guyyaa saddeet itti dabalanii mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah qulqulleessanii jiʼa tokkoffaa guyyaa kudha jaʼaffaatti fixan.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Isaanis gara Hisqiyaas Mootichaa dhaqanii akkana jedhaniin; “Nu guutummaa mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaaha, iddoo aarsaan gubamu itti dhiʼeeffamu miʼa isaa hunda wajjin, minjaala buddeenni qulqulleeffame irra kaaʼamu miʼa isaa hunda wajjin qulqulleessineerra. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Miʼoota Aahaaz mootichi yeroo mootii turetti amanamummaa dhabee iddoo isaaniitii fuudhe hunda qulqulleessineerra; miʼoonni sunis fuula iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaah dura jiru.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Hisqiyaas Mootichi guyyaa itti aanu ganama bariidhaan qondaaltota magaalaa walitti qabee gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti ol baʼe. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Isaanis mootummaaf, mana qulqullummaa fi Yihuudaaf korommii loonii torba, korbeeyyii hoolaa torba, xobbaallaawwan torbaa fi korbeeyyii reʼee torba aarsaa cubbuu godhanii ni dhiʼeessan. Mootichis akka isaan horii kanneen iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaah irratti aarsaa dhiʼeessaniif luboota sanyii Haaruun sana ni ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Luboonnis korommii loonii sana qalanii dhiiga isaanii iddoo aarsaa irratti faffacaasan; itti aansaniis korbeeyyii hoolaa qalanii dhiiga isaanii iddoo aarsaa irratti faffacaasan; ergasii immoo xobbaallaawwan qalanii dhiiga isaanii iddoo aarsaa irratti faffacaasan. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Reʼoonni aarsaa cubbuutiif fidamanis fuula mootichaa fi fuula waldaa duratti dhiʼeeffaman; jarris isaan irra harka isaanii kaaʼan. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Sababii mootichi aarsaa gubamuu fi aarsaa cubbuu Israaʼel hundaaf ajajeef luboonni reʼoota qalanii Israaʼel hundaaf araara buusuuf dhiiga isaanii iddoo aarsaa irratti dhiʼeessan.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Innis akkuma Daawudii fi Gaad ilaaltuu mootichaa fi Naataan nabiiʼiyyichaan ajajametti Lewwota kilillee, baganaa fi kiraara qabachiisee mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti ramade; kunis ajaja Rabbii Allaahan karaa nabiiʼiyyoota isaatiin kennee dha. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Kanaafuu Lewwonni miʼa faarfannaa kan Daawud, luboonni immoo malakata isaanii qabatanii qophaaʼanii dhaabatan.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Hisqiyaas akka aarsaan gubamu iddoo aarsaa irratti dhiʼeeffamuuf ajaje. Akkuma aarsaan dhiʼeeffamuu jalqabeen faarfannaan malakataa fi miʼa faarfannaa kan Daawud mooticha Israaʼeliin Rabbii Allaahaf faarfatamus ni jalqabame. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Waldaan guutuun gad jedhee sagade; faarfattoonni ni faarfatan; warri malakata afuufanis ni afuufan. Wanni kun hundi hamma aarsaan gubamu dhiʼeeffamee xumuramutti itti fufe.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Yommuu aarsaa dhiʼeessuun xumurametti mootichii fi warri isa wajjin turan hundinuu jilbeenfatanii sagadan. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Hisqiyaas Mootichii fi qondaaltonni isaa akka Lewwonni dubbii Daawudii fi dubbii Asaaf ilaaltuu sanaatiin Rabbii Allaah galateeffatan ajajan. Kanaafuu isaan gammachuudhaan faarfannaa galataa faarfatanii gad jedhanii sagadan.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Ergasiis Hisqiyaas, “Isin amma Rabbii Allaahaf of qulqulleessitaniirtu. Kottaatii qalmaa fi aarsaa galataa mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti galchaa” jedhe. Kanaafuu waldaan sun qalmaa fi aarsaa galataa dhiʼeesse; warri garaan isaanii jaallate hundis aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessan.<verse eid="2CH 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Aarsaan gubamu kan waldaan sun dhiʼeesses korommii loonii torbaatama, korbeeyyii hoolaa dhibba tokkoo fi xobbaallaawwan hoolaa dhibba lama ture; kunneen hundi aarsaa gubamu taʼanii Rabbii Allaahaf dhiʼeeffaman. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Horiin qulqulleeffamee qalmaaf dhiʼeeffame walumaa galatti korommii loonii dhibba jaʼaa fi hoolaa fi reʼee kuma sadii ture. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Haa taʼu malee horii aarsaaf dhiʼeeffaman irraa gogaa baasuuf lakkoobsi lubootaa gaʼaa hin turre; kanaafuu firoonni isaanii Lewwonni hamma hojiin sun dhumuttii fi hamma luboonni biraa qulqulleeffamanitti isaan gargaaran; Lewwonni ofii isaanii qulqulleessuutti luboota caalaa gara toloota turaniitii. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Cooma aarsaa nagaa fi dhibaayyuu aarsaa gubamu wajjin dhiʼeeffamu dabalatee aarsaan gubamu akka malee hedduutu ture.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Akkasiin tajaajilli mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah akka duriitti deebiʼe. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hisqiyaasii fi namoonni hundi sababii waan Allaahan saba isaaf godheef ni gammadan; wanni kun dafee taʼeetii.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Hisqiyaas Faasiikaa Ayyaaneffate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Hisqiyaas akka isaan Rabbii Allaah Israaʼeliif Faasiikaa ayyaaneffachuuf jedhanii gara Yerusaalem, gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah dhufaniif Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa hundatti ergaa erge; Efreemii fi Minaaseetti immoo xalayaa barreesse. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Mootichii fi qondaaltonni isaa akkasumas waldaan Yerusaalem keessa jiru hundi jiʼa lammaffaatti Faasiikaa ayyaaneffachuuf murteessan. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Isaan sababii luboonni of qulqulleessan lakkoobsaan gaʼoo hin taʼinii fi sababii namoonni Yerusaalemitti walitti hin qabaminiif yeroo barbaachisaa taʼetti Faasiikaa ayyaaneffachuu hin dandeenye. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Karoorri sunis mootichaa fi waldaa sana guutuu ni gammachiise. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Isaanis akka namoonni Rabbii Allaah Israaʼeliif Faasiikaa ayyaaneffachuuf jedhanii gara Yerusaalem dhufaniif Bersheebaa hamma Daanitti Israaʼel hunda keessa labsii labsuuf murteessan. Ayyaanni Faasiikaa akka barreeffametti iddoo namoonni hedduun jiranitti ayyaaneffamee hin beekuutii.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Ergamoonnis ajaja mootichaatiin xalayaa mootichaa fi qondaaltota isaa biraa ergame fuudhanii guutummaa Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa keessa qajeelan; xalayaan sunis akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 30:6">“Yaa saba Israaʼel, akka inni gara keessan gara warra haftanii harka mootota Asoor jalaa baatan sanaatti deebiʼuuf gara Rabbii Allaah Ibraahim, Allaah Yisihaaqii fi Allaah Israaʼelitti deebiʼaa. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Akka abbootii keessanii fi akka obboloota keessan kanneen inni sababii isaan Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaaniif amanamuu didaniif akkuma isin argitan kana waan fafaa isaan godhe sanaa hin taʼinaa. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Isin akka abbootii keessanii mata jabeeyyii hin taʼinaa; Rabbii Allaahatti harka kennadhaa. Gara iddoo qulqullummaa isaa kan inni bara baraan qulqulleesse sanaa kottaa. Akka dheekkamsi isaa sodaachisaan sun isin irraa deebiʼuuf Rabbii Allaah keessan tajaajilaa. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Sababii Rabbii Allaahan keessan arjaa fi gara laafessa taʼeef isin yoo gara Rabbii Allaahatti deebitan obboloonni keessanii fi ijoolleen keessan warra isaan boojiʼan biratti gara laafina ni argatu; biyya kanattis ni deebiʼu. Isin yoo gara isaatti deebitan inni fuula isaa isin irraa hin garagalfatu.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Ergamoonnis Efreemii fi Minaasee keessa magaalaa tokkoo gara magaalaa kaaniitti naannaʼaa hamma Zebuuloonitti deeman; namoonni garuu isaan tuffatan; itti qoosanis. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Namoonni Aasheer, kan Minaasee fi kan Zebuuloon tokko tokko garuu gad of qabanii Yerusaalem dhaqan. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Akka isaan waan mootichii fi qondaaltonni isaa akkuma dubbii Rabbii Allaahatti ajajanii turan sana hojjetaniif harki Allaaha yaada tokko isaanii kennuuf akkasuma Yihuudaa irra ture.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Tuunni akka malee guddaan tokko jiʼa lammaffaatti Ayyaana Maxinoo ayyaanessuuf Yerusaalem keessatti walitti qabame. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Isaanis iddoowwan aarsaa kanneen Yerusaalem keessa turan bubuqqisanii, iddoowwan aarsaa ixaanaas diiganii geessanii Sulula Qeedroonitti ni gatan.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Guyyaa kudha afuraffaa jiʼa lammaffaattis hoolaa Faasiikaa qalan. Luboonnii fi Lewwonnis qaanaʼanii of qulqulleessuudhaan aarsaa gubamu gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah fidan. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Ergasiis akkuma Seera Muusaa nama Allaaha sanaa keessatti ajajametti iddoo isaaniif ramadame ni qabatan. Luboonnis dhiiga Lewwonni isaanitti kennan sana ni faffacaasan. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Sababii waldaa sana keessaa namoonni hedduun of hin qulqulleessiniif Lewwonni namoota akka seeraatti hin qulqullaaʼinii fi namoota hoolota isaanii Rabbii Allaahaf qulqulleessuu hin dandaʼin hundaaf jedhanii hoolota Faasiikaa ni qalu turan. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Namoota biyya Efreem, Minaasee, Yisaakorii fi Zebuuloonii dhufan hedduu keessaa garri caalu of qulqulleessuu baatan iyyuu isaan waan barreeffameen alatti Faasiikaa nyaatan; Hisqiyaas garuu akkana jedhee Allaah duratti duʼaa godhateef; “Yaa Rabbii Allaah tolaa, <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />nama garaa isaatiin siʼi Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaa barbaaduuf kutate hunda yoo inni akka seera iddoo qulqulluutti qulqullaaʼaa taʼuu baate illee ati araaramiif.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Rabbii Allaahanis duʼaa Hisqiyaas dhagaʼee saba sana ni fayyise.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Israaʼeloonni Yerusaalem keessatti argamanii turan gammachuu guddaadhaan bultii torba Ayyaana Maxinoo ayyaaneffatan; Lewwonnii fi luboonni immoo meeshaalee faarfannaa Rabbii Allaahatiin guyyaa guyyaadhaan Rabbii Allaah galateeffachaa turan.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Hisqiyaasis Lewwota waaʼee tajaajila Rabbii Allaah irratti hubannaa gaarii qaban jajjabeessuudhaan itti dubbate. Isaanis bultii torbanuu waan isaaniif qoodame nyaachaa, aarsaa nagaas dhiʼeessaa Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaaniitiif galata galchan.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Waldaan sun guutuun bultii torba itti dabalee ayyaana sana ayyaaneffachuuf walii gale; kanaafuu isaan bultii torba itti dabalanii gammachuudhaan ayyaaneffatan. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Hisqiyaas mootichi Yihuudaas korommii loonii kuma tokko, hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma torba waldaa sanaaf ni kenne; qondaaltonni isaa immoo korommii loonii kuma tokko, hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma kudhan ni kennan. Luboonni akka malee baayʼeenis of qulqulleessan. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Waldaan Yihuudaa hundi, luboota, Lewwotaa fi namoota Israaʼel keessaa walitti qabaman hunda, akkasumas alagoota Israaʼel keessaa dhufanii fi kanneen Yihuudaa keessa jiraatan hunda wajjin ni gammadan. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Bara Suleyimaan ilma Daawud mooticha Israaʼel jalqabee waan wanni akkasii Yerusaalem keessatti takkumaa hin taʼiniif Yerusaalem keessatti gammachuu guddaatu taʼe. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Ergasiis luboonnii fi Lewwonni kaʼanii saba eebbisan; Allaahanis isaan dhagaʼe; duʼaan isaanii gara Shamaayʼunii, iddoo inni jiraatu qulqulluu sana gaʼeeraatii.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Yommuu wanni kun hundi xumurametti Israaʼeloonni achi turan gara magaalaawwan Yihuudaa dhaqanii dhagaawwan waaqeffannaa caccabsan; siidaawwan Aasheeraa ni kukkutan. Iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa fi iddoowwan aarsaa kanneen Yihuudaa, Biniyaam, Efreemii fi Minaasee keessa turan hunda ni balleessan. Israaʼeloonnis erga waan kana hunda balleessanii booddee gara magaalaawwanii fi qabeenya isaaniitti deebiʼan.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buusii waaqeffannaaf Godhame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 31:20-21">31:20‑21</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 18:5-7">2Mt 18:5‑7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Hisqiyaasis tokkoo tokkoo isaanii akka isaan akkuma hojii lubummaa isaaniitti yookaan akkuma hojii Lewwummaa isaaniitti aarsaa gubamuu fi aarsaa nagaa dhiʼeessaniif, akka isaan karra iddoo Rabbii Allaahan jiraatuu duratti tajaajilaniif, akka isaan galata galchanii fi akka isaan faarfannaa galataa faarfataniif lubootaa fi Lewwota garee gareedhaan ramade. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Mootichis akkuma Seera Rabbii Allaah keessatti barreeffame sanatti, aarsaa gubamu kan ganamaa fi galgalaa akkasumas aarsaa gubamu kan Sanbatootaa, Ayyaana Baatiiwwan Haaraa fi guyyaa ayyaana murteeffameetiif qabeenya ofii isaa irraa ni kenne. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Innis akka luboonnii fi Lewwonni Seera Rabbii Allaahatiif of kennuu dandaʼaniif namoota Yerusaalem keessa jiraatan akka isaan qooda jaraaf malu kennaniif ni ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Akkuma ajajni sun baʼeenis Israaʼeloonni mataa midhaan isaanii kan jalqabaa irraa, daadhii wayinii haaraa irraa, zayitii fi damma irraa akkasumas waan lafa qotiisaa irraa argamu hunda irraa arjummaadhaan kennan. Waan hunda irraa harka kudhan keessaa harka tokko guddisanii ni fidan. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Namoonni Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa warri magaalaawwan Yihuudaa keessa jiraatanis loonii fi bushaayee isaanii irraa harka kudhan keessaa harka tokko, akkasumas waan Rabbii Allaah isaaniitiif qulqulleeffame irraa harka kudhan keessaa harka tokko ni fidan; ni tuulanis. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Isaanis hojii kana jiʼa sadaffaatti jalqabanii jiʼa torbaffaatti fixan. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Hisqiyaasii fi qondaaltonni isaa yommuu dhufanii tuullaawwan sana arganitti Rabbii Allaah ni galateeffatan; saba isaa Israaʼelinis ni eebbisan.<verse eid="2CH 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Hisqiyaasis waaʼee tuullaa sanaa lubootaa fi Lewwota gaafate; <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />maatii Zaadoq keessaa Azaariyaa lubichi hangafni akkana jedhee deebise; “Erga namoonni kennaa isaanii gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti fidduu jalqabanii as nu nyaata gaʼaa fi irraa hafaa arganneerra; sababii Rabbii Allaahan saba isaa eebbiseef hambaan akka malee guddaan kun hafeera.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Hisqiyaasis akka isaan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti mankuusaalee qopheessan ajaje; isaanis ni qopheessan. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Isaanis ergasii buusii, kennaa harka kudhan keessaa harka tokkoo fi kennaawwan qulqulleeffaman amanamummaadhaan fidan. Wantoota kanneen irrattis Konaneyaan Lewwichi itti gaafatamaa ture; obboleessi isaa Shimeʼiin immoo sadarkaadhaan itti aanaa isaa ture. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Yehiiʼeel, Azaziyaa, Nahaati, Asaaheel, Yeriimooti, Yoozaabaad, Eliiʼeel, Yismakiyaa, Mahatii fi Benaayaa, Konaneyaa fi obboleessa isaa Shimeʼii jalatti toʼattoota taʼanii Hisqiyaas mootichaa fi Azaariyaa itti gaafatamaa mana qulqullummaa Allaahatiin muudaman.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Qooraahi ilmi Yimnaa Lewwichi, eegduun Karra Baʼaa sun kennaa fedhiidhaan Allaahaf kenname irratti, akkasumas buusii Rabbii Allaahaf godhamee fi kennaawwan qulqulleeffaman qooduu irratti itti gaafatamummaa qaba ture. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Eeden, Miiniyaamiin, Yeeshuuʼaan, Shemaaʼiyaan, Amariyaa fi Shekaaniyaan magaalaawwan lubootaa keessatti luboota michoota isaaniitiif guddaa fi xinnaa akkuma tokkotti garee garee isaaniitti isaaniif qooduudhaan amanamummaadhaan isa gargaaran.<verse eid="2CH 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Kana malees dhiirota umuriin isaanii waggaa sadii fi sanaa ol taʼe kanneen maqaan isaanii galmee hidda dhalootaa keessa jiru warra akkuma itti gaafatamummaa isaanii fi ramaddii isaaniitti qooda hojii isaanii kan guyyaa guyyaa hojjetamu hojjechuuf mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah seenuu dandaʼan hundaaf akkasuma ni qoodan. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Luboota maatii isaaniitiin galmee hidda dhalootaa keessatti galmeeffamanii fi Lewwota umuriin isaanii waggaa digdamaa fi sanaa ol taʼeefis akkuma itti gaafatamummaa fi qooda hojii isaaniitti ni ramadaniif. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Luboonni kunneen ijoollee isaanii xixinnoo, niitota isaanii, ilmaan isaaniitii fi intallan isaanii kanneen waldaa guutuu keessa jiran hunda wajjin ni galmeeffaman; isaan of qulqulleessuudhaan amanamoo turaniitii.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Luboota sanyiiwwan Haaruun kanneen lafa qotiisaa naannoo magaalaawwan isaanii yookaan magaalaawwan biraa keessa jiraataniif, dhiirota garee isaanii kanneen galmee hidda dhaloota Lewwotaa keessatti galmeeffaman hundaaf akka qoodaniif namoonni filatamanii turan.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Hisqiyaas waan kana guutummaa Yihuudaa keessatti ni hojjete; innis waan fuula Rabbii Allaah isaa duratti gaarii, qajeelaa fi amanamaa taʼe ni hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Innis mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessa hojjechuunis taʼu, seeraa fi ajajawwaniif ajajamuudhaan waan hojjete hunda keessatti Allaah isaa barbaaduudhaaf garaa isaa guutuudhaan ni hojjete; kanaafuu inni ni milkaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Senaaheriib Yerusaalemin Marse</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:9-19">32:9‑19</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 18:17-35">2Mt 18:17‑35</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:2-20">Isa 36:2‑20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:20-21">32:20‑21</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 19:35-37">2Mt 19:35‑37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:36-38">Isa 37:36‑38</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Erga Hisqiyaas waan kana hunda amanamummaadhaan hojjetee booddee Senaaheriib mootichi Asoor dhufee Yihuudaa weerare. Moʼatee isaan qabachuudhaafis magaalaawwan dallaa dhagaa qaban marse. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Hisqiyaasis yommuu akka Senaaheriib dhufee Yerusaalemin loluu barbaade argetti, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />burqaa bishaanii kan magaalaan ala jiru cufuuf qondaaltota isaa fi loltoota isaa wajjin mariʼate; isaanis isa gargaaran. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Namoonni akka malee hedduun walitti qabamanii, “Mootonni Asoor maaliif dhufanii bishaan baayʼee argatan?” jedhanii burqaawwanii fi lageen biyya sana keessa yaaʼan hunda ni cufan. <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Ergasii mootichi jabaatee hojjechuudhaan dallaawwan dhagaa kanneen jijjigan hunda dhaabuudhaan gamoowwan eegumsaa achi irratti ijaare. Isaan alatti immoo dallaawwan biraa ijaaree daangaa Magaalaa Daawud cimse. Akkasumas miʼoota lolaa fi gaachanawwan baayʼee hojjete.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Innis ajajjoota loltootaa uummata irratti muudee oobdii karra magaalaa irratti fuula isaa duratti walitti qabee akkana jedhee isaan jajjabeesse; <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Jabaadhaa; cimaa. Isin sababii mooticha Asoorii fi sababii loltoota akka malee baayʼee kanneen isa wajjin jiran sanaatiif jettanii hin sodaatinaa; humni nu wajjin jiru kan isa wajjin jiru caalaatii. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Kan isa wajjin jiru humna foonii qofaa dha; kan nu wajjin jiru garuu Rabbii Allaah keenya isa nu gargaaruu fi isa lola keenya nuuf loluu dha.” Uummanni dubbii Hisqiyaas mooticha Yihuudaatiin jajjabaate.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Kana booddees Senaaheriib mootichi Asoor utuma loltoota isaa hunda wajjin Laakkiish marsee jiruu, harka ajajjoota loltoota isaatti akkana jedhee gara Yerusaalemitti Hisqiyaasii fi namoota Yihuudaa kanneen achi jiran hundatti ergaa kana erge:<verse eid="2CH 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Senaaheriib mootichi Asoor akkana jedha: Yerusaalem ishee marfamte kana keessa turuun keessan of amanachuu kee maal irratti hundeeffatte? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Hisqiyaas, ‘Rabbii Allaahan keenya harka mootii Asoor jalaa nu baasa’ jechuun isaa akka isin beelaa fi dheebuudhaan dhumtaniif mitii? <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Namni Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalemiin, ‘Isin iddoo aarsaa tokko duratti sagaduu fi isuma irratti aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessuu qabdu’ jedhee iddoowwan sagadaa fi iddoowwan aarsaa Allaah kanaa balleesse Hisqiyaasuma mataa isaa mitii?<verse eid="2CH 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />“Isin waan anii fi abbootiin koo saboota biyyoota biraa hunda goone hin beektanii? Waaqeffatamtoonni saboota sanaa biyya isaanii harka koo jalaa takkumaa baasuu dandaʼaniiruu? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Waaqeffatamtoota abbootiin koo balleessan kanneen hunda keessaa isa kamtu saba isaa harka koo keessaa baasuu dandaʼe? Yoos Allaahan keessan akkamitti harka koo keessaa isin baasuu dandaʼa ree? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Ammas Hisqiyaas akkasitti isin gowwoomsee karaa irraa isin hin jalʼisin. Allaahan saba yookaan mootummaa kamii iyyuu saba isaa harka koo yookaan harka abbootii koo jalaa baasuu hin dandeenyeetii isa hin amaninaa. Allaahan keessan immoo harka kootii isin baasuuf hammam haa yaratu ree!”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Qondaaltonni Senaaheriibis waan kana caalaa hedduu Rabbii Allaah, Allaaha fi Hisqiyaas garbicha isaa irratti ni dubbatan. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Mootichis akkasuma Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel arrabsuudhaan, waan hamaa illee isatti dubbachuudhaan, “Akkuma waaqeffatamtoonni biyyoota biraa saba isaanii harka koo jalaa baasuu hin dandaʼin sana Allaahan Hisqiyaasis saba isaa harka koo jalaa oolchuu hin dandaʼu” jedhee xalayaa barreesse. <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Kana irratti isaan naasisuu fi sodaachisuudhaan magaalaa sana qabachuudhaaf saba Yerusaalem kan dallaa dhagaa irra tureetti afaan Ibraayisxiitiin sagalee isaanii ol fudhatanii iyyan. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Isaan akkuma waaʼee waaqeffatamtoota saboota addunyaa biraa kanneen harka namaatiin hojjetaman sanaa dubbatan sana waaʼee Allaah Yerusaalem dubbatan.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Hisqiyaas Mootichii fi Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyichi ilmi Amoos waaʼee waan kanaatiif duʼaa godhachuudhaan gara shamaayʼuniitti ol iyyan. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Rabbii Allaahanis malaʼikkaa isaa tokko itti erge; malaʼikkaan sunis qubata loltoota mooticha Asoor keessatti loltoota, hooggantootaa fi ajajjoota loltootaa ni balleesse. Kanaafuu mootichi salphinaan gara biyya isaatti deebiʼe. Yeroo inni galma Allaah isaa seenettis ilmaan isaa achumatti goraadeedhaan isa cicciran.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Rabbii Allaahan akkasiin Hisqiyaasii fi namoota Yerusaalem harka Senaaheriib mooticha Asoorii fi harka diinota isaa hundaa jalaa ni baase. Inni karaa hundaan isaan eege. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Namoonni baayʼeenis gara Yerusaalemitti Rabbii Allaahaf aarsaa fidan; Hisqiyaas mooticha Yihuudaatiif immoo kennaa gatii guddaa fidan. Innis yeroo sanaa jalqabee fuula saboota hundaa duratti ulfina argate.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Of tuulummaa, Milkaaʼinaa fi Duʼa Hisqiyaas</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:24-33">32:24‑33</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 20:1-21">2Mt 20:1‑21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:21-38">Isa 37:21‑38</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-8">38:1‑8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Bara sana keessa Hisqiyaas dhukkubsatee duʼuu gaʼe. Innis Rabbii Allaah duratti ni duʼaa godhate; Allaahanis deebii kennee fi mallattoo dinqisiisaa isa argisiise. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Hisqiyaas garuu garaa isaatti of tuule malee waan gaarii isaaf godhameef deebii malu hin kennine; kanaafuu dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah isatti, Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalemitti dhufe. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Kana irratti Hisqiyaas akkuma namoota Yerusaalem sanaa of tuulummaa garaa isaa irraa ni deebiʼe; kanaafuu bara Hisqiyaas keessa dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah isaanitti hin dhufne.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hisqiyaas qabeenya akka malee baayʼee fi ulfina guddaa qaba ture; innis meetii isaaf, warqee isaaf, dhagaawwan isaa gati jabeeyyiif, urgooftuuwwan isaaf, gaachanawwan isaa fi miʼoota garaa garaa kanneen gatii guddaa qaban hundaaf mankuusa ni ijaare. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Akkasumas midhaaniif gombisaa ijaare; daadhii wayinii haaraa fi zayitiidhaaf qodaa itti kuusan qopheesse; loon gosa hundaaf dallaa, bushaayeef immoo gola ni ijaare. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Innis sababii Allaahan badhaadhummaa guddaa isaaf kenneef bushaayee baayʼee, karra loonii hedduus horatee magaalaawwanis ni ijaarrate.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Namni afaan burqaa Giihoon kan olii cufee bishaan isaa gara lixa Magaalaa Daawuditti jalʼise Hisqiyaasuma kana. Hojiin isaa hundis ni milkaaʼeef. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Garuu yeroo bulchitoonni Baabilon waaʼee hojii dinqii kan biyya sanatti hojjetamee isa gaafachuuf ergamoota erganitti Allaahan isa qoruu fi waan garaa isaa keessa jiru ilaaluudhaaf isa dhiise.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Hisqiyaas keessa hojjetaman kanneen biraa fi gaarummaan isaa mulʼata Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyicha ilma Amoos, kitaaba mootota Yihuudaa fi Israaʼel keessatti barreeffamaniiru. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Hisqiyaasis abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee lafa qabrii sanyiiwwan Daawuditti gaara irratti qabbarame. Yeroo inni duʼettis Yihuudaa fi sabni Yerusaalem hundinuu isa kabajan. Ilmi isaa Minaaseen iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Minaasee Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:1-10">33:1‑10</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 21:1-10">2Mt 21:1‑10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:18-20">33:18‑20</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 21:17-18">2Mt 21:17‑18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Minaaseen yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa kudha lama ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa shantamii shan bulche. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Innis waan jibbisiisaa saboota Rabbii Allaahan fuula Israaʼelootaa duraa ariʼee baase sanaa duukaa buʼuudhaan fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan hamaa hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Inni iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen abbaan isaa Hisqiyaas barbadeessee ture sana illee deebisee ni ijaare; akkasumas Baʼaaliif iddoowwan aarsaa tolchee siidaawwan Aasheeraas ni dhaabe. Raayyaawwan shamaayʼun hundaafis ni sagade; isaan waaqeffates. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Innis mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah kan Rabbii Allaahan, “Maqaan koo bara baraan Yerusaalem keessa ni jiraata” jedhee waaʼee isaa dubbate sana keessatti iddoowwan aarsaa tolche. <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Oobdiiwwan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah lamaanuu keessattis raayyaawwan shamaayʼun hundaaf iddoowwan aarsaa ni tolche. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Sulula Ben Hinoomittis ilmaan isaa ibiddaan aarsaa godhee dhiʼeesse; tolchaa fi falfala hojjetee, milkii ilaallatee, ilaaltotaa fi eker dubbistoota gorsa gaafate. Inni fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti hammina guddaa ni hojjetee akkasiin dheekkamsaaf isa kakaase.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Innis fakkii waaqeffatamaa tolfamaa hojjetee ture sana geessee mana qulqullummaa Allaaha kan Allaahan akkana jedhee waaʼee isaa Daawudii fi ilma isaa Suleyimaanitti dubbatee ture sana keessa kaaʼe; “Mana qulqullummaa kana keessaa fi Yerusaalem ishee ani gosoota Israaʼel hunda keessaa filadhe keessa Maqaa koo bara baraan nan dhaaba. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Yoo isaan waan ani waaʼee seera, labsii fi qajeelcha karaa Muusaatiin kenname sanaa isaan ajaje hunda hojjetanii ani siʼachi akka miilli Israaʼelootaa biyya ani abbootii keessaniif kenne keessaa baʼu hin godhu.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Minaaseen Yihuudaa fi namoota Yerusaalem karaa irraa jalʼise; kanaafuu isaan saboota Rabbii Allaahan fuula Israaʼelootaa duraa balleesse sana caalaa hammina hojjetan.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Rabbii Allaahanis Minaasee fi saba isaatti dubbateera; isaan garuu dhagaʼuu hin feene. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan ajajjoota loltoota mootii Asoor isaanitti kaase; isaanis Minaasee qabanii hokkoo funyaanitti kaʼaanii foncaadhaan hidhanii Baabilonitti isa geessan. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Innis lubbamee Rabbii Allaah isaa barbaadee fuula Allaah abbootii isaa duratti akka malee gad of qabe. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Rabbii Allaahanis yeroo inni isa duratti duʼaa godhatetti naʼeefii waammata isaa dhagaʼeef; deebisees gara Yerusaalem mootummaa isaatti isa fide. Minaaseenis ergasii akka Rabbiin Allaah taʼe ni beeke.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Ergasii dallaa Magaalaa Daawud isa alaa, karaa lixa burqaa Giihoon kan sulula keessaa gaara Oofeelitti naannessee hamma Karra Qurxummiitti ni haaromse; dallaa kanas akka malee ol dheeresse. Magaalaawwan Yihuudaa kanneen dallaa jabaa qaban hunda keessas ajajjoota waraanaa ni qubachiise.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Innis waaqeffatamtoota ormaa fi fakkiiwwan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessaa ni balleesse; akkasumas iddoowwan aarsaa kanneen inni gaarran mana qulqullummaa irraa fi Yerusaalem keessatti tolche hundas ni diige; magaalaa keessaas baasee ni gate. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaah deebisee dhaabee aarsaa nagaa fi aarsaa galataa irratti ni dhiʼeesse; akka isaan Rabbii Allaah Israaʼel tajaajilaniif namoota Yihuudaa ni ajaje. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Taʼus sabni ittuma fufee iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa keessatti aarsaa dhiʼeesse; garuu uummanni sun Rabbii Allaah isaa qofaaf aarsaa dhiʼeessaa ture.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Minaasee keessa hojjetaman kanneen biraa, duʼaan inni Allaah isaa duratti godhatee fi dubbii inni namoota waa arganii himan maqaa Rabbii Allaah Israaʼeliin isatti himan dabalatee seenaa mootota Israaʼel keessatti barreeffameera. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Duʼaan isaatii fi akki Allaahan itti garaa laafeefii duʼaa isaa dhagaʼeef, cubbuun inni hojjete hundii fi amanamummaa dhabuun isaa, akkasumas utuu gad of hin qabin dura iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa ijaaruun isaa, siidaawwan Aasheeraa fi waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo dhaabuun isaa hundi galmeewwan namoota waa arganii himanii keessatti barreeffamaniiru. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Minaaseenis abbootii isaa wajjin boqotee masaraa mootummaa isaa keessatti qabbarame. Ilmi isaa Aamoonis iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aamoon Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:21-25">33:21‑25</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 21:19-24">2Mt 21:19‑24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Aamoon yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa digdamii lama ture. Innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa lama bulche. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Innis akkuma abbaan isaa Minaaseen hojjetee ture sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan hamaa hojjete. Aamoon waaqeffatamtoota Minaaseen tolche waaqeffate; hunda isaaniitifis aarsaa dhiʼeesse. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Inni garuu akka abbaa isaa Minaasee fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti gad of hin qabne; Aamoon ittuma caalchisee yakka hojjete.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Qondaaltonni Amoon isatti mariʼatanii masaruma mootummaa isaa keessatti isa ajjeesan. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Kana irratti namoonni biyya sanaa warra Aamoon Mootichatti malatan hunda fixanii ilma isaa Yosiyaasin immoo iddoo isaa mootii godhatan.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Geeddarama Yosiyaas Fide</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:1-2">34:1‑2</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">2Mt 22:1‑2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:3-7">34:3‑7</ref> kwi – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 23:4-20">2Mt 23:4‑20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:8-13">34:8‑13</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 22:3-7">2Mt 22:3‑7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Yosiyaas yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa saddeetii ture; Yerusaalem keessa taaʼees waggaa soddomii tokko bulche. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Inni fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti waan qajeelaa ni hojjete; utuu mirgatti yookaan bitaatti hin gorinis karaa abbaa isaa Daawud irra deeme.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Inni mootii taʼee waggaa saddeettaffaatti utuma umurii dargaggummaa keessa jiruu Allaah abbaa isaa Daawud barbaaduu jalqabe. Waggaa kudha lammaffaatti immoo Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem keessaa iddoowwan sagadaa kanneen gaarran irraa, siidaawwan Aasheeraa, waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo fi fakkiiwwan baqfamanii tolfaman ni balleesse. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Qajeelfama isaatiinis iddoowwan aarsaa Baʼaal diigaman; iddoowwan aarsaa ixaanaa kanneen achi irra turan caccabsee siidaawwan Aasheeraa, waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo fi fakkiiwwan hurreesse. Wantoota kanneenis daakee bulleessee qabrii warra isaaniif aarsaa dhiʼeessaa turanii irratti bittinneesse. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Lafee lubootaas iddoowwan aarsaa isaanii irratti guggube. Haala kanaanis Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalemin qulqulleesse. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Magaalaawwan Minaasee, kan Efreemii fi Simiʼoon kanneen hamma Niftaalemitti jiranii fi akkasumas diigamaa naannoowwan isaanii keessatti <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />iddoowwan aarsaa fi siidaawwan Aasheeraa ni jijjigse; waaqeffatamtoota tolfamoo daaraa godhe; iddoowwan aarsaa ixaanaa kanneen guutummaa Israaʼel keessa jiran hundas ni caccabse. Ergasiis Yerusaalemitti deebiʼe.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Yosiyaas mootii taʼee waggaa kudha saddeettaffaatti erga biyyattii fi mana qulqullummaa qulqulleessee booddee mana Rabbii Allaah isaa haaromsuuf Shaafaan ilma Azaliyaa, Maʼaseyaa bulchaa magaalaa fi Yooʼaa ilma Yooʼaahaaz galmeessaa sana erge.<verse eid="2CH 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Isaanis gara Hilqiyaa lubicha ol aanaa dhaqanii maallaqa mana qulqullummaa Allaahatiif fidame sana itti kennan; maallaqa kanas Lewwota balbala eegantu saboota Minaasee irraa, kan Efreem irraa, hambaawwan Israaʼel hunda irraa, saba Yihuudaa fi kan Biniyaam hunda irraa akkasumas jiraattota Yerusaalem irraa walitti qabe. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Isaanis maallaqa sana namoota akka hojii mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah toʼataniif muudamanitti imaanaa kennan. Namoonni kunneenis hojjettoota mana qulqullummaa haaromsanii akka duriitti deebisaniif ni kaffalu. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Akkasumas akka isaan ijaarsa mootonni Yihuudaa akka diigamu godhan sanaaf dhagaa soofame, laaxaawwan, mukkeen sutaa fi dareeraawwan bitaniif ogeeyyii mukaa fi ijaartotatti maallaqa kennan.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Namoonni sunis amanamummaadhaan hojicha hojjetan. Lewwota sanyii Meraarii keessaa Yahaatii fi Obaadiyaan akkasumas sanyii Qohaati keessaa Zakariyaa fi Meshulaam akka jara sana hojjechiisaniif isaan irratti muudaman. Lewwonni meeshaa faarfannaa taphachuu beekan hundis <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />itti gaafatamtoota hojjettoota hojii humnaa taʼanii hojjettoota hojii garaa garaa illee toʼachaa turan. Lewwonni tokko tokkos barreessitoota, qondaaltotaa fi eegdota balbalaa turan.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitaabni Seeraa Argamuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:14-28">34:14‑28</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 22:8-20">2Mt 22:8‑20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:29-32">34:29‑32</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 23:1-3">2Mt 23:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Utuma isaan maallaqa mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti galfame sana baasaa jiranuu Hilqiyaa lubichi Kitaaba Seera Rabbii Allaah kan karaa Muusaatiin kenname sana arge. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilqiyaanis Shaafaan barreessaa sanaan, “Ani mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti Kitaaba Seeraa argeen jira” jedhe; kitaabichas Shaafaanitti kenne.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Shaafaanis kitaabicha fuudhee mootichatti geessee akkana jedhe; “Qondaaltonni kee waan ajajaman hunda hojjechaa jiru. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Maallaqa mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessa tures baasanii namoota hojii toʼatanii fi hojjettootatti imaanaa kennaniiru.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Kana irrattis Shaafaan barreessaan sun, “Hilqiyaa lubichi kitaaba tokko natti kenneera” jedhee mootichatti hime. Shaafaanis fuula mootichaa duratti kitaaba sana dubbise.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Mootichis yommuu dubbii Seeraa sana dhagaʼetti uffata isaa tarsaase. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Innis ajaja kana Hilqiyaatti, Ahiiqaam ilma Shaafaanitti, Abdoon ilma Miikaatti, Shaafaan barreessichaa fi Asaayaa tajaajilaa mootichaatti ni kenne: <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Dhaqaatii waaʼee waan kitaaba argame kana keessatti barreeffamee anaaf, hambaawwan Israaʼel keessaatii fi Yihuudaatiif Rabbii Allaah gaafadhaa. Sababii warri nuun duraa dubbii Rabbii Allaah hin eeginiif dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah guddaan nutti dhangalaʼeera; isaan akka waan kitaaba kana keessatti barreeffame sana hundaatti hin jiraanneetii.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Hilqiyaa fi warri mootichi isa wajjin erge sun gara Huldaanaa nabiiʼiyyittii jechuunis niitii Shaluum ilma Toqeʼaati, ilma Hasraat kan eegduu mana uffataa turte sanatti himuu dhaqan. Isheenis Yerusaalem keessa aanaa lammaffaa keessa jiraatti turte.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Isheenis akkana isaaniin jette; “Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel akkana jedha: Namicha natti isin erge sanatti akkana jedhaa himaa; <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />‘Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha: Ani iddoo kanaa fi saba isaatti badiisa jechuunis abaarsa kitaaba fuula mootii Yihuudaa duratti dubbifame sana keessatti barreeffame hunda nan fida. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Sababii isaan na dhiisanii waaqeffatamtoota biraatiif ixaana aarsuudhaan waan harki isaanii tolche hundaan dheekkamsaaf na kakaasaniif dheekkamsi koo iddoo kana irratti ni dhangalaʼa; hin dhaamus.’ <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Mootii Yihuudaa kan akka isin Rabbii Allaah gaafattaniif isin erge sanatti akkana jedhaatii himaa; ‘Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel waaʼee dubbii ati dhageesse sanaa akkana jedha: <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Sababii ati yeroo waan inni waaʼee iddoo kanaatii fi waaʼee saba isaa waan hamaa dubbate dhageessetti garaan kee tuqamee fuula Allaaha duratti gad of qabdeef, sababii ati fuula koo duratti gad of qabdee, uffata kee tarsaaftee boosseef ani si dhagaʼeera, jedha Rabbii Allaahan. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Ani amma abbootii kee biratti walittin si qaba; atis nagumaan qabbaramta. Waan hamaa ani iddoo kanaa fi warra as jiraatanitti fiduuf jiru hunda iji kee hin argu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Isaanis deebii ishee fudhatanii gara mootichaatti deebiʼan.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Ergasiis mootichi maanguddoota Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem hunda walitti ni waame. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Innis namoota Yihuudaa, jiraattota Yerusaalem, lubootaa fi Lewwota wajjin jechuunis nama xinnaa fi guddaa hunda wajjin gara mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaahatti ol baʼe. Dubbii Kitaaba Kakuu kan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessatti argame sanaa hundas akka isaan dhagaʼanitti dubbiseef. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Mootichis utubaa isaa bira dhaabatee akka Rabbii Allaah duukaa buʼu, akka garaa isaa guutuu fi lubbuu isaa guutuudhaan ajaja isaa, dambiiwwan isaatii fi labsiiwwan isaa eegee, dubbiiwwan kakuu kanneen kitaaba kana keessatti barreeffamaniifis akka ajajamu fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti kakuu ni haaromse.<verse eid="2CH 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Ergasiis akka namni Yerusaalemii fi Biniyaam keessa jiraatu hundi kakuu galu ni godhe; namoonni Yerusaalemis akkuma kakuu Allaaha jechuunis Allaah abbootii isaaniitti waan kana ni godhan.<verse eid="2CH 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Yosiyaasis guutummaa biyya Israaʼel keessaa waaqeffatamtoota jibbisiisoo ni balleesse; akka warri Israaʼel keessa jiran hundinuus Rabbii Allaah isaanii waaqeffatan ni godhe. Isaan hamma inni lubbuun jiraatetti Rabbii Allaah abbootii isaanii duukaa buʼuu irraa duubatti hin deebine.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yosiyaas Faasiikaa Ayyaaneffachuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 35:1">35:1</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 35:18-19">18‑19</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2Mt 23:21‑23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Yosiyaas Yerusaalemitti Rabbii Allaahaf Faasiikaa ayyaanesse; hoolaan Faasiikaas guyyaa kudha afuraffaa jiʼa jalqabaatti qalame. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Innis luboota hojii isaanii irratti muudee akka isaan mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah keessa tajaajilan isaan jajjabeesse. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Lewwota Israaʼeloota hunda barsiisanii fi Rabbii Allaahaf qulqullaaʼaniinis akkana jedhe; “Taabota qulqullaaʼaa sana mana qulqullummaa kan Suleyimaan ilmi Daawud mooticha Israaʼel ijaare keessa kaaʼaa. Taabonni kun gatiittii keessanitti hin baatamin. Isin amma Rabbii Allaah keessanii fi saba isaa Israaʼelin tajaajilaa. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Akkuma qajeelfama Daawud mooticha Israaʼelii fi ilma isaa Suleyimaaniin barreeffame sanaatti isin akkuma maatiiwwan keessaniitti garee gareedhaan of qopheessaa.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />“Kutaa maatiiwwan obboloota keessanii kanneen Lewwota hin taʼiniitiif gareen Lewwotaa tokko kutaa maatii tokkoo iddoo buʼaatii iddoo qulqulluu dhaabadhaa. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Hoolaa Faasiikaa qalaa; of qulqulleessaatii obboloota keessaniifis xobbaallaawwan hoolaa qopheessaa; waan kanas akkuma Rabbii Allaahan karaa Muusaatiin ajaje sanatti godhaa.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Yosiyaasis hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma soddomaa fi loon kuma sadii akka aarsaa Faasiikaa taʼaniif namoota achi turan hundaaf qabeenyuma isaa irraa ni kenne.<verse eid="2CH 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Qondaaltonni isaas uummataaf, lubootaa fi Lewwotaaf fedhiidhaan buusii kennan. Hilqiyaa, Zakariyaa fi Yehiiʼeel bulchitoonni mana qulqullummaa Allaaha aarsaa Faasiikaatiif hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma lamaa dhibba jaʼaa fi loon dhibba sadii lubootatti kennan. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Konaneyaanis obboloota isaa Shemaaʼiyaa fi Naatnaaʼel wajjin, akkasumas Hashabiyaan, Yeʼiiʼeelii fi Yoozaabaad dura buutonni Lewwotaa sun hoolotaa fi reʼoota kuma shanii fi loon dhibba shan akka isaan aarsaa Faasiikaa taʼaniif Lewwotatti ni kennan.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Wanni hundinuu qopheeffamnaan akkuma mootichi ajaje sanatti luboonni iddoo isaanii ijaajjan; Lewwonnis toora isaaniitiin ijaajjan. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Hoolonni Faasiikaa ni qalaman; luboonnis dhiiga itti kenname ni faffacaasan; Lewwonni immoo hoolota irraa gogaa ni baasan. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Isaanis akka jarri akkuma Kitaaba Muusaa keessatti barreeffame sanatti Rabbii Allaahaf dhiʼeessaniif kutaa maatiiwwan sabaatiif kennuudhaaf aarsaa gubamu kophaatti baasan. Loon illee akkasuma godhan. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Akkuma ajajame sanattis hoolaa Faasiikaa ibiddaan waadan; aarsaa qulqulleeffame immoo okkoteetti, hubboo fi xuwweetti affeelanii yoosuma namoota hundaaf qoqqoodan. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Isaanis ergasii sababii luboonni sanyiin Haaruun hamma halkan walakkaatti aarsaa gubamuu fi cooma aarsaa dhiʼeessaa turaniif ofii isaaniitii fi lubootaaf qophii godhan. Akkasiin Lewwonni ofii isaaniitii fi luboota sanyii Haaruun taʼaniif qopheessan.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Ilmaan Asaaf faarfattoonni akkuma Daawud, Asaaf, Heemaanii fi Yeduutuun waa himaan mootichaa ajajan sana iddoodhuma isaaniif ramadame turan. Eegdonni karraa kanneen tokkoo tokkoo karraa irra turan immoo waan obboloota isaanii Lewwonni qophii isaaniif godhaniif iddoo isaaniitii deemuun hin barbaachifne.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Kanaafuu tajaajilli Rabbii Allaah hundinuu akkuma Yosiyaas Mootichi ajajetti ayyaana Faasiikaa ayyaanessuu fi iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaah irratti aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessuun guyyuma sana fiixaan baʼe. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Israaʼeloonni achi turanis yeruma sana Ayyaana Faasiikaa ayyaaneffatanii Ayyaana Maxinoo guyyaa torba ayyaaneffatan. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Bara Saamuʼeel nabiiʼiyyichaatii as Israaʼel keessatti Faasiikaan takkumaa akkanatti hin ayyaaneffamne; mootota Israaʼel keessaas namni tokko iyyuu takkumaa akka Yosiyaas namicha luboota, Lewwotaa fi namoota Yihuudaa fi Israaʼel kanneen saba Yerusaalem wajjin turan sana hunda wajjin godhe sanaatti Faasiikaa akkasii hin ayyaaneffanne. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Faasiikaan kun bara mootummaa Yosiyaas keessaa waggaa kudha saddeettaffaatti ayyaaneffame.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosiyaas Duʼuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 35:20-36:1">35:20–36:1</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 23:28-30">2Mt 23:28‑30</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Waan kana hunda booddee yeroo Yosiyaas mana qulqullummaa qopheessetti Nekkoon mootichi Gibxi Karkemiishi ishee Efraaxiis biraa sanatti lolaaf ol baʼe; Yosiyaasis of irraa isa deebisuudhaaf itti gad baʼe. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Nekkoon garuu, “Yaa mootii Yihuudaa, wanni anaa fi siʼi wal lolchiisu maali? Ani yeroo kanatti mana na lolu sana loluufin dhufe malee si loluuf hin dhufne. Allaahan akka ani ariifadhu na ajajeera; kanaafuu ati Allaah na wajjin jiru kanaan mormuu dhiisi; yoo kanaa achii inni si balleessaatii” jedhee namoota itti erge.<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Taʼus Yosiyaas eenyumaa ofii isaa wallaalchifatee lola keessa seene malee isa irraa hin deebine. Inni waan Nekkoon Allaahan ajajamee isatti hime sana dhagaʼuu didee dirree Megidoo irratti isa waraanuudhaaf baʼe.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Warri xiyya darbatan Yosiyaas Mootichatti ni darbatan; innis ajajjoota loltoota isaatiin, “Na fuudhaatii deemaa; ani akka malee madaaʼeeraatii” jedhe. <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Kanaafuu isaan gaarii isaa keessaa isa fuudhanii gaarii biraa irra kaaʼanii gara Yerusaalemitti isa geessan; innis achitti duʼe. Innis qabrii abbootii isaa keessatti qabbarame; Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem hundi isaaf ni booʼan.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Ermiyaasis faaruu booʼichaa Yosiyaasiif baase; hamma harʼaattis dhiironnii fi dubartoonni faarfattoonni hundi faaruu booʼichaa kanaan Yosiyaasin yaadatu. Kunis Israaʼel keessatti bartee taʼee Faaruu Booʼichaa keessatti barreeffame.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Wanni bara mootummaa Yosiyaas keessa hojjetame biraa fi gaarummaan isaa akkuma waan Seera Rabbii Allaah keessatti barreeffame sanaatti, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />seenaan isaa hundi jalqabaa hamma dhumaatti kitaaba mootota Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa keessatti barreeffameera.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Ergasiis sabni biyya sanaa Yehooʼaahaaz ilma Yosiyaas fuudhanii Yerusaalem keessatti iddoo abbaa isaa buusanii mootii isa godhan.<verse eid="2CH 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yooʼaahaaz Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:2-4">36:2‑4</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 23:31-34">2Mt 23:31‑34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yehooʼaahaaz yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa digdamii sadii ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee jiʼa sadii bulche. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Mootiin Gibxi immoo Yerusaalem keessatti teessoo isaa irraa isa buuse; Yihuudaa irrattis gibira meetii taalaantii dhibba tokkoo fi warqee taalaantii tokko mure. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Mootiin Gibxis Eliiyaaqiim obboleessa Yehooʼaahaaz Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem irratti mootii godhe; innis maqaa Eliiyaaqiim geeddaree Yehooyaaqiim jedheen. Nekkoonis Yoʼahaz obboleessa Eliiyaaqiim fuudhee Gibxitti geesse.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehooyaaqiim Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">36:5‑8</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2Mt 23:36–24:6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Yehooyaaqiim yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa digdamii shan ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa kudha tokko bulche. Inni fuula Rabbii Allaah isaa duratti waan hamaa hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Nebukadnezar mootichi Baabilon isatti duule; gara Baabilonittis isa geessuudhaaf foncaa naasiitiin isa hidhe. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadnezar miʼoota mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah guuree Baabilonitti geessee mana waaqeffannaa isaa keessa ni kaaʼe.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Wantoonni bara mootummaa Yehooyaaqiim keessa hojjetaman kanneen biraa, wanni jibbisiisaan inni hojjetee fi balleessaan isa irratti argame hundi kitaaba seenaa mootota Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa keessatti barreeffamaniiru. Ilmi isaa Yehooyaakiin iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehooyaakiin Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">36:9‑10</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">2Mt 24:8‑17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yehooyaakiin yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa kudha saddeet ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee jiʼa sadii fi bultii kudhan bulche. Fuula Rabbii Allaah durattis waan hamaa hojjete. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Birraa keessas Nebukadnezar Mootichi nama itti ergee miʼoota mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah kanneen gatii guddaa qaban wajjin gara Baabilon isa fichisiise; Zedeqiyaa obboleessa abbaa Yehooyaakiin sana immoo Yihuudaa fi Yerusaalem irratti mootii godhe.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zedeqiyaa Mooticha Yihuudaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:11-16">36:11‑16</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2Mt 24:18‑20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3">Erm 52:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Zedeqiyaa yeroo mootii taʼetti nama waggaa digdamii tokkoo ture; innis Yerusaalem keessa taaʼee waggaa kudha tokko bulche. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Inni fuula Rabbii Allaah isaa duratti waan hamaa ni hojjete; fuula Ermiyaas nabiiʼiyyicha dubbii Rabbii Allaah isatti dubbate sanaa durattis gad of hin qabne. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Akkasumas Nebukadnezar Mooticha maqaa Allaahatiin isa kakachiisee turetti illee ni fincile. Inni mataa jabaatee gara Rabbii Allaah Israaʼelitti deebiʼuu ni dide. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Kana malees dura buutonni lubootaa hundii fi uummanni wantoota jibbisiisoo saboota kaanii hunda duukaa buʼuu fi mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaah kan inni Yerusaalem keessatti qulqulleesse sana xureessuudhaan ittuma caalchisanii amanamummaa dhaban.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufaatii Yerusaalem</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:17-20">36:17‑20</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-21">2Mt 25:1‑21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4-27">Erm 52:4‑27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:22-23">36:22‑23</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-3">Izr 1:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />Rabbii Allaahan abbootii isaanii waan saba isaa fi iddoo jireenya isaaf garaa laafeef karaa ergamoota isaatiin ammumaa amma ergaa itti erge. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Isaan garuu ergamoota Allaahatti qoosan; dubbii isaas tuffatanii nabiiʼiyyoota isaa xinneessan. Kanaanis dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah saba isaatti ni buʼe; wanni isa qabbaneessus hin argamne. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Kanaafuu inni mootii warra Baabilon isaanitti fide; mootichis mana qulqullummaa keessatti dargaggoota isaanii goraadeedhaan fixe; dargaggoota yookaan dubara, jaarsolii yookaan warra dullooman tokko illee hin hambifne. Allaahan hunda isaanii dabarsee harka Nebukadnezaritti kenne. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Innis mana qulqullummaa Allaahatii miʼoota hunda xinnaa fi guddaa, qabeenya mana qulqullummaa Rabbii Allaaha, qabeenya mootichaa fi kan qondaaltota isaa saamee Baabilonitti geesse. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Isaan mana qulqullummaa Allaahatti ibidda qabsiisanii dallaa Yerusaalem diigan; masaraawwan mootummaa hunda gubanii waan gatii qabu hundas barbadeessan.<verse eid="2CH 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Inni hambaa goraadee irraa hafe boojiʼee Baabilonitti geesse; isaanis hamma mootummaan Faares aangoo qabatetti tajaajiltoota isaa fi tajaajiltoota ilmaan isaa taʼan. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Biyyattiin boqonnaa sanbata ishee ni argatte; akka dubbiin Rabbii Allaah kan afaan Ermiyaasiin dubbatame raawwatamuuf hamma waggaan torbaatamni dhumutti biyyattiin yeroo ontee turte guutuu ni boqotte.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Rabbii Allaahan akka dubbiin Rabbii Allaah kan afaan Ermiyaasiin dubbatame sun raawwatamuuf jedhee bara Qiiros mooticha Faares keessa waggaa jalqabaatti akka inni mootummaa isaa hunda keessa labsii tokko dabarsuu fi akka labsiin sunis barreeffamuuf hafuura Qiiros mooticha Faares ni kakaase; labsiin sunis akkana jedha:<verse eid="2CH 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Qiiros mootichi Faares akkana jedha:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 36:23">“ ‘Rabbii Allaahan shamaayʼun mootummoota lafa irraa hunda naaf kenneera; akka ani Yihuudaa keessatti Yerusaalemitti mana qulqullummaa isaaf ijaaruufis na muudeera. Saba isaa keessaa nama gidduu keessanitti argamu kam iyyuu Rabbii Allaahan isaa isa wajjin haa taʼu; innis ol haa baʼu.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>